ks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Database Management & Information Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= WHY CHOOSE ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#CC0066; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">⭐</span> Why Choose INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Final decision within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Global visibility and higher citations.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication:</strong> From submission to publication with quick turnaround.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Strict and transparent screening.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliant:</strong> Follows global publishing ethics.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>High Impact Research:</strong> Encourages real-world applications and innovation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= FEATURES ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009966; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">🔍</span> INDJCST Journal Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed and refereed</li>\r\n  <li>Easy, transparent, and fast publication</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism checking</li>\r\n  <li>High visibility & indexing</li>\r\n  <li>COPE publication ethics</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons BY-NC-ND license</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed editorial board</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid / Fast-Track publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= INDEXING ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF6600; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">📚</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\r\nINDJCST is recognized as one of the trustworthy <strong>low cost Computer Science journals in India</strong> due to its presence in multiple leading indexing platforms:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"columns:2; margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= PUBLICATION PROCESS ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3366FF; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">⚙️</span> Our Streamlined Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission system</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Acknowledgment:</strong> Within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Peer Review:</strong> Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Final Decision:</strong> Acceptance or rejection in 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Publication:</strong> Instant PDF & certificate issued</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= APC ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#CC3300; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">💰</span> Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\r\nBeing one of the most affordable and <strong>low cost Computer Science journals in India</strong>, INDJCST ensures minimal APC for authors:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\n      Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br>\r\n      With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= EDITORIAL SYSTEM ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0099CC; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">🖥️</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized author dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time paper tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated acceptance letters</li>\r\n  <li>Instant downloads for certificates and published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= CTA ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:40px; color:#6600CC;\">\r\nReady to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:20px;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" \r\n     target=\"_blank\"\r\n     style=\"background:#6600CC; color:#fff; padding:14px 28px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold;\">\r\n     Start Submission Today\r\n  </a>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>','Low Cost Computer Science Journals in India | Fast & UGC CARE Referenced','low-cost-computer-science-journals-in-india-fast-ugc-care-referenced','Journal','Low Cost Computer Science Journals in India | Fast & UGC CARE Referenced','Looking for Low Cost Computer Science Journals in India? INDJCST offers fast publication, rapid peer review, Google Scholar indexing, UGC CARE guidelines, and affordable APC for Computer Science researchers.','Low Cost Computer Science Journals in India | Fast & UGC CARE Referenced'),(6,'2025-06-24 04:33:17','2025-12-03 04:09:19','blog/Cy8rTzhuTHp1SJwDq92VWmtdy5EWZIYWZXIoy04C.jpg','<p><strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputed, peer-reviewed, open-access journal published three times a year. It promotes research in Computer Science, Information Technology, IoT, Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Data Science.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>INDJCST provides a scholarly platform that bridges academia and industry by inviting original research contributions in advanced and emerging technologies related to engineering and computing sciences.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #673ab7, #512da8); color: white; padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px;\">\r\n🚀 Why Choose INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>⏱ Rapid Review:</strong> Peer review completed within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>🌍 Open Access:</strong> Global visibility and accessibility for your research.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>⚙️ Efficient Workflow:</strong> Seamless handling from submission to publication.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>🔐 Plagiarism Checks:</strong> Ensures originality and integrity of each submission.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>✅ COPE Standards:</strong> Complies with ethical guidelines for quality publishing.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>📢 Real-World Impact:</strong> Encourages research that drives innovation and social benefit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #00bcd4, #0097a7); color: white; padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px;\">\r\n📖 Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left: 15px; columns: 2;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters - Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n  <li>Crossref (DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #43a047, #2e7d32); color: white; padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px;\">\r\n🔄 Publication Workflow\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #2e7d32;\">📬 Submit Online</h3>\r\n<p>Upload manus