\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:26px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Journal of Machine Learning Research</strong> is an increasingly preferred choice for scholars seeking\r\n<strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong>, and high visibility in the field of Machine Learning.\r\nFor many researchers in India, the <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> has emerged as\r\na reliable alternative, offering Google Scholar indexing, UGC CARE–aligned ethical standards, and instant PDF access.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:26px;\">\r\nAs Machine Learning continues to transform industries, INDJCST provides an excellent academic platform to publish\r\nresearch aligned with modern technologies including AI, ML algorithms, deep learning, neural networks, IoT, cloud,\r\nand computational intelligence. Its <strong>fast publication workflow</strong> and <strong>affordable fees</strong> make it ideal for students,\r\nPh.D. candidates, and industry professionals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== JOURNAL SCOPE ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0066CC; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">🤖</span> Machine Learning Research Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li>Supervised & Unsupervised Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Neural Networks (CNN, RNN, LSTM)</li>\r\n  <li>Deep Learning & Reinforcement Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Predictive Modelling & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Machine Learning for IoT & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>ML for Cybersecurity, Cloud & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing (NLP)</li>\r\n  <li>Generative AI & LLM-based research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== INDJCST INTRO ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#CC0066; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">📘</span> INDJCST – A Trusted ML Publication Platform\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:26px;\">\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable,\r\nopen-access, peer-reviewed platform for multidisciplinary computer science research, including\r\n<strong>Machine Learning research papers</strong>. It follows a rigorous review process and adheres to\r\nUGC-CARE publication ethics, making it a credible journal for ML research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== TOPICS ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009966; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">📊</span> Core Computer Science & ML Topics\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>IoT, Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Programming Languages & Software Engineering</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== WHY CHOOSE INDJCST ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF6600; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">🚀</span> Why Choose INDJCST for ML Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> – Decision within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost</strong> fees: ₹1200–₹1400 for Indian authors</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication</strong> – ML paper published within days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access</strong> – Global access to your research</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Google Scholar Indexed</strong> visibility</li>\r\n  <li>COPE Compliant – Ethical publishing</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF & digital certificate</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== INDEXING ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9933FF; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">📚</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU & Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub & DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB, SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT, Exlibris</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar, Dimensions, PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== PUBLICATION PROCESS ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0088CC; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">⚡</span> Fast & Transparent Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>24/7 Submission</strong> through the online system</li>\r\n  <li><strong>12-hour Acknowledgment</strong> after submission</li>\r\n  <li><strong>2-day Peer Review</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>3-day Final Decision</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Instant PDF</strong> after publication</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Digital Certificate</strong> available immediately</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== APC ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#CC0000; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">💰</span> Publication Fee (Low Cost)\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li>Indian Authors (Without DOI): ₹1200 + GST</li>\r\n  <li>Indian Authors (With DOI): ₹1400 + GST</li>\r\n  <li>International Authors: $60 with DOI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== SYSTEM ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#006699; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">🖥️</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time ML paper status tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated acceptance letters & copyright forms</li>\r\n  <li>One-click downloads for certificates & PDFs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== CTA ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:40px; color:#6600CC;\">\r\nPublish Your Machine Learning Research Today\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:center; margin-