y decision</strong> through rapid peer review</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low cost</strong> publication fees</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast publication</strong> with open-access visibility</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Google Scholar indexed</strong> platform</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism checks</li>\r\n  <li>COPE publication ethics</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF & digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== INDEXING ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9933FF; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">📚</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU & Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub & DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB & SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT, Exlibris</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar & Dimensions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== PROCESS ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0088CC; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">⚡</span> Fast Publication Workflow\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li>Online Submission – 24/7</li>\r\n  <li>12-hour acknowledgment</li>\r\n  <li>2-day peer review</li>\r\n  <li>3-day acceptance/rejection</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF & certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== FEES ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#CC0000; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">💰</span> Low Cost Publication Fee\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li>Indian Authors (No DOI): ₹1200 + GST</li>\r\n  <li>Indian Authors (With DOI): ₹1400 + GST</li>\r\n  <li>International Authors: $60</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== DASHBOARD ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#006699; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:28px;\">🖥️</span> Advanced Editorial System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:32px;\">\r\n  <li>Author dashboard for submissions</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time tracking of ML paper progress<