rkflow\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:34px;\">\r\n  <li>Submit your paper anytime (24×7 portal)</li>\r\n  <li>Acknowledgment mailed within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Expert review completed in 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Acceptance/Rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Instant publication after fee payment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== FEES ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#CC6600; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:30px;\">💰</span> Low Publication Fee Structure\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:34px;\">\r\n  <li>Indian Authors: ₹1200 (No DOI) / ₹1400 (With DOI) + GST</li>\r\n  <li>International Authors: $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== CTA BUTTON ===== -->\r\n<div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:40px;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\"\r\n     target=\"_blank\"\r\n     style=\"background:#0066AA; padding:14px 36px; \r\n            color:#fff; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; \r\n            font-weight:bold;\">\r\n     Publish in Low-Cost Software Engineering Journal\r\n  </a>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>','Low Cost Journal for Software Engineering Publication','low-cost-journal-for-software-engineering-publication','Journal','Low Cost Journal for Software Engineering Publication','Find the best low cost journal for Software Engineering publication with fast review, rapid publication, and Google Scholar indexing.','Low Cost Journal for Software Engineering Publication'),(100,'2025-06-26 10:35:40','2025-12-04 09:58:22','blog/HntC1ETV3JA2X6ylLPNJuq2pxRX7QSJDompHT5NE.jpg','<div style=\"font-family:Arial; font-size:18px; line-height:1.7;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\nLow-Cost Fast Publication in Computer Science – INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a trusted, open-access platform offering <strong>low-cost fast publication in Computer Science</strong>. With rapid review, transparent processes, and high-quality editorial standards, INDJCST is widely chosen by academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\nThe journal follows <strong>UGC CARE guidelines</strong>, ensuring every manuscript undergoes a rigorous peer-review process. Its mission is to support the global research community with ethical, efficient, and <strong>rapid publication</strong> workflows while maintaining scholarly excellence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== RESEARCH AREAS ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0066CC; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:30px;\">📘</span> Research Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:34px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing (NLP)</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction (HCI)</li>\r\n  <li>Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Database & Information Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== WHY INDJCST ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#CC0066; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:30px;\">⚡</span> Why Choose INDJCST for Fast & Low-Cost Publication?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:34px;\">\r\n  <li>Rapid peer review with decisions issued in <strong>3 days</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low-cost publication</strong> suitable for students & researchers</li>\r\n  <li>Immediate open-access availability</li>\r\n  <li>Google Scholar indexing ensures global visibility</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism screening and COPE-compliant ethics</li>\r\n  <li>Fast editorial communication and author-friendly workflow</li>\r\n  <li>Ideal for rapid publication in Computer Science domains</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== JOURNAL FEATURES ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009966; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:30px;\">🌐</span> INDJCST Journal Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:34px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed, refereed open-access journal</li>\r\n  <li>Simple and transparent submission process</li>\r\n  <li>High visibility & strong indexing presence</li>\r\n  <li>Publisher license under Creative Commons BY-NC-ND</li>\r\n  <li>Good impact factor with recognized editorial board</li>\r\n  <li>Fast-track publication options available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== INDEXING ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9900CC; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:30px;\">🔍</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:34px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PlumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== PROCESS ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF6600; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:30px;\">📝</span> Fast & Transparent Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:34px;\">\r\n  <li>Submit Online: 24/7 submission portal</li>\r\n  <li>Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Peer review completed in 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Final decision within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF publication + digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== APC ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF0033; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:30px;\">💰</span> Low Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:34px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>India (Without DOI):</strong> ₹1200 + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>India (With DOI):</strong> ₹1400 + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors (With DOI):</strong> $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== DASHBOARD ===== -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0066AA; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:30px;\">📂</span> Advanced Editorial Dashboard\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:34px;\">\r\n  <li>Track submission progress in real time</li>\r\n  <li>Access certificates, acceptance letters & forms instantly</li>\r\n  <li>Easy download of published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== CTA ===== -->\r\n<div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:40px;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\"\r\n     style=\"background:#0066CC; color:#fff; padding:14px 26px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold;\">\r\n     Submit Your Research Paper\r\n  </a>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>','Low-Cost Fast Publication in Computer Science – INDJCST','low-cost-fast-publication-in-computer-science-indjcst','Journal','Low-Cost Fast Publication in Computer Science – INDJCST','INDJCST offers low-cost fast publication in Computer Science with rapid review, UGC CARE alignment, and Google Scholar indexing.','Low-Cost Fast Publication in Computer Science – INDJCST');
