ement -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03a9f4; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧠</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Author Dashboard:</strong> Manage submission and track review progress.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Real-time Tracking:</strong> Monitor every stage from review to publication.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Automated Documentation:</strong> Instantly access acceptance letters and copyright forms.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>One-click Downloads:</strong> Access certificates and published papers instantly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Submit Now -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Ready to Publish in an International Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Submit your manuscript today to INDJCST — an <strong>International Engineering Journal with High Impact Factor</strong> offering <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance with <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    🔗 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(15,'2025-11-14 13:04:52','2025-11-14 13:04:52','tags/Jq9OiMXwcIV6eH1WJm6wbf6ZbiOAuPFsQoYxuIL5.jpg','ISSN Approved Engineering Journals India| INDJCST','Tag','issn-approved-engineering-journals-india-indjcst','ISSN Approved Engineering Journals India| INDJCST','Publish your research in INDJCST, one of the best ISSN approved