 INDJCST provides global exposure to high-quality research in <strong>computer science</strong> and engineering disciplines, indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and major databases.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Published thrice annually, INDJCST follows a double-blind peer review process ensuring the highest standards of scholarly publishing. The journal welcomes original research, review papers, and case studies that contribute to the advancement of knowledge and technology across interdisciplinary engineering domains. As an <strong>ISSN approved journal</strong>, INDJCST maintains a strong reputation for <strong>rapid publication</strong> and open-access dissemination.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚡ Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚡</span> Why Choose INDJCST Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is among the leading <strong>ISSN approved engineering journals</strong> in India, ensuring fast editorial response, affordable publication costs, and high global visibility for authors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>ISSN Approved & UGC CARE Compliant:</strong> Ensures recognition and academic credibility.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Editorial decisions within 3 days of submission.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication:</strong> Papers published online within 48–72 hours post-acceptance.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable open-access publishing for global authors.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Google Scholar Indexed:</strong> Widely visible and cited across the academic community.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Adheres to international publication ethics and best practices.</li>\