le Scholar</strong> indexing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    🔗 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(17,'2025-11-14 13:08:43','2025-11-14 13:08:43','tags/fZ9lbTmOQ5odVA1WvKnm0EACVYbBP1keTBo8NQ8W.jpg','International Engineering Journals with Low Publication Charges| INDJCST','Tag','international-engineering-journals-with-low-publication-charges-indjcst','International Engineering Journals with Low Publication Charges| INDJCST','INDJCST is one of the best International Engineering Journals with low publication charges. Experience low cost, fast publication.','International Engineering Journals with Low Publication Charges| INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  International Engineering Journals with Low Publication Charges\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a renowned <strong>International Engineering Journal with Low Publication Charges</strong>, offering <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>fast publication</strong> options for researchers worldwide. As a <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliant, peer-reviewed, and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexed journal, INDJCST provides a trusted platform for publishing research across all fields of <strong>computer science</strong> and technology.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Published three times a year, INDJCST ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> and open-access visibility. It follows strict peer-review guidelines, ensuring only high-q