ted</strong> quality assurance. It’s the perfect destination for scholars seeking rapid, transparent, and ethical academic publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Google Scholar Indexed:</strong> Ensures global research discoverability and citations.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable publishing fees for students and professionals.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication Process:</strong> Peer review and decision within 3–5 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE & COPE Compliant:</strong> Follows academic and ethical publishing standards.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Freely accessible to readers worldwide.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>High Impact Visibility:</strong> Indexed in major abstracting databases.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💻 Research Areas -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💻</span> Research Areas Covered by INDJCST\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  The <strong>Google Scholar Indexed Journal INDJCST</strong> accepts innovative and interdisciplinary research across major areas of <strong>Computer Science and Technology</strong>, including:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology and FinTech</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction and UX Design</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics, Automation, and Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌟 INDJCST Features -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌟</span> Key Features of INDJCST\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Peer-Reviewed & Refereed:</strong> Every article undergoes double-blind review by experts.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable fees for open-access global dissemination.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Publication:</strong> Review and decision within 3–5 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE & Google Scholar Indexed:</strong> Increases the academic credibility of published work.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>High Impact Factor:</strong> Ensures your research gains measurable visibility.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Upholds publication ethics and transparency.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is indexed in several prestigious academic databases for maximum research visibility:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Publication Process -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️