g:</strong> Track paper status at each editorial stage.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Automated Documents:</strong> Generate acceptance letters and copyright forms.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Easy Access:</strong> Download published papers and certificates anytime.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Submit Now -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Ready to Publish in a Google Scholar Indexed Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Submit your research to <strong>INDJCST</strong> — the <strong>Google Scholar Indexed Journal</strong> with <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid peer review</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE compliance</strong>. Empower your academic journey with a globally visible, ethically managed journal.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    🔗 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(26,'2025-11-14 13:39:10','2025-12-02 11:08:45','tags/ydczrSEyO2QEctOwByXJKBsZnCE5ZpytoBjHdgMi.jpg','Google Scholar Indexed Journal with Low Publication Charges | INDJCST','Journals','google-scholar-indexed-journal-with-low-publication-charges-indjcst','Google Scholar Indexed Journal with Low Publication Charges | INDJCST','Publish in a Google Scholar Indexed Journal with Low Publication Charges. INDJCST offers fast publication, UGC CARE guidelines, peer review, open access, low cost fees, and rapid publication for Computer Science research papers.','Google Scholar Indexed Journal with Low Publication Charges | INDJCST','<div style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nGoogle Scholar Indexed Journal with Low Publication Charges\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access platform dedicated to publishing high-quality research across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published tri-annually, INDJCST serves academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals with a credible outlet for impactful scholarly work. As a <strong>Google Scholar Indexed Journal with Low Publication Charges</strong>, the journal ensures global visibility at an affordable cost.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\r\nINDJCST adheres to <strong>UGC-CARE</strong> guidelines and follows a strict peer-review process, ensuring that every submission meets the highest standards of academic excellence. With a reputation for <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid review</strong>, it stands out as one of the most reliable platforms for Computer Science research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= SUBJECT AREAS ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0066CC; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-top:30px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">📘</span> Scope & Research Areas\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\r\nINDJCST welcomes high-quality articles in cutting-edge Computer Science domains, making it an ideal <strong>low cost, rapid publication</strong> option for scholars worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>IoT (Internet of Things)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= WHY CHOOSE ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#CC0066; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">⭐</span> Why Choose INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decisions within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Maximum visibility worldwide.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Workflow:</strong> Quick responses at every step.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Strict screening for academic integrity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliant:</strong> Following global ethical standards.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impactful Research:</strong> Influencing academia, industry, and policymaking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= FEATURES ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009966; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">🔍</span> INDJCST Journal Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed refereed journal</li>\r\n  <li>Fast, simple & transparent publication process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism policy</li>\r\n  <li>High visibility & indexing</li>\r\n  <li>Publication ethics following COPE guidelines</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons BY NC ND license</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed editorial board</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid / Fast Track publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= INDEXING ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF6600; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">📚</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">INDJCST is indexed in the following platforms, strengthening its credibility as a <strong>Google Scholar Indexed Journal with Low Publication Charges</strong>:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"columns:2; margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= PUBLICATION PROCESS ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3366FF; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">⚙️</span> Our Streamlined Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\r\nExperience a seamless, author-friendly journey with our <strong>rapid publication workflow</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 online submission system</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Initial Response:</strong> Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Expert Review:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Final Decision:</strong> Acceptance/Rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Publication & Certificate:</strong> Instant PDF & certificate issuance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= APC ================= -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#CC3300; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:26px;\">💰</span> Article Processing Charges (Low Cost)\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\r\nAs a <strong>low cost, fast publication</strong> journal, INDJCST offers minimal publication charges:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n  <li><