;\">\r\n  Submit your paper today to <strong>INDJCST</strong> — a <strong>Low Cost Google Scholar Indexed Journal</strong> known for <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid peer review</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE compliance</strong>. Experience affordable, ethical, and globally recognized publishing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    🔗 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(28,'2025-11-14 13:44:41','2025-11-14 13:44:41','tags/LLQHuofaRStQF3tzJACMXLrn2tL6qp3C0lHDGJew.jpg','Google Scholar Indexed International Journal| INDJCST','Tag','google-scholar-indexed-international-journal-indjcst','Google Scholar Indexed International Journal| INDJCST','Publish your research in INDJCST — a Google Scholar Indexed International Journal offering low cost, fast publication, rapid peer review, and UGC CARE compliance in Computer Science and Technology.','Google Scholar Indexed International Journal| INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  Google Scholar Indexed International Journal\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputed <strong>Google Scholar Indexed International Journal</strong> dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers in <strong>Computer Science and Technology</strong>. As a <strong>low cost, open-access</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE compliant journal</strong>, INDJCST ensures global visibility, academic credibility, and <strong>fast publication</strong> for authors worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-