','low-cost-journal-publication-fast-affordable-paper-publication-indjcst','Low Cost Journal Publication | Fast & Affordable Paper Publication | INDJCST','Looking for low cost journal publication? INDJCST offers fast publication, UGC CARE compliance, and Google Scholar indexing for computer science research at affordable rates with rapid peer review.','Low Cost Journal Publication | Fast & Affordable Paper Publication | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  Low Cost Journal Publication – Fast & Affordable Research Paper Publishing\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) offers an ideal platform for <strong>low cost journal publication</strong> with <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>UGC CARE-compliant</strong> standards. As a reputed open-access journal, INDJCST enables researchers in <strong>computer science</strong> and technology to publish quality research with global visibility at minimal costs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST follows a <strong>rapid publication</strong> process, ensuring transparency, affordability, and accessibility. Our mission is to make academic publishing available to all through <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>fast peer-reviewed publication</strong> without compromising on research quality or indexing standards such as <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and <strong>COPE ethics</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌟 Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌟</span> Why Choose INDJCST for Low Cost Journal Publication\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is one of India’s most trusted <strong>low cost international journals</strong> for <strong>fast publication</strong>. We are committed to providing a <strong>UGC CARE-aligned</strong> publishing experience backed by high ethical standards and <strong>Google Scholar indexing</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable Fees:</strong> Publication starts from just ₹1200 INR for Indian authors.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication:</strong> Get your paper published within 3–5 days after acceptance.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Rigorous review completed within 48 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE Guidelines:</strong> Adherence to UGC publication and ethical standards.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Global Visibility:</strong> Indexed in Google Scholar, SSRN, and more.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> We follow COPE’s Best Practice Guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💻 Research Areas -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💻</span> Research Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST invites research papers from multiple fields of <strong>Computer Science</strong> and <strong>Technology</strong>, making it a perfect destination for <strong>low cost journal publication</strong> with <strong>fast and open access publishing</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology and Cloud Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Image Proc