d compliance with ethical standards.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Instant Access:</strong> Download certificates and published articles easily.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Call to Action -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Publish Your Research with INDJCST Today\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Publish with <strong>INDJCST</strong> — a trusted journal offering <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE-compliant</strong> processes similar to the <strong>International Journal of Research Publication and Reviews impact factor</strong> indexed journals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    🔗 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(52,'2025-11-17 05:18:34','2025-11-17 05:18:34','tags/KM2zCYPRitCGu5BlMKaLoB9TumIqin0RVnyLDp0H.jpg','NDJCST Publication Fee | Low Cost & Fast Paper Publication | UGC CARE Indexed Journal','Tag','ndjcst-publication-fee-low-cost-fast-paper-publication-ugc-care-indexed-journal','NDJCST Publication Fee | Low Cost & Fast Paper Publication | UGC CARE Indexed Journal','Explore the INDJCST publication fee and benefits. Publish your research in a UGC CARE compliant, Google Scholar indexed, low cost and fast publication journal in computer science.','NDJCST Publication Fee | Low Cost & Fast Paper Publication | UGC CARE Indexed Journal','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  INDJCST Publication Fee – Low Cost & Fast Journal Publication\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputed open-access journal offering <strong>low cost publication fees</strong> with <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>UGC CARE compliance</strong>. Known for its transparent review process and global accessibility, INDJCST provides an excellent opportunity for authors in <strong>computer science</strong> to publish their research affordably.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  With a dedicated editorial team and rapid publication workflow, INDJCST ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> without compromising quality. It adheres to <strong>COPE publication ethics</strong> and is indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> for global visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌟 Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌟</span> Why Choose INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST offers one of the most affordable <strong>publication fees</strong> in India with a <strong>fast and transparent review system</strong>. Our goal is to support researchers, academicians, and students through a high-quality yet <strong>low cost publication model</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Publication Fee:</strong> Affordable rates for Indian and international authors.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication:</strong> Review and decision within 3 days of submission.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE Compliant:</strong> Meets academic and research quality benchmarks.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Google Scholar Indexed:</strong> Enhances research visibility and citation impact.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Ethical Standards:</strong> Upholds publication ethics and integrity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access Journal:</strong> Free global accessibility to published work.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💻 Publication Fee Details -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> INDJCST Publication Fee Structure\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  The <strong>INDJCST publication fee</strong> is designed to be inclusive and affordable for all authors. It ensures that research dissemination remains accessible while maintaining high editorial and technical standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) or ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>For International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Free and unlimited access to all published papers worldwide.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  These <strong>low cost publication fees</strong> make INDJCST one of the most economical journals for researchers seeking <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>global indexing</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Rapid Publication Process -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Fast & Transparent Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is known for its <strong>rapid publication</strong> and efficient workflow. Every submission is handled by expert reviewers to maintain academic quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Submit your paper through the online portal.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Receive acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Decision notification within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Instant publication and e-certificate download.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing & Visibility -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexed and Abstracted In\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  The <strong>INDJCST</strong> is widely indexed across multiple academic databases, providing authors with international recognition and citation visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧠 Editorial Management System -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧠</span> Advanced Editorial Management & Author Dashboard\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST uses a modern editorial management system for <strong>real-time tracking</strong> and automated documentation to ensure <strong>rapid publication</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Author Dashboard:</strong> Track the status of submissions and reviews.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Automated Acceptance Letters:</strong> Generated instantly after approval.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Ensures research originality and integrity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>One-click Downloads:</strong> Access certificates and published papers easily.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Journal Highlights -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03a9f4; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Highlights of INDJCST\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed and refereed journal in <strong>Computer Science</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low cost publication fee</strong> suitable for students and researchers.</li>\r\n  <li>Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and international databases.</li>\r\n  <li>Adheres to <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and <strong>COPE ethical standards</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid publication</strong> and transparent review system.</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed editorial board and wide global reach.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Call to Action -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Submit Your Paper and Publish Affordably\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Choose <strong>INDJCST</strong> for <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE compliant</strong> research dissemination. Experience transparent peer review and global indexing through <strong>Google Scholar</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    🔗 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(53,'2025-11-17 05:20:24','2025-11-17 05:20:24','tags/o0VEZb94