</strong> and <strong>fast publication</strong> opportunities for computer science research scholars worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable fees starting from ₹1200 for Indian authors.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication:</strong> Decision and publication within 3–5 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE Guidelines:</strong> Ensures credibility and academic recognition.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Global Indexing:</strong> Indexed in Google Scholar, SSRN, and more.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Your research reaches global readers instantly.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Ethical Standards:</strong> COPE compliant peer review and publishing process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💻 Research Domains -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💻</span> Research Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST welcomes papers from all branches of <strong>Computer Science and Technology</strong>, ensuring wide coverage for authors seeking a <strong>journal for publishing computer science research papers</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology and Web Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics, Automation, and Embedded Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Key Features -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top: