p 2:</strong> Get acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Decision within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Immediate publication with digital certificate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Publication Charges -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST follows a <strong>low cost publication model</strong> to encourage research in <strong>AI and computer vision</strong>. Charges apply only after manuscript acceptance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) or ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Freely accessible papers for global reach and impact.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexing and Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST’s inclusion in major databases enhances the visibility and citation impact of published research, making it one of the most reputed <strong>AI and Computer Vision Scopus journals</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Scopus</li>\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</