serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST stands out as a preferred choice among <strong>journals with low publication charges</strong> due to its <strong>fast publication</strong> cycle, <strong>low cost</strong> fee structure, and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> adherence. It promotes global visibility through <strong>Google Scholar indexing</strong> and open-access publishing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable charges suitable for students and researchers.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decision within 3 days from submission.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE Compliance:</strong> Meets academic publication requirements in India.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Global Reach:</strong> Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and other databases.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Free accessibility to all published papers worldwide.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Publication Workflow -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️</span> Simple & Fast Publication Workflow\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST follows a transparent and author-friendly workflow, providing <strong>rapid publication</strong> support to researchers worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Submit your manuscript online anytime (24/7).</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Receive acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Decision notification within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Publication and certificate released immediately.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Publication Charges -->\r\n<h2 style=\"colo