:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Author Dashboard:</strong> Manage submissions and monitor progress.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Instant Document Generation:</strong> Automated acceptance letters and certificates.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Real-Time Tracking:</strong> Track every stage of your manuscript review.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Anti-Plagiarism Check:</strong> Strict originality verification for all papers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Call to Action -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Publish in Journals with Low Publication Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Submit your paper to <strong>INDJCST</strong> — a top <strong>UGC CARE</strong>-compliant, <strong>Google Scholar indexed</strong> journal offering <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>rapid review</strong> for <strong>computer science research</strong>. Start your publishing journey with credibility and visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    🔗 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(82,'2025-11-17 08:11:12','2025-11-17 08:11:12','tags/m7D9eI4kDfsWlMNxhfNuF3ywKba06HhpwtS1Qwxv.jpg','Publication Certificates | Fast & Low Cost Journal Certificate Download | INDJCST','Tag','publication-certificates-fast-low-cost-journal-certificate-download-indjcst','Publication Certificates | Fast & Low Cost Journal Certificate Download | INDJCST','Get verified publication certificates from INDJCST – a UGC CARE compliant, low cost, and fast publication computer science journal indexed in Google Scholar.','Publication Certificates | Fast & Low Cost Journal Certificate Download | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  Publication Certificates – Instant & Verified for Authors\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) provides official <strong>publication certificates</strong> to authors upon successful paper publication. Each certificate is digitally verified, making it ideal for academic, institutional, and professional recognition.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST ensures <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>rapid issuance of publication certificates</strong> through its advanced editorial management system. Authors receive their certificates within 24 hours of final acceptance, supporting transparency and academic credibility in every step.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🏅 What is a Publication Certificate -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🏅</span> What is a Publication Certificate?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  A <strong>publication certificate</strong> is an official acknowledgment issued by a journal confirming the successful publication of your research paper. At INDJCST, each certificate includes:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Author Name(s)</li>\r\n  <li>Paper Title</li>\r\n  <li>Journal Name & ISSN Number</li>\r\n  <li>Volume, Issue & Publication Date</li>\r\n  <li>DOI (Digital Object Identifier, if applicable)</li>\r\n  <li>Digital Signature of Editor-in-Chief</li>\r\n  <li>Official Verification Link (for online validation)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚡ Benefits of INDJCST Publication Certificates -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚡</span> Benefits of INDJCST Publication Certificates\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST provides <strong>publication certificates</strong> instantly through a <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>low cost</strong> process, supporting researchers, academicians, and industry professionals in demonstrating their scholarly achievements.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Instant Access:</strong> Download certificates immediately after paper publication.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Digital Verification:</strong> Unique verification ID for online authenticity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Recognized by Institutions:</strong> UGC CARE compliant and globally accepted.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost:</strong> Affordable publication charges for Indian and international authors.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access Visibility:</strong> Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and multiple databases.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧾 How to Get Your Certificate -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧾</span> How to Get Your Publication Certificate\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST follows a transparent and <strong>rapid publication</strong> process to ensure every author receives their <strong>publication certificate</strong> without delay.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Submit your manuscript via the online portal.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Receive acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Get acceptance and <strong>publication certificate</strong> within 24 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Download certificate and published paper directly from your author dashboard.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Publication Charges -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> Affordable Publication & Certificate Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is known for its <strong>low cost</strong> model while maintaining quality and credibility in <strong>fast publication</strong> and certificate issuance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) or ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>For International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Free Access:</strong> Certificates are available for download immediately after publication.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexed & Abstracted -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexed & Abstracted in Global Databases\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Each paper and <strong>publication certificate</strong> is backed by visibility through <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and other reputed indexing platforms.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</l