ational-journal-with-high-impact-factor-fast-low-cost-publication-indjcst','International Journal with High Impact Factor | Fast & Low Cost Publication | INDJCST','Publish your paper in an international journal with high impact factor. INDJCST offers low cost, fast publication, UGC CARE compliance.','International Journal with High Impact Factor | Fast & Low Cost Publication | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  International Journal with High Impact Factor – INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a globally recognized <strong>international journal with high impact factor</strong>, offering <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>fast publication</strong> opportunities for researchers in <strong>computer science</strong> and emerging technologies.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and <strong>COPE</strong> guidelines, ensuring academic integrity and rapid peer review. As an <strong>international journal with high impact factor</strong>, INDJCST guarantees visibility through <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and other global indexing databases while maintaining a <strong>low cost</strong> and efficient publication process.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌐 Journal Overview -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌐</span> About INDJCST – A Leading International Journal\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As a reputable <strong>international journal with high impact factor</strong>, INDJCST publishes high-quality research across diverse areas of <strong>computer science</strong>. The journal supports <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> while maintaining high ethical standards and quality peer review.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Rigorous peer-review process ensuring publication excellence.</li>\r\n  <li>Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, <strong>Elsevier Mendeley</strong>, <strong>EuroPub</strong>, and <strong>Dimensions</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li>Follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and <strong>COPE</strong> publication ethics guidelines.</li>\r\n  <li>Offers <strong>fast publication</strong> and global open access visibility.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Research Domains -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Research Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST welcomes original research papers, review articles, and case studies in major areas of <strong>computer science</strong> and <strong>information technology</strong>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology and IoT</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence and Bioinformatics</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️