>Offers <strong>rapid publication</strong> and <strong>transparent peer review</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li>Publishes original research and review articles in <strong>computer science</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Research Domains -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Research Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST accepts interdisciplinary research papers in the field of <strong>computer science</strong>, providing <strong>low cost</strong> publishing opportunities for authors worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology and Web Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction and NLP</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics, Automation, and Embedded Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️</span> Why Choose INDJCST – Leading Low Cost Journal in India\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is the preferred choice for researchers seeking <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>fast publication</strong> without compromising academic quality. It ensures that each paper undergoes a <strong>rapid review process</strong> by subject experts.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable Fees:</strong> Among the most economical research publication options in India.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Review:</strong> Peer review completed within 2–3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>High Visibility:</strong> Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and other international databases.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE Guidelines:</strong> Ensures compliance with ethical publishing practices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication:</strong> From submission to online publication within days.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🕒 Publication Workflow -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03a9f4; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🕒</span> Fast & Transparent Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  The publication process at INDJCST is designed for simplicity and speed, making it an ideal <strong>low cost journal in India</strong> for both students and professionals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Submit your paper anytime through our editorial system.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Get acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Receive decision and revisions (if any) within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Publication and digital certificate issued immediately.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Publication Fees -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> Low Cost & Affordable Publication Fees\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST offers <strong>low cost publication charges</strong> to make academic publishing accessible for all. Despite affordable pricing, the journal ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> and global visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) or ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>For International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> All papers are freely available online after publication.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing & Abstracting -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexed in Leading Databases\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST ensures research visibility through leading indexing databases, enhancing the reach and citation potential of each publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧩 Editorial System -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧩</span> Author Dashboard & Editorial Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Track submission and publication status in real-time.</li>\r\n  <li>Download acceptance letters and publication certificates instantly.</li>\r\n  <li>Automatic plagiarism checks and COPE-compliant processes.</li>\r\n  <li>24/7 access for paper submission and updates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Call to Action -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:cent