ng>Elsevier Mendeley</strong>, and <strong>EuroPub</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li>Ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> for time-sensitive research.</li>\r\n  <li>Recognized globally for its <strong>transparency and quality</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Research Areas -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Research Areas Covered by INDJCST\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST invites submissions across a wide range of computer science and technology fields. As a reputed <strong>journal for publishing research paper</strong>, it supports interdisciplinary innovation and emerging research trends.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain and Web Technologies</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️</span> Why Choose INDJCST as Your Journal for Publishing Research Paper\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is preferred by thousands of authors for its efficiency, affordability, and credibility. It’s among the best <strong>journals for publishing research paper</strong> that combine <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> with global academic recognition.