ional journal for paper publication</strong> lies in its author-friendly policies, quick review process, and dedication to academic excellence. It ensures every manuscript is evaluated fairly, transparently, and efficiently.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable publication for all researchers.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Review Process:</strong> Decision within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access Visibility:</strong> Global reach through free online access.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE & COPE Compliance:</strong> Ethical and credible publishing standards.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Google Scholar Indexed:</strong> Ensures visibility and high citation impact.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🕒 Publication Workflow -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03a9f4; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🕒</span> Fast & Transparent Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST simplifies the research publication journey, ensuring a <strong>rapid publication</strong> workflow for every author.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Submit your paper online through the submission portal.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Receive acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Complete peer review within 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Acceptance notification within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Final publication and certificate within 5 days.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Publication Charges -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> Low Cost Publication Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is known for its <strong>low cost</strong> and accessible publication model, making it the <strong>best international journal for paper publication</strong> for students, researchers, and professionals worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) / ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Freely available for global readers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing & Abstracting -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexed in Leading Databases\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  The journal’s wide indexing ensures your research gains global exposure. INDJCST is among the <strong>best international journals for paper publication</strong> with comprehensive abstracting and indexing coverage.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧠 Author Tools -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧠</span> Author Dashboard & Editorial Support\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Real-time submission tracking and status updates.</li>\r\n  <li>Instant access to acceptance letters and copyright forms.</li>\r\n  <li>Automated plag