lication journals</strong> for its transparent editorial process, high academic integrity, and author-friendly approach. By promoting <strong>open access</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong>, it empowers authors to disseminate their work efficiently and effectively across the global academic community.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌐 About INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌐</span> About INDJCST – A Leading Low Cost Publication Journal\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is a peer-reviewed, open-access journal that offers <strong>low cost publication</strong> without compromising quality. The journal follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and <strong>COPE</strong> guidelines, ensuring transparency, integrity, and academic excellence. It serves as a hub for <strong>fast publication</strong> of innovative research in all domains of <strong>computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, <strong>Elsevier Mendeley</strong>, <strong>EuroPub</strong>, and more.</li>\r\n  <li>Ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> and transparent peer review.</li>\r\n  <li>Globally accessible with <strong>open access</strong> visibility.</li>\r\n  <li>Adheres to <strong>COPE ethics</strong> and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Research Domains -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Research Areas Covered by INDJCST\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST accepts manuscripts from a wide spectrum of research fields in <strong>computer science</strong> and allied disciplines, ma