 <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexed in Major Research Databases\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Every article published in this <strong>low cost publication journal</strong> is indexed in major databases to maximize its reach and citation potential.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧠 Editorial Support -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧠</span> Author Dashboard & Editorial Support\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized author dashboard for submission tracking.</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time updates on manuscript status.</li>\r\n  <li>Instant access to acceptance letters and copyright forms.</li>\r\n  <li>Easy download of publication certificates and journal copies.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Call to Action -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Publish Your Research with a Trusted Low Cost Publication Journal\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Submit your paper today to <strong>INDJCST</strong> – a <strong>low cost publication journal</strong> known for <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing. Experience transparency, integrity, and rapid research dissemination.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://e