timely peer review.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, <strong>Elsevier Mendeley</strong>, and <strong>EuroPub</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li>Ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> and visibility across multiple platforms.</li>\r\n  <li>Complies with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and <strong>COPE</strong> guidelines.</li>\r\n  <li>Dedicated to <strong>low cost</strong> open access publishing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Research Areas -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Scope of the Journal – Research Fields Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As an <strong>International Journal of Engineering</strong>, INDJCST covers a wide range of topics in <strong>computer science</strong> and engineering. It welcomes contributions that demonstrate innovation, real-world applications, and technological advancement.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Vision and Image Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️</span> Why INDJCST is the Preferred International Journal of Engineering\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-fam