ng> offering <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing. Start your publication journey today with affordable, transparent, and rapid publishing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    📘 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(107,'2025-11-17 11:08:40','2025-11-17 11:08:40','tags/4XfF2QXqAh4BxEOjOOw2MFPnoOQ7SSpcdly0rfVq.jpg','Low Publication Fee International Journals| INDJCST','Tag','low-publication-fee-international-journals-indjcst','Low Publication Fee International Journals| INDJCST','INDJCST is one of the leading Low Publication Fee International Journals offering low cost, fast publication, UGC CARE compliance.','Low Publication Fee International Journals| INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  Low Publication Fee International Journals – INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a premier choice among <strong>Low Publication Fee International Journals</strong> dedicated to <strong>computer science</strong> and <strong>engineering</strong> research. It offers <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid review</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing for high visibility and credibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As a <strong>peer-reviewed open access</strong> journal, INDJCST ensures the highest publishing standards at an afforda