 line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️</span> Why INDJCST is Among the Best Low Publication Fee International Journals\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST offers a blend of <strong>affordable publication</strong> and <strong>fast publication</strong> with complete transparency. It’s designed for international researchers who seek <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliant and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexed journals at a <strong>low cost</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Low Publication Fees:</strong> Economical for students and global researchers.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Publication:</strong> Review and decision within 3–5 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE Compliance:</strong> Ensures recognized and quality publishing.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Global Indexing:</strong> Widely indexed for maximum research visibility.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Freely accessible worldwide.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🕒 Fast Publication Workflow -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03a9f4; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🕒</span> Rapid and Transparent Publication Workflow\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST’s editorial workflow ensures <strong>fast publication</strong> without compromising academic quality, making it one of the most efficient <strong>Low Publication Fee International Journals</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Submit your paper via the online portal.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Get acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Decision (accept/reject) within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Publication and certificate issued immediately post-approval.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Low Publication Charges -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> Affordable Publication Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST ensures its position among top <strong>Low Publication Fee International Journals</strong> by maintaining affordability and accessibility for researchers across the globe.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) / ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Immediate visibility for all published papers worldwide.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexed in Leading International Databases\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is globally recognized among <strong>Low Publication Fee International Journals</strong> for its strong indexing partnerships that enhance academic reach and credibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧠 Editorial System -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧠</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized author dashboard with submission tracking.</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time updates throughout the review process.</li>\r\n  <li>Instant generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms.</li>\r\n  <li>One-click access to certificates and published articles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Call to Action -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Publish with INDJCST – A Trusted Low Publication Fee International Journal\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Choose <strong>INDJCST</strong> for <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> recognized international publishing. Submit your research to one of the leading <strong>Low Publication Fee International Journals</strong> and make your work accessible worldwide through <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing and open access.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    📘 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(108,'2025-11-17 11:10:50','2025-11-17 11:10:50','tags/8XU0M0NKnYBoZyqYPca43QSFuWj1cKwotY6YPmbY.jpg','Low Cost Journal for Computer Science| INDJCST','Tag','low-cost-journal-for-computer-science-indjcst','Low Cost Journal for Computer Science| INDJCST','Publish in a low cost journal for computer science with fast publication and UGC CARE compliance. INDJCST offers rapid publication.','Low Cost Journal for Computer Science| INDJCST','<!-- ✅ Page Content -->\r\n<section style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.7; color: #222; padding: 20px;\">\r\n\r\n  <h1 style=\"color:#004aad; text-align:center; font-weight:700;\">\r\n    The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)\r\n  </h1>\r\n  <p style=\"text-align:center; color:#444;\">(e-ISSN: 2583-5300)</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>\r\n    <strong>INDJCST</strong> is a reputable, <strong>low cost journal</strong> and <strong>open-access publication</strong> platform dedicated to advancing <strong>Computer Science and Technology</strong> research. Published thrice yearly, it welcomes contributions from academicians, educators, engineers, and industry professionals globally. INDJCST ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> and adheres to <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines, maintaining high standards of quality and integrity.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"color:#00897b; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size:20px;\">💡</span> About the Journal\r\n  </h2>\r\n\r\n  <p>\r\n    The journal publishes innovative and practical research in all domains of Computer Science, offering a <strong>fast publication</strong> route with affordable fees. INDJCST supports <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing and other major academic databases, helping authors reach wider audiences with impactful work.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\">\r\n    <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n    <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n    <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n    <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n    <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n    <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n    <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n    <li>Blockchain, Robotics, Embedded Systems, and more</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"color:#e65100; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size:20px;\">🚀</span> Why Choose INDJCST?\r\n  </h2>\r\n\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\">\r\n    <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decisions within 3 days while maintaining academic quality.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Global visibility for your research through free access.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable fees make INDJCST a <strong>low cost journal</strong> option for authors.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Ethical publishing following COPE standards.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Global Reach:</strong> Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and multiple international databases.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size:20px;\">🌐</span> Journal Features\r\n  </h2>\r\n\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\">\r\n    <li>Peer-reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n    <li>Fast, transparent publication process</li>\r\n    <li>Strict plagiarism policy</li>\r\n    <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n    <li>Indexed in UGC CARE, Google Scholar, Dimensions, SSRN, and more</li>\r\n    <li>Creative Commons Licensed</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"color:#1976d2; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size:20px;\">📚</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n  </h2>\r\n\r\n  <p>INDJCST is widely indexed to ensure global visibility for your published articles:</p>\r\n  <p style=\"columns:2; column-gap:40px;\">\r\n    Google Scholar<br>\r\n    Scribd<br>\r\n    ISSUU<br>\r\n    Elsevier Mendeley<br>\r\n    EuroPub<br>\r\n    DRJI<br>\r\n    Edocr<br>\r\n    ResearchBIB<br>\r\n    SSRN<br>\r\n    WorldCAT<br>\r\n    Exlibris (Clarivate)<br>\r\n    Semantic Scholar<br>\r\n    Dimensions<br>\r\n    PLumX\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"color:#c62828; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size:20px;\">🕒</span> Streamlined Publication Process\r\n  </h2>\r\n\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\">\r\n    <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission through our editorial system.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Initial Response:</strong> Within 12 hours of submission.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Expert Review:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Decision Notification:</strong> Acceptance/rejection within 3 days.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Publication & Certificate:</strong> Instant access post-acceptance.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size:20px;\">💰</span> Article Processing Charges\r\n  </h2>\r\n\r\n  <p>\r\n    As a <strong>low cost open-access journal</strong>, INDJCST ensures global reach at minimal cost:\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\">\r\n    <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong><br> Without DOI: ₹1200 + 18% GST<br> With DOI: ₹1400 + 18% GST</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Foreign Authors:</strong><br> With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"color:#0288d1; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size:20px;\">🧠</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n  </h2>\r\n\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\">\r\n    <li>Personalized Author Dashboard with submission history</li>\r\n    <li>Real-time tracking of your manuscript</li>\r\n    <li>Instant generation of acceptance letters & copyright forms</li>\r\n    <li>Easy download of certificates and published articles</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"color:#7b1fa2; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-size:20px;\">📤</span> Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n  </h2>\r\n\r\n  <p>\r\n    Join hundreds of researchers who trust INDJCST for <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standard publishing. \r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <p>\r\n    <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#004aad; color:#fff; padding:10px 20px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none;\">\r\n      Submit Your Paper Now\r\n    </a>\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n</section>'),(109,'2025-11-17 11:12:14','2025-11-17 11:12:14','tags/cZpaaCTy0v04aKMCFuKLqaskIyF5lU0e76SzFReK.jpg','Low Cost International Journal | INDJCST','Tag','low-cost-international-journal-indjcst','Low Cost International Journal | INDJCST','INDJCST is a Low Cost International Journal offering fast publication, rapid review, UGC CARE compliance, and Google Scholar indexing in computer science and technology.','Low Cost International Journal | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  Low Cost International Journal – INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a globally recognized <strong>Low Cost International Journal</strong> committed to publishing high-quality, peer-reviewed research papers in <strong>Computer Science</strong> and <strong>Engineering</strong>. The journal ensures <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>low cost accessibility</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance for researchers worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As an <strong>open-access journal</strong>, INDJCST provides global visibility for scholarly works through <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing and multiple abstracting services. With <strong>rapid publication</strong> and affordable processing charges, it serves as the ideal destination for authors seeking a <strong>low cost international journal</strong> with a transparent publication process.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌐 About INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌐</span> About INDJCST – A Trusted Low Cost International Journal\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST stands as one of the most reputable <strong>Low Cost International Journals</strong> with <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid review</strong> systems. The journal follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and <strong>COPE</strong> ethical publishing standards, ensuring quality and integrity in every published article.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, <strong>Elsevier Mendeley</strong>, and <strong>EuroPub</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low cost publication</strong> for global authors.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast publication</strong> with decision in just 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li>Fully compliant with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and <strong>COPE</strong> guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Research Scope -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Research Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST accepts papers across all major disciplines of <strong>Computer Science</strong> and <str