ort from submission to indexing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Submit your paper online anytime.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Receive acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Decision communicated within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Immediate publication with DOI and certificate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Publication Charges -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> Affordable Publication Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is known for its <strong>low cost publication</strong> structure, making it accessible for both Indian and international authors while maintaining its place among the <strong>Top 10 Journals in India</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) / ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Freely available for global readership.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexed in Leading Databases\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As one of the <strong>Top 10 Journals in India</strong>, INDJCST ensures wide academic reach and credibility by being indexed in multiple global repositories.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧠 Editorial Management -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧠</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Dedicated author dashboard with real-time updates.</li>\r\n  <li>Automated acceptance letters and copyright forms.</li>\r\n  <li>Instant access to published papers and certificates.</li>\r\n  <li>24/7 online submission and support system.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Call to Action -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Publish with INDJCST – One of the Top 10 Journals in India\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Publish your research with <strong>INDJCST</strong>, one of the <strong>Top 10 Journals in India</strong> for <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>fast publication</strong>. Gain visibility through <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing while reaching a global audience.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    📘 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(119,'2025-11-17 11:53:44','2025-11-17 11:53:44','tags/XFOsLsWEvOwYfS1jJROWKG6KiPra8kBanwTvkd0n.jpg','Top 10 International Journals in India| INDJCST','Tag','top-10-international-journals-in-india-indjcst','Top 10 International Journals in India| INDJCST','Explore the Top 10 International Journals in India for low cost and fast publication. INDJCST offers UGC CARE compliance, rapid publication.','Top 10 International Journals in India| INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  Top 10 International Journals in India – INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) proudly ranks among the <strong>Top 10 International Journals in India</strong>. Known for its <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, INDJCST serves as a global platform for researchers, educators, and industry professionals in the field of <strong>computer science</strong> and emerging technologies.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As an internationally recognized journal, INDJCST ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> while maintaining rigorous <strong>peer review</strong> and publication ethics. The journal is <strong>indexed in Google Scholar</strong> and other leading databases, enhancing the global visibility and citation impact of published research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌐 About INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌐</span> About INDJCST – A Leading International Journal in India\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is a <strong>UGC CARE</strong> listed and <strong>Google Scholar indexed</strong> international journal in India, recognized for <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>fast publication</strong>. It provides an open-access platform for authors worldwide, supporting academic excellence and interdisciplinary collaboration in <strong>computer science</strong> and technology.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, <strong>Elsevier Mendeley</strong>, <strong>EuroPub</strong>, and <strong>DRJI</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li>Adheres to <strong>COPE</strong> publication ethics and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines.</li>\r\n  <li>Offers <strong>fast publication</strong> with a transparent review process.</li>\r\n  <li>Ensures <strong>low cost publication</strong> accessible to researchers across India and abroad.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Research Domains -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Research Domains Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As one of the <strong>Top 10 International Journals in India</strong>, INDJCST publishes diverse research topics in <strong>computer science</strong>, engineering, and information technology.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics, Automation, and Embedded Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Why INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️</span> Why INDJCST is Among the Top 10 International Journals in India\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST stands out among the <strong>Top 10 International Journals in India</strong> for its commitment to quality, <strong>low cost</strong>, and <strong>fast publication</strong>. Its international recognition and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing make it an ideal choice for global researchers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable publication charges for Indian and international authors.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Review:</strong> Peer review decisions within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE Compliant:</strong> Recognized for academic credibility.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Google Scholar Indexed:</strong> Boosts global visibility and citations.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Research accessible to readers worldwide.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🕒 Publication Process -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03a9f4; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🕒</span> Fast and Transparent Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST’s streamlined editorial workflow ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> and author convenience, maintaining its position among the <strong>Top 10 International Journals in India</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Online submission via the author dashboard.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Peer review completed in 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Acceptance or revision notice within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Immediate publication and DOI assignment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Article Processing Charges -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> Affordable Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST offers one of the most affordable publication fee structures among the <strong>Top 10 International Journals in India</strong>, supporting open access and global visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) / ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Ensures global accessibility and citations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexed in Leading Global Databases\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As a globally recognized journal, INDJCST’s indexing across multiple platforms enhances the discoverability and impact of your research, reinforcing its status among the <strong>Top 10 International Journals in India</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧠 Editorial System -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧠</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>24/7 online submission and tracking system.</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time paper status updates and notifications.</li>\r\n  <li>Instant generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms.</li>\r\n  <li>Quick access to published papers and certificates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Call to Action -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Publish with INDJCST – One of the Top 10 International Journals in India\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Publish your research in <strong>INDJCST</strong>, one of the <strong>Top 10 International Journals in India</strong> known for <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and <strong>Google Scholar indexing</strong>. Experience global recognition and impactful academic reach.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    📘 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>');
INSERT INTO `tags` VALUES (120,'2025-11-17 11:55:39','2025-11-17 11:55:39','tags/IvlzEAbq0gP1gSaYAgtfzGjNRULvQwnS8gZPxkze.jpg','Top 10 Low Cost Journals | Fast Publication & UGC CARE Indexed | INDJCST','Tag','top-10-low-cost-journals-fast-publication-ugc-care-indexed-indjcst','Top 10 Low Cost Journals | Fast Publication & UGC CARE Indexed | INDJCST','Explore the Top 10 Low Cost Journals for fast publication and UGC CARE compliance. Publish your computer science research in INDJCST.','Top 10 Low Cost Journals | Fast Publication & UGC CARE Indexed | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  Top 10 Low Cost Journals – Fast & Affordable Publication\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) ranks among the <strong>Top 10 Low Cost Journals</strong> in India for <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance. With <strong>Google Scholar indexing</strong> and an emphasis on <strong>rapid publication</strong>, INDJCST serves as a global platform for <strong>computer science</strong> researchers seeking quality and affordability.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As one of the most trusted <strong>low cost international journals</strong>, INDJCST offers a transparent, author-friendly process ensuring both <strong>academic integrity</strong> and <strong>fast publication</strong>. The journal adheres to <strong>COPE</strong> and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards, maintaining high credibility in scholarly publishing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌐 About INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌐</span> About INDJCST – A Top 10 Low Cost Journal\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is an <strong>open-access</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliant journal that promotes <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>fast publication</strong> for researchers worldwide. It focuses on quality research across <strong>computer science</strong> and technology, making it a preferred choice among the <strong>Top 10 Low Cost Journals</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, <strong>Elsevier Mendeley</strong>, and <strong>EuroPub</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li>Ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> without compromising quality.</li>\r\n  <li>Follows strict <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and <strong>COPE</strong> publication ethics.</li>\r\n  <li>Affordable publication charges for both Indian and international authors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Research Areas -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Research Areas Covered by INDJCST\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Being part of the <strong>Top 10 Low Cost Journals</strong>, INDJCST publishes peer-reviewed research across emerging domains of <strong>computer science</strong> and engineering.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Web and 