this <span class=\"highlight\">computer science journal</span> follows <strong>UGC-CARE</strong> standards and a rigorous peer-review process to ensure each publication meets the highest academic benchmarks.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Scope and Research Areas</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nINDJCST welcomes original research papers, review articles, and case studies across emerging <strong>computer science</strong> and interdisciplinary fields, including:\r\n</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing (NLP)</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology and Automation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>⚡ <strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Get expert decisions within 3 days without compromising quality.</li>\r\n  <li>🌐 <strong>Open Access:</strong> Your research becomes globally visible to scientists, educators, and industry professionals.</li>\r\n  <li>✅ <strong>Ethical Publishing:</strong> Fully compliant with <strong>COPE</strong> standards for publication integrity.</li>\r\n  <li>🎯 <strong>High Impact Reach:</strong> Indexed in major databases for maximum visibility.</li>\r\n  <li>💡 <strong>Affordable Fees:</strong> Cost-effective publishing for all categories of authors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nThis <span class=\"highlight\">computer science journal</span> is indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, <strong>Elsevier Mendeley</strong>, <strong>EuroPub</strong>, <strong>SSRN</strong>, <strong>WorldCAT</strong>, <strong>Semantic Scholar</strong>, <strong>DRJI</strong>, and <strong>Dimensions</strong>, ensuring wide visibility and recognition for every publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Streamlined Publication Workflow</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>📝 <strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission through the editorial portal</li>\r\n  <li>📧 <strong>Initial Response:</strong> Get acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>🔍 <strong>Peer Review:</strong> Expert review completed in 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>📜 <strong>Final Decision:</strong> Receive decision within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>🏅 <strong>Publication:</strong> Immediate access to PDF and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Article Processing Charges (APC)</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nBeing a globally accessible <span class=\"highlight\">computer science journal</span>, INDJCST ensures all research papers are freely available online. A nominal APC supports sustainable open-access publishing:\r\n</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) / ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nOur advanced editorial dashboard provides authors with submission tracking, automated acceptance letters, and easy certificate downloads—making INDJCST a leading digital-first <span class=\"highlight\">computer science journal</span> experience.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Submit Your Research in Computer Science</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nReady to contribute to cutting-edge <strong>Computer Science</strong> research?  \r\nSubmit your manuscript today through our secure system:  \r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(134,'2025-11-18 06:38:42','2025-11-18 06:38:42','tags/aIMma2AIhQ0LUDHO5Wt2J2fIZCzzshDcvxYnphwi.jpg','INDJCST Journal | Top Computer Science Journals | Open Access Platform','Tag','indjcst-journal-top-computer-science-journals-open-access-platform','INDJCST Journal | Top Computer Science Journ