rnal</h2>\r\n    <p>\r\n      The <span class=\"highlight\">Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</span> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a premier \r\n      <strong>open-access publication</strong> recognized among the \r\n      <span class=\"highlight\">best computer science journals for publication</span>. It offers a trusted platform for academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share impactful innovations in \r\n      <strong>Computer Science and Technology</strong>.\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>\r\n      The <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> strictly follows <strong>UGC-CARE guidelines</strong> and employs a \r\n      double-blind peer review process to ensure high-quality, ethical, and innovative publications.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"layers\"></i> Research Areas Covered</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"brain\"></i> Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"database\"></i> Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"wifi\"></i> Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"cloud\"></i> Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"shield\"></i> Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"code\"></i> Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"network\"></i> Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"image\"></i> Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"smartphone\"></i> Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"cpu\"></i> Blockchain, Robotics, and Embedded Systems</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"award\"></i> Why Choose INDJCST – A Leading Computer Science Journal</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"zap\"></i> Rapid Peer Review – Decision within 3 days.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"globe\"></i> Open Access – Global visibility for your research.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"clock\"></i> Efficient Workflow – Smooth submission to publication process.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"shield-check\"></i> Plagiarism Protection – Maintains academic integrity.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"check-circle\"></i> COPE Compliance – Ethical publication practices.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"trending-up\"></i> Impact Beyond Academia – Shaping global innovation.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"library\"></i> Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Google Scholar, Elsevier Mendeley, EuroPub, DRJI</li>\r\n      <li>ResearchBIB, SSRN, Dimensions, Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n      <li>WorldCAT, Exlibris (Clarivate), PLumX, and more</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"file-text\"></i> Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 + GST (Without DOI), ₹1400 + GST (With DOI)</li>\r\n      <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $60 (With DOI)</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"settings\"></i> Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Personalized Author Dashboard with real-time tracking</li>\r\n      <li>Instant generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms</li>\r\n      <li>One-click access to certificates and published papers</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"cta\">\r\n      <h2><i class=\"icon\" data-lucide=\"send\"></i> Ready to Publish?</h2>\r\n      <p>Submit your manuscript to <span class=\"highlight\">INDJCST Journal</span>, one of the <span class=\"highlight\">best computer science journals for publication</span>.</p>\r\n      <a