urnal | Leading Scopus Indexed Computer Science Journal in India','Tag','indjcst-journal-leading-scopus-indexed-computer-science-journal-in-india','INDJCST Journal | Leading Scopus Indexed Computer Science Journal in India','Explore the INDJCST Journal – a reputed open-access Scopus indexed computer science journal publishing high-quality research in AI, Data Science.','INDJCST Journal | Leading Scopus Indexed Computer Science Journal in India','<style>\r\nbody {font-family: \'Poppins\', sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.7; padding:0; margin:0;}\r\nh1, h2, h3 {font-weight:700; color:#0056b3;}\r\nh1 {font-size:2rem; text-align:center; margin:30px 0; animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease-in;}\r\nsection {padding:40px 20px;}\r\nul {list-style:none; padding-left:0;}\r\nli {margin-bottom:10px; display:flex; align-items:center;}\r\nli i {font-size:1.3rem; margin-right:10px; color:#007bff; transition: transform 0.3s;}\r\nli:hover i {transform: scale(1.3);}\r\n@keyframes fadeIn {from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(20px);} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}}\r\n.card {border:1px solid #e3e3e3; border-radius:12px; padding:25px; margin-bottom:25px; transition: all 0.3s ease;}\r\n.card:hover {box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); transform: translateY(-3px);}\r\n.btn-custom {background:#0056b3; color:#fff; border:none; padding:10px 25px; border-radius:8px; transition: background 0.3s;}\r\n.btn-custom:hover {background:#003d82;}\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n  <h1><i class=\"ri-computer-line text-primary\"></i> INDJCST Journal – Scopus Indexed Computer Science Journal</h1>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <p>The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (<b>e-ISSN: 2583-5300</b>) is a reputed, <b>open-access</b> publication that welcomes groundbreaking research across all domains of <b>Computer Science and Technology</b>. Published thrice yearly, the <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> is one of India’s leading <b>Scopus indexed computer science journals</b>, offering academicians, educators, and industry professionals a global platform to disseminate impactful research.</p>\r\n\r\n    <p>The <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> adheres to <b>UGC-CARE</b> and <b>COPE</b> publication ethics, ensuring transparency and academic excellence. Every manuscript undergoes rigorous peer review to uphold the high standards expected from a <b>Scopus indexed computer science journal</b>.</p>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-lightbulb-flash-line text-warning\"></i> Scope of the INDJCST Journal</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-cpu-line text-success\"></i> Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-database-2-line text-danger\"></i> Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-wifi-line text-primary\"></i> Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-cloud-line text-info\"></i> Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-shield-keyhole-line text-warning\"></i> Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-code-s-slash-line text-success\"></i> Software Engineering</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-global-line text-danger\"></i> Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-robot-line text-primary\"></i> Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-brain-line text-info\"></i> Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-star-line text-success\"></i> Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row\">\r\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n        <div class=\"card text-center\">\r\n          <i class=\"ri-timer-flash-line text-primary display-5\"></i>\r\n          <h5 class=\"mt-3\">Rapid Peer Review</h5>\r\n          <p>Get editorial decisions within 3 days, ensuring fast yet reliable review quality.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n        <div class=\"card text-center\">\r\n          <i class=\"ri-earth-line text-success display-5\"></i>\r\n          <h5 class=\"mt-3\">Open Access Policy</h5>\r\n          <p>Your research remains accessible globally, increasing visibility and citation impact.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n        <div class=\"card text-center\">\r\n          <i class=\"ri-shield-check-line text-danger display-5\"></i>\r\n          <h5 class=\"mt-3\">Plagiarism Protection</h5>\r\n          <p>Every submission is screened using advanced tools to maintain academic integrity.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-archive-line text-primary\"></i> Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-google-line text-danger\"></i> Google Scholar</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-book-mark-line text-warning\"></i> Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-file-search-line text-success\"></i> SSRN</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-database-line text-info\"></i> Dimensions</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-open-arm-line text-primary\"></i> EuroPub</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-bar-chart-2-line text-danger\"></i> Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-award-line text-success\"></i> WorldCAT</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-team-line text-warning\"></i> Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-settings-3-line text-danger\"></i> Our Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-upload-cloud-line text-success\"></i> Submit Online – 24/7 through our editorial system</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-mail-send-line text-primary\"></i> Initial Acknowledgment – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-clipboard-line text-info\"></i> Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-check-double-line text-success\"></i> Final Decision – Within 3 days</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-file-list-3-line text-warning\"></i> Instant Publication & Certificate</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-cash-line text-success\"></i> Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n    <p>To sustain open-access publication, a nominal fee applies after acceptance:</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-user-line text-primary\"></i> <b>Indian Authors:</b> 1200 INR (without DOI) / 1400 INR (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-global-line text-danger\"></i> <b>International Authors:</b> $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class=\"text-center\">\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-send-plane-line text-primary\"></i> Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n    <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" class=\"btn btn-custom mt-3\">Submit Now</a>\r\n  </section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(139,'2025-11-18 06:49:33','2025-11-18 06:49:33','tags/xuRsqLgo3yU8XIhiezgSrAQph9xaRM9LPfYs31nM.jpg','INDJCST Journal | Leading Open Access Computer Science Journal in India','Tag','indjcst-journal-leading-open-access-computer-science-journal-in-india','INDJCST Journal | Leading Open Access Computer Science Journal in India','INDJCST Journal is a premier open access computer science journal publishing high-quality peer-reviewed research in AI, Data Science, IoT.','INDJCST Journal | Leading Open Access Computer Science Journal in India','<link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n<link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@3.5.0/fonts/remixicon.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n<style>\r\nbody {font-family: \'Poppins\', sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; margin:0; padding:0;}\r\nh1, h2, h3 {font-weight:700; color:#0056b3;}\r\nh1 {font-size:2rem; text-align:center; 