g\"></i> Research Areas Covered by INDJCST Journal</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-cpu-line text-success\"></i> Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-database-2-line text-danger\"></i> Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-wifi-line text-primary\"></i> Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-cloud-line text-info\"></i> Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-shield-keyhole-line text-warning\"></i> Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-code-box-line text-success\"></i> Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-brain-line text-danger\"></i> Computational Intelligence & Robotics</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-global-line text-primary\"></i> Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-microscope-line text-info\"></i> Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-star-line text-success\"></i> Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row\">\r\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n        <div class=\"card text-center\">\r\n          <i class=\"ri-timer-flash-line text-primary display-5\"></i>\r\n          <h5 class=\"mt-3\">Rapid Peer Review</h5>\r\n          <p>Quick, high-quality evaluations within 3 days — maintaining reliability and transparency.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n        <div class=\"card text-center\">\r\n          <i class=\"ri-earth-line text-success display-5\"></i>\r\n          <h5 class=\"mt-3\">Open Access Policy</h5>\r\n          <p>Immediate global accessibility helps increase visibility and citation for your research.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n        <div class=\"card text-center\">\r\n          <i class=\"ri-shield-check-line text-danger display-5\"></i>\r\n          <h5 class=\"mt-3\">Plagiarism Protection</h5>\r\n          <p>Strict plagiarism screening ensures academic integrity for all submitted papers.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-archive-line text-primary\"></i> Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-google-line text-danger\"></i> Google Scholar</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-book-mark-line text-warning\"></i> Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-file-search-line text-success\"></i> SSRN</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-database-line text-info\"></i> Dimensions</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-open-arm-line text-primary\"></i> EuroPub</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-bar-chart-2-line text-danger\"></i> Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-award-line text-success\"></i> WorldCAT</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-team-line text-warning\"></i> Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-settings-3-line text-danger\"></i> Publication Process of INDJCST Journal</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-upload-cloud-line text-success\"></i> Submit Online: 24/7 submission through our system</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-mail-send-line text-primary\"></i> Acknowledgment: Within 12 hours of submission</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-clipboard-line text-info\"></i> Peer Review: Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-check-double-line text-success\"></i> Final Decision: Acceptance or rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-file-list-3-line text-warning\"></i> Publication & Certificate: Instant access upon publication</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-cash-line text-success\"></i> Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n    <p>To maintain our <b>open access computer science journal</b> operations, minimal fees are charged post-acceptance:</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-user-line text-primary\"></i> <b>Indian Authors:</b> ₹1200 (without DOI) / ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-global-line text-danger\"></i> <b>International Authors:</b> $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-dashboard-3-line text-info\"></i> Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-user-settings-line text-success\"></i> Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-timeline-view-line text-primary\"></i> Real-time Manuscript Tracking</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-file-paper-2-line text-danger\"></i> Automated Acceptance Letters & Copyright Forms</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"ri-download-2-line text-warning\"></i> Instant Certificate & Published Paper Access</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class=\"text-center\">\r\n    <h2><i class=\"ri-send-plane-line text-primary\"></i> Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n    <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" class=\"btn btn-custom mt-3\">Submit Now</a>\r\n  </section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(140,'2025-11-18 06:52:21','2025-11-18 06:52:21','tags/kysP2DMa0tJgl45pjX51aR7Wda9W5v84Hx195MG8.jpg','SCI Indexed Computer Science Journals-INDJCST','Tag','sci-indexed-computer-science-journals-indjcst','SCI Indexed Computer Science Journals-INDJCST','Publish your research in SCI indexed computer science journals with INDJCST. Enjoy low-cost, rapid publication, UGC CARE compliance.','SCI Indexed Computer Science Journals-INDJCST','<h1>SCI Indexed Computer Science Journals</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST serves as a reliable platform for academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share their findings and contribute to the advancement of the field.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>INDJCST adheres to UGC-CARE guidelines and follows a rigorous peer-review process, ensuring that every submission meets the highest standards of scholarly excellence. As a refereed journal, we are committed to maintaining credibility and integrity in academic publishing, offering researchers a trusted space to showcase their work.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4CAF50;\">📘 Scope of the Journal</h2>\r\n<p>The journal covers a broad range of topics related to Computer Science and emerging technologies, including but not limited to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF5722;\">✨ Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decisions within 3 days without compromising quality.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Immediate open access to reach global researchers and industry leaders.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Process:</strong> Streamlined workflow with quick responses at every stage.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Rigorous screening maintains academic integrity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Adherence to COPE’s Best Practice Guidelines.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impact Beyond Academia:</strong> Research influencing policies and lives globally.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2196F3;\">📝 INDJCST Features</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Easy, fast, transparent paper publication process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict Plagiarism policy</li>\r\n  <li>High Visibility & Indexing</li>\r\n  <li>Publication Ethics: COPE’s Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n  <li>Publisher License under Creative Commons By NC ND</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid/Fast Track Publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF9800;\">📚 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (part of Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters - Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PlumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9C27B0;\">🚀 Our Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission through our editorial management system</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Initial Response:</strong> Receive acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Expert Review:</strong> Complete peer review within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Decision Notification:</strong> Acceptance/rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Publication & Certificate:</strong> Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03A9F4;\">💰 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n<p>Open-access publication, freely available online. Minimal fee after manuscript acceptance:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></li>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n    <li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <li><strong>For Other than Indian Authors:</strong></li>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00BCD4;\">🖥️ Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard: Personalized account with submission history and status updates</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time Tracking: Monitor your paper\'s progress through every stage</li>\r\n  <li>Automated Documents: Instant generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms</li>\r\n  <li>Easy Downloads: One-click access to certificates and published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4CAF50;\">📌 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n<p>Submit today: <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6</a></p>'),(141,'2025-11-18 06:53:47','2025-11-18 06:53:47','tags/6UbwMlaOlS2AvlDvtgvCweLPxY3N01g5aGRA0RN5.jpg','INDJCST Journal | IEEE Computer Science Journals','Tag','indjcst-journal-ieee-computer-science-journals','INDJCST Journal | IEEE Computer Science Journals','NDJCST Journal (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) – A peer-reviewed open-access IEEE computer science journal publishing high-quality research in AI, IoT, data science, cybersecurity.','INDJCST Journal | IEEE Computer Science Journals','<style>\r\n  body {\r\n    font-family: \'Segoe UI\', sans-serif;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n    color: #222;\r\n    background: #fff;\r\n    line-height: 1.7;\r\n  }\r\n  h1, h2, h3 {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease;\r\n  }\r\n  h1 {\r\n    color: #0056b3;\r\n    margin-top: 30px;\r\n  }\r\n  h2 {\r\n    color: #e63946;\r\n    margin-top: 40px;\r\n  }\r\n  p, li {\r\n    font-size: 17px;\r\n    max-width: 1000px;\r\n    margin: 10px au