arch ID</li>\r\n    <li>💼 EuroPub, DRJI, and Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section\">\r\n  <h2>🕒 Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n  <ul class=\"icon-list\">\r\n    <li>📤 <strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission system</li>\r\n    <li>📩 <strong>Initial Response:</strong> Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n    <li>🔍 <strong>Peer Review:</strong> Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n    <li>✅ <strong>Decision Notification:</strong> Results within 3 days</li>\r\n    <li>📄 <strong>Publication & Certificate:</strong> Instant access post-acceptance</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section\">\r\n  <h2>💰 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n  <ul class=\"icon-list\">\r\n    <li>🇮🇳 <strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) / ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n    <li>🌎 <strong>International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section\">\r\n  <h2>🧮 Advanced Editorial Management</h2>\r\n  <ul class=\"icon-list\">\r\n    <li>📊 Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n    <li>🔄 Real-Time Tracking of Manuscript Status</li>\r\n    <li>📜 Automated Acceptance and Copyright Letters</li>\r\n    <li>⬇️ One-Click Downloads for Certificates and Papers</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"cta\">\r\n  <h2>🚀 Ready to Publish in INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">Submit Your Paper Now</a>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(142,'2025-11-18 06:55:23','2025-11-18 06:55:23','tags/Enmt1y0aGHxPh7mLq9mD3qVODwcsshQz24gYaWh8.jpg','INDJCST Journal | Elsevier Computer Science Journals | Open Access Publication','Tag','indjcst-journal-elsevier-computer-science-journals-open-access-publication','INDJCST Journal | Elsevier Computer Science Journals | Open Access Publication','INDJCST Journal is a leading open-access publication in computer science and technology, following standards of Elsevier computer science 