ence journals</strong>.\r\n    It publishes peer-reviewed research across all domains of computer science and technology.\r\n    Published three times a year, the INDJCST Journal connects academicians, engineers, and researchers to share innovations that advance global knowledge.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <p>\r\n    Aligned with <strong>UGC-CARE</strong> standards, the <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> ensures a rigorous peer-review process for maintaining scholarly quality and research integrity.\r\n    Its editorial vision parallels that of prestigious <strong>Elsevier computer science journals</strong>, making it a trusted publication for research dissemination.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Areas Covered in INDJCST Journal</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">💡</span> Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">📊</span> Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon orange\">🌐</span> Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon red\">☁️</span> Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon purple\">🔒</span> Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">🧠</span> Software Engineering & Programming</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">🖼️</span> Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon orange\">💬</span> Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon red\">🤖</span> Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon purple\">🧬</span> Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>\r\n    The <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> welcomes interdisciplinary research that merges technology with practical applications. \r\n    Like <strong>Elsevier computer science journals</strong>, it emphasizes innovation, peer review integrity, and broad academic impact.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">⚡</span> <strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Review decisions within 3 days while ensuring quality.</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">🌍</span> <strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Global visibility for authors and research findings.</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon orange\">📈</span> <strong>Efficient Workflow:</strong> Seamless submission and publication tracking.</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon red\">🛡️</span> <strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Rigorous screening for originality and authenticity.</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon purple\">📜</span> <strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Adhering to ethical publication standards.</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">🌟</span> <strong>Impact Beyond Academia:</strong> Research that shapes policies and technology worldwide.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">🔍</span> Google Scholar</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon orange\">📚</span> Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">🌐</span> DRJI, EuroPub, Edocr, SSRN</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon red\">📊</span> Semantic Scholar, Dimensions, PLumX</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon purple\">📁</span> ResearchBIB, WorldCAT, Exlibris</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Our Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">📝</span> Submit Online: 24/7 submission portal</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">📬</span> Initial Response: Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon orange\">👩‍🔬</span> Peer Review: Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon red\">📢</span> Decision: Acceptance or rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon purple\">🏆</span> Publication: Instant access with a digital certificate</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    To maintain open access and continuous publication, a minimal processing fee is charged post-acceptance:\r\n  </p>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">🇮🇳</span> Indian Authors – Without DOI: ₹1200 + GST | With DOI: ₹1400 + GST</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">🌎</span> International Authors – With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon orange\">🧾</span> Personalized author dashboard</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">📊</span> Real-time paper tracking</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">⚙️</span> Automated acceptance letters & copyright forms</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon purple\">📥</span> One-click access to certificates & published papers</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    Join the global network of researchers publishing in the <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong>,\r\n    a trusted name among <strong>Elsevier computer science journals</strong>.\r\n    <br>\r\n    <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">Submit your paper today →</a>\r\n  </p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(143,'2025-11-18 07:08:54','2025-11-18 07:08:54','tags/Yif1jbMfPStGhfZlxOYB92Ekz8n9gxXKNzUdo8Zj.jpg','INDJCST Journal – Top AI Journal for Computer Science Research','Tag','indjcst-journal-top-ai-journal-for-computer-science-research','INDJCST Journal – Top AI Journal for Computer Science Research','INDJCST Journal is a reputed open-access AI journal publishing high-quality research in computer science and technology.','INDJCST Journal – Top AI Journal for Computer Science Research','<style>\r\n    body {\r\n      font-family: \'Segoe UI\', sans-serif;\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      padding: 20px;\r\n      line-height: 1.6;\r\n      color: #222;\r\n      background: #fff;\r\n    }\r\n    h1, h2 {\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    h1 {\r\n      color: #0056b3;\r\n      font-size: 2em;\r\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n    }\r\n    h2 {\r\n      color: #007b5e;\r\n      margin-top: 25px;\r\n    