otes research that transforms industries and improves lives.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">🔎</span>Google Scholar</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">📘</span>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon orange\">📗</span>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon purple\">📙</span>WorldCAT</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon red\">📕</span>Dimensions</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">📚</span>SSRN, DRJI, EuroPub, Semantic Scholar, and more</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Our Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n  <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Submit Online – 24/7 submission via editorial portal</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Initial Response – Acknowledgment within 12 hours</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Expert Review – Peer review within 2 days</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Step 4:</strong> Decision – Acceptance or revision within 3 days</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Step 5:</strong> Publication – Instant PDF access and digital certificate</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n  <p><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\n  Without DOI: ₹1200 + 18% GST<br>\r\n  With DOI: ₹1400 + 18% GST</p>\r\n  <p><strong>For International Authors:</strong><br>\r\n  With DOI: $80 USD</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">🧾</span>Author Dashboard with status tracking</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">🔍</span>Real-time peer review progress</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon purple\">🖨️</span>Instant access to acceptance letters and certificates</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    Join the global research community contributing to AI and computing innovations through <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> — one of the fastest-growing <strong>AI journals</strong> promoting open access knowledge sharing.\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">👉 Submit Your Paper Now</a>\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(144,'2025-11-18 07:11:07','2025-11-18 07:11:07','tags/W4DcFaY17p0pW9ZvOknPjzzTbgrwd0czp50AOnFm.jpg','INDJCST Journal – Leading Machine Learning & Computer Science Research Publication','Tag','indjcst-journal-leading-machine-learning-computer-science-research-publication','INDJCST Journal – Leading Machine Learning & Computer Science Research Publication','INDJCST Journal is a reputed open-access publication in computer science and machine learning journals.','INDJCST Journal – Leading Machine Learning & Computer Science Research Publication','<style>\r\n    body {\r\n      font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      padding: 20px;\r\n      line-height: 1.7;\r\n      background-color: #fff;\r\n      color: #222;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    h1, h2 {\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    h1 {\r\n      color: #004aad;\r\n      font-size: 2em;\r\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    h2 {\r\n      color: #0b8457;\r\n      margin-top: 25px;\r\n      font-size: 1.5em;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    p {\r\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    ul {\r\n      list-style: none;\r\n      padding-left: 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    ul li {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n      transition: transform 0.3s ease;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    ul li:hover {\r\n      transform: translateX(6px);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .icon {\r\n      margin-right: 10px;\r\n      font-size: 1.2em;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .blue { color: #007bff; }\r\n    .green { color: #28a745; }\r\n    .orange { color: #ff9800; }\r\n    .purple { color: #8e44ad; }\r\n    .red { color: #e74c3c; }\r\n\r\n    a {\r\n      color: #007bff;\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    a:hover {\r\n      text-decoration: underline;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\r\n   