hours</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Expert Review – Peer review within 2 days</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Step 4:</strong> Decision – Acceptance/rejection within 3 days</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Step 5:</strong> Publication – Instant access to PDF and digital certificate</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n  <p><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\n  Without DOI: ₹1200 + 18% GST<br>\r\n  With DOI: ₹1400 + 18% GST</p>\r\n  <p><strong>For International Authors:</strong><br>\r\n  With DOI: $80 USD</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon green\">🧾</span>Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon blue\">🔍</span>Real-time Peer Review Tracking</li>\r\n    <li><span class=\"icon purple\">📄</span>Instant Generation of Certificates and Acceptance Letters</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    Publish your next paper in the <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> — one of the most trusted <strong>machine learning journals</strong> promoting innovative, open-access research in AI and computing.\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">👉 Submit Your Paper Now</a>\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(145,'2025-11-18 07:12:28','2025-11-18 07:12:28','tags/H3Ll6jrPohiKsdnnYvX13rT8o46DAt3EMfOS7wVT.jpg','INDJCST Journal – Leading Data Science & Computer Science Research Journal','Tag','indjcst-journal-leading-data-science-computer-science-research-journal','INDJCST Journal – Leading Data Science & Computer Science Research Journal','Publish your research in the INDJCST Journal, a UGC-CARE referred open-access journal in computer science and data science.','INDJCST Journal – Leading Data Science & Computer Science Research Journal','<style>\r\n  body {\r\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n    line-height: 1.7;\r\n    color: #2