stry experts to share cutting-edge findings and drive innovation in computing technologies.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>As one of the most trusted <strong>data science journals</strong> in India, INDJCST adheres to UGC-CARE guidelines and follows a rigorous peer-review process to maintain the highest academic standards. Our commitment to scholarly integrity ensures that every paper published in the <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> contributes meaningfully to the scientific community.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">💡</span>Scope & Focus Areas</h2>\r\n  <p>The <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> covers a broad spectrum of research areas in <strong>computer science and data science</strong>, including but not limited to:</p>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n    <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n    <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n    <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n    <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n    <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n    <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n    <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n    <li>Human–Computer Interaction and Web Technologies</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">🚀</span>Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Get decisions within 3 days while maintaining quality standards.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Reach global researchers, policymakers, and educators instantly.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Efficient Process:</strong> Streamlined submission-to-publication workflow for faster results.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Automated plagiarism checks ensure academic integrity.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Follows COPE’s publication ethics and best practices.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Impact Beyond Academia:</strong> Research that influences thinking and shapes global innovation.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">📊</span>Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n  <p>The <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> is indexed in globally recognized databases, enhancing discoverability for researchers in <strong>data science journals</strong> and technology fields:</p>\r\n  <p>Google Scholar, Elsevier Mendeley, EuroPub, SSRN, WorldCAT, Semantic Scholar, Dimensions, and more.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">⚙️</span>Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission via our editorial management system</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Initial Response:</strong> Within 12 hours</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Expert Review:</strong> Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Decision Notification:</strong> Acceptance/rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Publication & Certificate:</strong> Instant digital certificate and PDF access</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">💰</span>Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n  <p>To maintain open-access availability, a minimal fee is charged after manuscript acceptance:</p>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> Without DOI ₹1200 + GST / With DOI ₹1400 + GST</li>\r\n    <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">📂</span>Advanced Editorial Management</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Author Dashboard with submission tracking</li>\r\n    <li>Real-time progress updates</li>\r\n    <li>Automated generation of acceptance and copyright forms</li>\r\n    <li>Easy one-click download of certificates and published papers</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">📝</span>Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n  <p>Join the growing community of researchers publishing in one of India’s top <strong>data science journals</strong>. Submit your paper to the <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> today and contribute to the advancement of computer science and data science.</p>\r\n  <p><a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>👉 Submit Now</strong></a></p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(146,'2025-11-18 07:14:09','2025-11-18 07:14:09','tags/aeJ98H3dzfjAIDoSDbsMCjqTPVspp19Ch1cfoTSV.jpg','INDJCST Journal – Leading Computer Vision & Computer Science Journal','Tag','indjcst-journal-leading-computer-vision-computer-science-journal','INDJCST Journal – Leading Computer Vision & Computer Science Journal','NDJCST Journal is among the top computer vision journals in India. Publish your research in computer science, AI, and machine learning with UGC-CARE listed credibility and open access.','INDJCST Journal – Leading Computer Vision & Computer Science Journal','<style>\r\n  body {\r\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n    background-color: #fff;\r\n    color: #222;\r\n    line-height: 1.8;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  section {\r\n    padding: 40px 20px;\r\n    max-width: 1100px;\r\n    margin: auto;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h1, h2 {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n    animation: fadeIn 1s ease-in;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h1 {\r\n    color: #004aad;\r\n    font-size: 2.2em;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h2 {\r\n    color: #00897b;\r\n    font-size: 1.7em;\r\n    margin-top: 50px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h3 {\r\n    color: #9c27b0;\r\n    font-size: 1.3em;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  p {\r\n    font-size: 1.05em;\r\n    margin: 16px 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  ul {\r\n    list-style: none;\r\n    padding-left: 0;\r\n    margin: 18px 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  ul li {\r\n    font-size: 1.05em;\r\n    margin: 10px 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  ul li::before {\r\n    content: \"✔\";\r\n    color: #ff9800;\r\n    margin-right: 8px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .icon {\r\n    color: #ff5722;\r\n    margin-right: 6px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  a {\r\n    color: #004aad;\r\n    text-decoration: none;\r\n    transition: color 0.3s ease;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  a:hover {\r\n    color: #d32f2f;\r\n    text-decoration: underline;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .fade-in {\r\n    opacity: 0;\r\n    transform: translateY(20px);\r\n    animation: fadeUp 1.2s forwards;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  @keyframes fadeUp {\r\n    to {\r\n      opacity: 1;\r\n      transform: translateY(0);\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  @keyframes fadeIn {\r\n    from { opacity: 0; }\r\n    to { opacity: 1; }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n    h1 { font-size: 1.8em; }\r\n    h2 { font-size: 1.5em; }\r\n    p, li { font-size: 1em; }\r\n  }\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h1><span class=\"icon\">📘</span>INDJCST Journal – Advancing Research in Computer Vision and Technology</h1>\r\n  <p>The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST Journal)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputed, open-access publication that emphasizes high-quality research across all areas of Computer Science and Technology. Recognized among top <strong>computer vision journals</strong>, INDJCST offers a trusted academic platform for researchers, engineers, educators, and professionals to share their insights and drive innovation.</p>\r\n  \r\n  <p>Published three times a year, the <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> follows UGC-CARE guidelines and a rigorous peer-review process to ensure academic excellence and publishing integrity. As a refereed journal, INDJCST is dedicated to promoting credibility, transparency, and research impact globally.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">💡</span>Scope and Research Areas</h2>\r\n  <p>The <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> welcomes original research papers and review articles in all areas of computing and emerging technologies. Key focus areas include:</p>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n    <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n    <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n    <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n    <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n    <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n    <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n    <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n    <li>Human–Computer Interaction and Web Technologies</li>\r\n    <li>Blockchain, Robotics, and Automation</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>INDJCST encourages interdisciplinary research and practical applications of computing technologies. As one of the emerging <strong>computer vision journals</strong>, it serves as a global knowledge-sharing hub for innovation and discovery.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">🚀</span>Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Get decisions within 3 days without compromising quality.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Global visibility and accessibility for your work.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Efficient Workflow:</strong> Smooth and transparent publication process.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Ensures originality and scholarly integrity.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Published ethically following COPE guidelines.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Global Impact:</strong> INDJCST Journal promotes impactful research beyond academia.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">📊</span>Indexing and Abstracting</h2>\r\n  <p>The <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> is indexed in several global databases to enhance the discoverability of research in <strong>computer vision journals</strong> and related domains.</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Major Indexing Platforms:</strong> Google Scholar, Elsevier Mendeley, EuroPub, SSRN, Semantic Scholar, Dimensions, DRJI, WorldCAT, and more.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">⚙️</span>Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission via our editorial management system</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Initial Response:</strong> Within 12 hours</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Expert Review:</strong> Completed in 2 days</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Decision Notification:</strong> Within 3 days</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Publication & Certificate:</strong> Instant access to published paper and e-certificate</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">💰</span>Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n  <p>The <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> is an open-access <strong>computer vision journal</strong>, allowing free worldwide access to published content. To maintain operations and ensure quality, a minimal publication fee applies after acceptance:</p>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 + GST (without DOI) / ₹1400 + GST (with DOI)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">📂</span>Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Personalized author dashboard with real-time tracking</li>\r\n    <li>Instant generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms</li>\r\n    <li>One-click download of certificates and published articles</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"fade-in\">\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">📝</span>Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n  <p>Join the global community of scholars publishing in the <strong>INDJCST Journal</strong> — a leading choice among <strong>computer vision journals</strong> in India. Publish your innovative work today and amplify its global reach.</p>\r\n  <p><a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>👉 Submit Your Paper</strong></a></p>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(147,'2025-11-18 07:18:14','2025-11-18 07:18:14','tags/XrEmY0omS2ZwnURJu7gTqfk4IqY4b5hqvkS4FvSx.jpg','INDJCST Journal – Leading Deep Learning Journal for Computer Science Research','Tag','indjcst-journal-leading-deep-learning-journal-for-computer-science-research','INDJCST Journal – Leading Deep Learning Journal for Computer Science Research','INDJCST Journal is an open-access deep learning journal publishing peer-reviewed research in computer science, AI, data science, and emerging technologies.','INDJCST Journal – Leading Deep Learning Journal for Computer Science Research','<style>\r\n  body {\r\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n    line-height: 1.6;\r\n    color: #222;\r\n    background-color: #fff;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .container {\r\n    max-width: 1000px;\r\n    margin: auto;\r\n    padding: 20px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h1, h2, h3 {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h1 {\r\n    color: #0056b3;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h2 {\r\n    color: #00796b;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h3 {\r\n    color: #8e24aa;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  p {\r\n    margin: 15px 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  ul {\r\n    list-style: none;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  li {\r\n    padding-left: 30px;\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    margin: 8px 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  li::before {\r\n    content: \"✔\";\r\n    color: #007bff;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    left: 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .section {\r\n    margin: 40px 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .highlight {\r\n    background: #f9f9f9;\r\n    border-left: 5px solid #007bff;\r\n    padding: 15px;\r\n    border-radius: 5px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .cta {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    margin-top: 40px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .cta a {\r\n    text-decoration: none;\r\n    background: #007bff;\r\n    color: #fff;\r\n    padding: 12px 25px;\r\n    border-radius: 25px;\r\n    transition: 0.3s;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .cta a:hover {\r\n    background: #0056b3;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n    h1, h2, h3 { font-size: 1.2em; }\r\n    .container { padding: 15px; }\r\n  }\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n  <h1>INDJCST Journal – Deep Learning and Computer Science Research</h1>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <p>\r\n      The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access publication focused on advancing high-quality research across all domains of computer science and deep learning. Published thrice yearly, the INDJCST Journal provides a platform for academicians, engineers, educators, and industry professionals to share innovative findings and contribute to the global development of computer science research.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n      Adhering to <strong>UGC-CARE guidelines</strong>, INDJCST ensures a rigorous peer-review process that upholds academic credibility and publication integrity. As one of the leading <strong>deep learning journals</strong>, it maintains scholarly standards while offering a reliable space for researchers to present their discoveries.\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Scope of the INDJCST Journal</h2>\r\n    <p>The INDJCST Journal covers a wide range of computer science and technology topics, including:</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n      <li>Deep Learning and Neural Networks</li>\r\n      <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n      <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n      <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n      <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n      <li>Computer Vision and Image Processing</li>\r\n      <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n      <li>Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n      <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section highlight\">\r\n    <h2>Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Get editorial decisions within 3 days without compromising quality.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Your work is instantly accessible to global researchers and policymakers.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>Efficient Publication:</strong> Fast and transparent workflow from submission to publication.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Advanced plagiarism detection ensures content integrity.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> We follow COPE’s best ethical publishing standards.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>Impactful Research:</strong> Research that shapes technology and drives innovation.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n    <p>INDJCST Journal is indexed in leading databases and repositories including:</p>\r\n    <p><strong>Google Scholar, Elsevier Mendeley, EuroPub, SSRN, DRJI, Semantic Scholar, Dimensions, WorldCAT</strong> and others.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Submit Online: 24/7 submission via our editorial system</li>\r\n      <li>Initial Response: Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n      <li>Expert Review: Peer review completed within 2 days</li>\r\n      <li>Decision Notification: Acceptance or rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n      <li>Publication: Instant PDF and certificate availability</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n    <p><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Without DOI: ₹1200 + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li>With DOI: ₹1400 + 18% GST</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n    <p><strong>For International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (With DOI)</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Advanced Editorial System</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Author Dashboard with submission tracking</li>\r\n      <li>Automated acceptance letters and copyright forms</li>\r\n      <li>Instant downloads for certificates and published papers</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"cta\">\r\n    <h3>Ready to Publish Your Research?</h3>\r\n    <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">Submit Now</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(148,'2025-11-18 07:20:26','2025-11-18 07:20:26','tags/i8NdYG1UKEdj5wutn1NwK3mW0Hw1I9cPJ5Q9z6fS.jpg','Robotics Journals | INDJCST – Fast Publication, UGC CARE, Google Scholar Indexed','Tag','robotics-journals-indjcst-fast-publication-ugc-care-google-scholar-indexed','Robotics Journals | INDJCST – Fast Publication, UGC CARE, Google Scholar Indexed','Explore INDJCST – one of India’s leading robotics journals offering low-cost, rapid publication of computer science research indexed in Google Scholar and UGC CARE compliant.','Robotics Journals | INDJCST – Fast Publication, UGC CARE, Google Scholar Indexed','<style>\r\n  body {\r\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n    line-height: 1.6;\r\n    color: #222;\r\n    background: #fff;\r\n    overflow-x: hidden;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .container {\r\n    max-width: 1000px;\r\n    margin: auto;\r\n    padding: 20px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h1, h2, h3 {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n    opacity: 0;\r\n    transform: translateY(20px);\r\n    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s forwards;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  @keyframes fadeInUp {\r\n    to {\r\n      opacity: 1;\r\n      transform: translateY(0);\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h1 { color: #004aad; }\r\n  h2 { color: #00897b; }\r\n  h3 { color: #8e24aa; }\r\n\r\n  p { margin: 15px 0; }\r\n\r\n  ul {\r\n    list-style: none;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  li {\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    padding-left: 30px;\r\n    margin: 8px 0;\r\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  li:hover { transform: translateX(3px); }\r\n\r\n  li::before {\r\n    content: \"⚙️\";\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    left: 0;\r\n    font-size: 1.1em;\r\n    color: #007bff;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .section {\r\n    margin: 40px 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .highlight {\r\n    background: #f9f9f9;\r\n    border-left: 5px solid #007bff;\r\n    padding: 15px;\r\n    border-radius: 6px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .cta {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    margin-top: 40px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .cta a {\r\n    text-decoration: none;\r\n    background: #007bff;\r\n    color: #fff;\r\n    padding: 12px 25px;\r\n    border-radius: 25px;\r\n    transition: 0.3s;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .cta a:hover {\r\n    background: #0056b3;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n    h1, h2, h3 { font-size: 1.2em; }\r\n    .container { padding: 15px; }\r\n  }\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n  <h1>Robotics Journals | INDJCST – Fast, Low-Cost Computer Science Publications</h1>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <p>\r\n      The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is one of India’s most reputable <strong>robotics journals</strong> and a <strong>UGC-CARE compliant</strong> publication offering <strong>low-cost, fast publication</strong> of cutting-edge research in <strong>computer science</strong> and technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST provides a dynamic platform for educators, academicians, engineers, and researchers to present innovative studies in <strong>robotics and automation</strong>, deep learning, and emerging technologies.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n      With <strong>rapid publication</strong> timelines and indexing in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, INDJCST ensures that every accepted article gains maximum global reach. Our strict peer-review process and <strong>fast publication</strong> workflow make it a preferred choice among authors seeking visibility and academic credibility.\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Scope of INDJCST – Leading Robotics Journal</h2>\r\n    <p>Our journal welcomes innovative and interdisciplinary research papers in the following areas:</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n      <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n      <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n      <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n      <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n      <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n      <li>Computer Vision and Image Processing</li>\r\n      <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n      <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n      <li>Embedded Systems and Control</li>\r\n      <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n      <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section highlight\">\r\n    <h2>Why Choose INDJCST – The Best Low-Cost Robotics Journal?</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Editorial decisions within 3 days for faster publication.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>Low-Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable article processing fees for researchers worldwide.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Global reach via Google Scholar and other academic platforms.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>UGC-CARE Standard:</strong> Compliant with all UGC-CARE quality and ethical guidelines.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Ethical publishing following COPE’s best practices.</li>\r\n      <li><strong>Impact Beyond Academia:</strong> Research that influences innovation, education, and industry.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Indexing & Abstracting Databases</h2>\r\n    <p>INDJCST is proudly indexed in top global repositories, ensuring maximum visibility for your research:</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n      <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n      <li>DRJI, EuroPub, SSRN</li>\r\n      <li>Dimensions, WorldCAT, Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n      <li>Exlibris (Clarivate), ResearchBIB, I2OR</li>\r\n      <li>PLumX Metrics and Academic Keys</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Fast Publication Process – Designed for Authors</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Submit Online: 24/7 submission through the editorial system</li>\r\n      <li>Initial Response: Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n      <li>Expert Review: Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n      <li>Decision Notification: Acceptance or rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n      <li>Instant Publication: Online PDF and certificate access</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Article Processing Charges (Low-Cost)</h2>\r\n    <p><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Without DOI: ₹1200 + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li>With DOI: ₹1400 + 18% GST</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n    <p><strong>For International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (With DOI)</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section\">\r\n    <h2>Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Personalized Author Dashboard with tracking tools</li>\r\n      <li>Real-time submission updates</li>\r\n      <li>Automated generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms</li>\r\n      <li>Instant certificate and publication download options</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"cta\">\r\n    <h3>Ready to Publish Your Robotics Research?</h3>\r\n    <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">Submit Your Paper Now</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(149,'2025-11-18 07:22:28','2025-11-18 07:22:28','tags/SVZCypIxnkpIrMMl5uCae3FxJdzp06dYDMiX5WlI.jpg','Cyber Security Journals | UGC CARE | Low Cost & Rapid Publication','Tag','cyber-security-journals-ugc-care-low-cost-rapid-publication','Cyber Security Journals | UGC CARE | Low Cost & Rapid Publication','Explore top Cyber Security Journals for computer science research. Low cost, rapid publication, UGC CARE & Google Scholar indexed with fast peer review and open access.','Cyber Security Journals | UGC CARE | Low Cost & Rapid Publication','<style>\r\n    body {\r\n      font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      padding: 0;\r\n      line-height: 1.8;\r\n      color: #222;\r\n      background: #fff;\r\n    }\r\n    section {\r\n      padding: 40px 20px;\r\n      max-width: 1100px;\r\n      margin: auto;\r\n    }\r\n    h1, h2 {\r\n      color: #0056b3;\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease-in-out;\r\n    }\r\n    h3 {\r\n      color: #0078d7;\r\n      margin-top: 25px;\r\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n    }\r\n    p {\r\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\r\n      font-size: 17px;\r\n    }\r\n    ul {\r\n      list-style: none;\r\n      padding: 0;\r\n    }\r\n    li {\r\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      gap: 10px;\r\n      transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    li:hover {\r\n      transform: translateX(6px);\r\n    }\r\n    li i {\r\n      color: #0078d7;\r\n      font-size: 20px;\r\n    }\r\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\r\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }\r\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\r\n    }\r\n    .icon {\r\n      color: #0a84ff;\r\n      font-size: 18px;\r\n    }\r\n    .highlight {\r\n      color: #0078d7;\r\n      font-weight: bold;\r\n    }\r\n    .cta {\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      margin-top: 30px;\r\n    }\r\n    .cta a {\r\n      background: #0056b3;\r\n      color: #fff;\r\n      padding: 12px 24px;\r\n      border-radius: 6px;\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n      transition: background 0.3s;\r\n    }\r\n    .cta a:hover {\r\n      background: #0078d7;\r\n    }\r\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n      h1, h2 { font-size: 22px; }\r\n      p { font-size: 16px; }\r\n    }\r\n  </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h1>Cyber Security Journals – UGC CARE, Low Cost & Fast Publication</h1>\r\n    <p>\r\n      The <span class=\"highlight\">Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</span> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is one of India’s most trusted <strong>cyber security journals</strong> offering <strong>low cost</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> options. As an open-access platform, it enables researchers, academicians, and professionals in <strong>computer science</strong> to share quality research that advances innovation and strengthens cyber resilience worldwide.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n      INDJCST is a <strong>UGC CARE–compliant cyber security journal</strong> following a rigorous peer-review process. The journal is <strong>indexed in Google Scholar</strong> and maintains high ethical standards through COPE compliance and transparent review workflows, ensuring authors experience <strong>fast publication</strong> and credible exposure.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Focus Areas in Cyber Security & Computer Science</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🧠</i> Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning in Cyber Defense</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🧩</i> Data Science, Big Data Analytics & Threat Intelligence</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🌐</i> Internet of Things (IoT) and Network Security</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">☁️</i> Cloud Computing and Cybersecurity Frameworks</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🔐</i> Cryptography, Blockchain & Secure Transactions</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">💻</i> Software Engineering & Secure Coding</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">📱</i> Mobile Security & Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🦾</i> Robotics, Automation, and Embedded System Security</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Why Choose INDJCST Cyber Security Journal?</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">⚡</i> <strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Get feedback and publication decisions within 3 days.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🌍</i> <strong>Open Access:</strong> Your research gains global visibility across academic and industrial audiences.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">💨</i> <strong>Fast Publication Process:</strong> From submission to online publication in record time.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🛡️</i> <strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Ensures originality and maintains research integrity.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">📚</i> <strong>UGC CARE & Google Scholar Indexed:</strong> Enhances credibility and discoverability of your research.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">💼</i> <strong>Low Cost:</strong> Affordable publication fees for both Indian and international authors.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Indexing & Abstracting Databases</h2>\r\n    <p>\r\n      INDJCST is indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, Scribd, ISSUU, Elsevier Mendeley, EuroPub, DRJI, Academic Keys, I2OR, ResearchBIB, SSRN, WorldCAT, Exlibris, and Dimensions — making it one of the most visible <strong>cyber security journals</strong> in the <strong>computer science</strong> field.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Fast & Transparent Publication Workflow</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">📝</i> Online Submission: 24/7 access via our editorial management system.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">📩</i> Initial Response: Acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🔍</i> Peer Review: Completed within 2 days by domain experts.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">📄</i> Decision Notification: Acceptance/Rejection within 3 days.</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🏅</i> Publication & Certificate: Instant digital certificate & DOI access.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Article Processing Charges (Low Cost Open Access)</h2>\r\n    <p>\r\n      To maintain open-access availability, a minimal processing fee is charged post-acceptance:\r\n    </p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🇮🇳</i> Indian Authors: ₹1200 (without DOI) / ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">🌏</i> International Authors: $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Advanced Editorial System</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">📊</i> Author Dashboard for real-time tracking</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">📈</i> Automated document generation & status updates</li>\r\n      <li><i class=\"icon\">📥</i> One-click access to certificates & published papers</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"cta\">\r\n      <p><strong>Ready to Publish Your Cyber Security Research?</strong></p>\r\n      <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">Submit Your Paper Now</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>'),(150,'2025-11-18 07:24:25','2025-11-18 07:24:25','tags/DEWRgDiqHY6iKmBRWFXC3liGdmx998Q4xf8Tqepu.jpg','IoT Journals | INDJCST – Fast Publication, Low Cost, UGC CARE Indexed','Tag','iot-journals-indjcst-fast-publication-low-cost-ugc-care-indexed','IoT Journals | INDJCST – Fast Publication, Low Cost, UGC CARE Indexed','INDJCST – One of India\'s top IoT journals offering low-cost, rapid publication of computer science research indexed in Google Scholar and compliant with UGC CARE.','IoT Journals | INDJCST – Fast Publication, Low Cost, UGC CARE Indexed','<style>\r\n  body {\r\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n    background: #ffffff;\r\n    color: #222;\r\n    line-height: 1.6;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .container {\r\n    max-width: 1000px;\r\n    margin: auto;\r\n    padding: 20px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h1, h2, h3 {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n    opacity: 0;\r\n    transform: translateY(20px);\r\n    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s forwards;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  h1 { color: #004aad; }\r\n  h2 { color: #00897b; }\r\n  h3 { color: #8e24aa; }\r\n\r\n  @keyframes fadeInUp {\r\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\