I — $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Editorial System -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e90ff; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n  <span>🖥️</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Author dashboard with submission history</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time paper tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated acceptance letters & copyright</li>\r\n  <li>Easy one-click access to certificates and published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ CTA -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff1493; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n  <span>🚀</span> Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  Publish with one of the <strong>best open access journals in India</strong> \r\n  offering fast, transparent, and low-cost publication in Computer Science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" \r\n     target=\"_blank\" \r\n     style=\"color:#0055aa; font-weight:600; text-decoration:underline;\">\r\n    Submit Your Paper\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(173,'2025-11-18 09:36:45','2025-11-18 09:36:45','tags/jYKJbTrMBOWrffyrPi5z3YapKewUGrqPmqFOW9DN.jpg','Artificial Intelligence Journals | INDJCST','Tag','artificial-intelligence-journals-indjcst','Artificial Intelligence Journals | INDJCST','NDJCST is a leading artificial intelligence journal offering low-cost, fast publication, rapid peer review, Google Scholar indexing.','Artificial Intelligence Journals | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0066cc; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  Artificial Intelligence Journals – INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology <strong>(INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, \r\n  <strong>open-access</strong> peer-reviewed journal. It publishes high-quality research papers across all domains of \r\n  <strong>Computer Science and Technology</strong>. Published three times a year, INDJCST serves as a trusted platform \r\n  for academicians, educators, researchers, engin