ish high-quality research in <strong>machine learning journals 2026</strong> and broader domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST provides a reliable platform for academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  INDJCST adheres to <strong>UGC-CARE</strong> guidelines with rigorous peer-review, ensuring scholarly excellence, transparency, and editorial integrity. As a refereed journal, we ensure credibility and provide a trusted space for researchers to showcase their innovations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00897b; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  🔍 Scope & Fields We Cover\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  Interdisciplinary research is encouraged — especially where innovative technologies address real-world challenges.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#c62828; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  ⚡ Why Choose INDJCST Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> — Decisions within 3 days ✅</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access</strong> — Broader global reach 🌐</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Process</strong> — Quick responses at every stage ⏱️</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection</strong> — Strict screening 🔎</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance</strong> — Global publication ethics ✅</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impactful Research</strong> — Drives policies and industry change 📈</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  ⭐ INDJCST Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-Reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Easy, Fast, Transparent & Rapid Publication</li>\r\n  <li>Strict Plagiarism Policy</li>\r\n  <li>Simple Article Submission Process</li>\r\n  <li>High Visibility & Indexing</li>\r\n  <li>Publication Ethics — COPE Guidelines</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons BY-NC-ND License</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n  <li>Fast Track Publication Available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0277bd; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  📚 Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"columns:2; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters — Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  ✅ Streamlined Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Submit Online — 24/7</li>\r\n  <li>Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Expert Peer Review — 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Decision — within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ef6c00; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  💰 Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  Being open-access, published articles are freely available worldwide. A minimal fee is applied after acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors</strong>:\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors</strong>: $80 USD (With DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#512da8; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  🖥️ Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time Tracking at Every Stage</li>\r\n  <li>Automated Acceptance Letters & Copyright Forms</li>\r\n  <li>Easy One-Click Downloads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ad1457; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  🚀 Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  Start publishing your research in top-ranked <strong>machine learning journals 2026</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1565c0; font-weight:bold;\">\r\n    👉 Submit Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(175,'2025-11-18 09:46:30','2025-11-18 09:46:30','tags/nFX3oyp8SfwArIyDfFkme1U2r2x7yFVd5lff50Cb.jpg','Data Science Journals in India','Tag','data-science-journals-in-india','Data Science Journals in India','INDJCST strictly follows <strong>UGC-CARE guidelines</strong> and a rigorous peer-review process, ensuring every manuscript meets the highest standards of scholarly excellence.','Data Science Journals in India','<h1 style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:16px;\">Data Science Journals in India</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is 