ication.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Strict quality checks powered by automated systems.</p>\r\n<p><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Follows globally recognized publication ethics.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Societal Impact:</strong> Research that drives innovation, policies, and global development.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#5cb85c; margin-top:32px;\">\r\n✅ Key Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed, refereed journal</li>\r\n  <li>Low-cost & <strong>rapid publication</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Transparent process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism screening</li>\r\n  <li>Easy article submission</li>\r\n  <li>Good impact factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n  <li>Fast Track / Rapid Publication options</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons License (CC BY-NC-ND)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9b59b6; margin-top:32px;\">\r\n📚 Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters - Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f0ad4e; margin-top:32px;\">\r\n📄 Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Experience a smooth and author-friendly workflow:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 online submission</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Acknowledgment:</strong> Within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Expert Review:</strong> Completed in 2 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Decision:</strong> Acceptance/Rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Publication:</strong> Immediate PDF upload & digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\