icians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals in sharing their innovative work globally.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\nINDJCST follows UGC-CARE aligned standards and uses a rigorous peer-review system to ensure academic excellence. As a refereed journal, we provide a trusted space for publishing research with credibility and scholarly integrity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Multi-Coloured Subtitle + Icon -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0066cc; margin-top:24px;\">\r\n📚 Domains Covered in Deep Learning & Computer Science\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:12px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Multi-Coloured Subtitle -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff6600; margin-top:28px;\">\r\n⚡ Why Choose INDJCST Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\n<b>Rapid Peer Review:</b> Decisions provided within 3 days without compromising quality.\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\n<b>Open Access:</b> Research is visible globally to policymakers, industries, and scholars.\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\n<b>Efficient Processing:</b> Quick, transparent steps from submission to publication.\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\n<b>Plagiarism Protection:</b> Strict 