nce/rejection within 3 days</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><b>Publication + Certificate:</b> Instant digital access</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Multi-Coloured Subtitle -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#cc3300; margin-top:28px;\">\r\n💰 Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\nOpen-access platform ensures global reach. Minimal APC applies after acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:12px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Indian Authors – Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li>Indian Authors – With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li>International Authors – With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Multi-Coloured Subtitle -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#006699; margin-top:28px;\">\r\n🖥️ Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:12px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized author dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time progress tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated acceptance letters & copyright forms</li>\r\n  <li>One-click downloads: certificates & publications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#cc0066; margin-top:32px;\">✅ Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\nSubmit today:\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">\r\nhttps://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\r\n</a>\r\n</p>'),(177,'2025-11-18 09:51:01','2025-11-18 09:51:01','tags/A9WEHLQXZ5G6RFbB6FFnHbKGBpjurMtIH154uTA3.jpg','Computer Vision Journals | INDJCST','Tag','computer-vision-journals-indjcst','Computer Vision Journals | INDJCST','Publish in top computer vision journals with INDJCST. Low-cost, fast publication, UGC CARE aligned.','Computer Vision Journals | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"margin-top:20px; font-weight:700; color:#1a237e;\">\r\n  Computer Vision Journals – INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\r\n  The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputed, open-access scholarly platform for high-quality publications in\r\n  <strong>computer science, deep learning, and computer vision journals</strong>. Published tri-annually, the journal provides a professional forum for researchers,\r\n  engineers, educators, and industry experts to share impactful findings and drive technological innovation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\r\n  INDJCST follows strict <strong>UGC-CARE guidelines</strong> and a rigorous peer-review process, enabling researchers to publish trustworthy, peer-reviewed research\r\n  in fast publication timelines. As a respected <strong>refereed journal</strong>, the publication maintains top-tier global standards in academic excellence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:#00897b;\">\r\n  <span>📘</span> Focus Areas\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\n  The journal features a wide spectrum of computer science and engineering domains, including:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:12px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Vision & Image Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded & Computer Networks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\r\n  The journal encourages interdisciplinary research that drives the application of emerging technologies toward real-world innovation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:#ad1457;\">\r\n  <span>🚀</span> Why Choose INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:12px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>🔹 Rapid Peer Review – Decision within 3 days</li>