:#8d6e63;\">\r\n  <span>💰</span> Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:12px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Indian Authors: 1200 INR + 18% GST (without DOI)</li>\r\n  <li>Indian Authors: 1400 INR + 18% GST (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li>Foreign Authors: $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:#0277bd;\">\r\n  <span>📑</span> Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:12px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated documentation</li>\r\n  <li>Easy download of certificates & published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:#2e7d32;\">\r\n  <span>📨</span> Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\n  Submit your manuscript today for fast publication in\r\n  <strong>computer vision journals</strong>:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#0d47a1; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    Submit Online →\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(178,'2025-11-18 09:54:32','2025-11-18 09:54:32','tags/wogJSy6hKnNwywr9Z4Q06fEZsZTs69PQ2ilxfVzn.jpg','Natural Language Processing Journals – INDJCST','Tag','natural-language-processing-journals-indjcst','Natural Language Processing Journals – INDJCST','INDJCST follows UGC-CARE principles, rapid publication workflow, and strong ethical standards supported by COPE','Natural Language Processing Journals – INDJCST','<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Natural Language Processing Journals – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is an\r\nopen-access, peer-reviewed journal committed to publishing high-quality research in\r\nComputer Science & Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST enables researchers,\r\nacademicians, engineers, and industry professionals to contribute impactful research\r\nacross domains including <strong>natural language processing journals</strong>, AI, ML, and more.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nINDJCST follows UGC-CARE principles, rapid publication workflow, and strong ethical\r\nstandards supported by COPE. Through a rigorous peer-review model, the journal ensures\r\nacademic integrity and high-quality scholarly work with global visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Scope Section -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0A84FF; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>📌</span>Scope & Research Areas\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nWe welcome interdisciplinary submissions across major Computer Science branches:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Natural Language Processing (NLP)</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Why Choose -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF5722; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>⭐</span>Why Publish With INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid peer review</strong> – decisions in as fa