 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Decision – acceptance/rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Publication + Certificate – instant online</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ APC -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03A9F4; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>💰</span>Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong></li>\r\n  <ul style=\"padding-left:20px;\">\r\n    <li>Without DOI: ₹1200 + 18% GST</li>\r\n    <li>With DOI: ₹1400 + 18% GST</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Editorial System -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4CAF50; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>🖥️</span>Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard for complete history</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time submission tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Instant automated documents</li>\r\n  <li>Easy download of published certificates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ CTA -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF9800; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>🚀</span>Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript today and join the top <strong>natural language processing journals</strong> publishing community.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#0A84FF; font-weight:bold;\">\r\n👉 Submit Now\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ End -->'),(179,'2025-11-18 09:59:52','2025-11-18 09:59:52','tags/xJJsqoetJxrgGEluu9QwIpuoaICPrMWMr20htp70.jpg','AI Open Access Journals | Low-Cost Fast Publication | INDJCST','Tag','ai-open-access-journals-low-cost-fast-publication-indjcst','AI Open Access Journals | Low-Cost Fast Publication | INDJCST','NDJCST offers AI open access journals with low-cost, fast publication, UGC CARE alignment, Google Scholar indexing.','AI Open Access Journals | Low-Cost Fast Publication | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">AI Open Access Journals – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is an \r\nopen-access, peer-reviewed journal publishing high-quality research across all domains of \r\nComputer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST offers a trusted \r\nplatform for academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to present \r\ntheir latest research work in <strong>AI open access journals</strong> and related fields.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nINDJCST adheres to UGC-CARE guidelines and maintains a rigorous peer-review process to ensure \r\nscholarly excellence. As a reputable refereed journal, we uphold academic integrity and \r\nprovide a credible space for impactful scientific contributions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Scope -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0A84FF; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>📌</span>Scope & Subject Areas\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nINDJCST welcomes interdisciplinary work with real-world applications in computing and emerging technology.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Why Choose -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF5722; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>⭐</span>Why Publish With INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Rapid peer review — decisions within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Low-cost, fast publication</li>\r\n  <li>Open access for maximum visibility</li>\r\n  <li>Efficient editorial process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism screening</li>\r\n  <li>COPE-compliant publication ethics</li>\r\n  <li>High global research reach</li>\r\n  <li>Indexed in Google Scholar</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Features -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4CAF50; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>✅</span>Key Journal Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed, refereed journal</li>\r\n  <li>Fast track publication available</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism policy</li>\r\n  <li>Simple publication workflow</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons BY-NC-ND license</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Indexing -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9C27B0; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>📚</span>Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Publication Process -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E91E63; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>⚡</span>Fast Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Submit online anytime</li>\r\n  <li>Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Peer review completed in 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Decision notification within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Publication + Certificate available instantly</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ APC -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03A9F4; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>💰</span>Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong></li>\r\n  <ul style=\"padding-left:20px;\">\r\n    <li>Without DOI: ₹1200 + 18% GST</li>\r\n    <li>With DOI: ₹1400 + 18% GST</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Editorial System -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#795548; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>🖥️</span>Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized author dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time manuscript tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated acceptance forms</li>\r\n  <li>One-click certificate & paper downloads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ CTA -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF9800; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>🚀</span>Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\nSubmit your next Computer Science paper with INDJCST, one of the preferred \r\n<strong>AI open access journals</strong> for fast publication and global recognition.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#0A84FF; font-weight:bold;\">\r\n    👉 Submit Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(180,'2025-11-18 10:03:11','2025-11-18 10:03:11','tags/demJTJr1t7VeCqF6h75bzQSJRj2Udz0MYNlh6pCW.jpg','Robotics Journals 2026','Tag','robotics-journals-2026','Robotics Journals 2026','Discover Robotics Journals 2026 for low-cost, rapid publication in computer science, robotics, AI, IoT, and emerging tech.','Robotics Journals 2026','<h2 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #2563eb;\"> <span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#2563eb\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><rect x=\"9\" y=\"4\" width=\"6\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/></svg> </span> Robotics Journals 2026: Explore, Publish, Impact </h2> <section style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5em;\"> <h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #16a34a;\"> <span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#16a34a\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"7\"/></svg> </span> INDJCST: Trusted Research Platform </h3> <p> The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST, e-ISSN: 2583-5300) publishes quality articles in robotics and all computer science fields. Published thrice yearly, INDJCST supports rapid publication and affordable open-access, serving a broad audience of academics and professionals. </p> </section> <section style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5em;\"> <h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #f59e42;\"> <span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#f59e42\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"7\"/></svg> </span> Fast, Affordable, & Ethical </h3> <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 0 1.5em;\"> <li>Rapid peer review: decision in just 3 days</li> <li>Minimal fees: ₹1200/₹1400 INR for Indians, $80 USD for internationals</li> <li>Strict plagiarism screening and COPE compliance</li> <li>Immediate open-access for global visibility</li> <li>Efficient digital workflow for certificates and publication</li> <li>Indexing in Google Scholar, Dimensions, WorldCAT, Semantic Scholar, Mendeley, and more</li> </ul> </section> <section style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5em;\"> <h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #0ea5e9;\"> <span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"12,3 21,14 3,14\" /></svg> </span> Key Research Areas </h3> <div style=\"column-count: 2; column-gap: 2em;\"> <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 0 1.5em;\"> <li>Artificial Intelligence & ML</li> <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li> <li>Robotics & Automation</li> <li>Cloud Computing</li> <li>Cybersecurity</li> <li>Software Engineering</li> <li>Big Data Analytics</li> <li>Computer Vision & NLP</li> <li>Blockchain</li> <li>Embedded Systems</li> <li>Computational Intelligence</li> <li>Bioinformatics</li> <li>Database Management</li> </ul> </div> </section> <section style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5em;\"> <h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #a21caf;\"> <span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#a21caf\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"7\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg> </span> Streamlined Publishing </h3> <ol style=\"margin: 0 0 0 1.5em;\"> <li>Submit Online: Anytime via our secure portal</li> <li>Acknowledgement: Receive confirmation in 12 hours</li> <li>Peer Review: Decision in 2 days</li> <li>Notification: Acceptance/rejection in 3 days</li> <li>Instant Publication & Certificate access</li> </ol> </section> <section style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5em;\"> <h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #0d9488;\"> <span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" fill=\"#0d9488\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"14\" width=\"16\" height=\"2\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg> </span> Author Dashboard Benefits </h3> <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 0 1.5em;\"> <li>Personal account for progress tracking</li> <li>Live status updates and document downloads</li> <li>Automated letters and copyright forms</li> </ul> </section> <section style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5em;\"> <h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #eab308;\"> <span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#eab308\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><rect x=\"9\" y=\"7\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\"/></svg> </span> Submit Your Manuscript </h3> <p> Join a dynamic scholarly community advancing robotics and computer science—publish with speed and impact.<br /> <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#2563eb;text-decoration:underline;\">Submit Research Now</a> </p> </section>'),(181,'2025-11-18 10:04:40','2025-11-18 10:04:40','tags/lYXfSTynIi0zELse0og0kUg2Be0LiS7X18DiqPpW.jpg','Autonomous Systems Journals| INDJCST','Tag','autonomous-systems-journals-indjcst','Autonomous Systems Journals| INDJCST','NDJCST is one of the leading autonomous systems journals in computer science, offering low cost, fast publication.','Autonomous Systems Journals| INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#004080; text-align:center; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#555; margin-bottom:30px;\">\r\n  (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) | Autonomous Systems Journals | Low Cost | Fast Publication | UGC CARE Indexed\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n  INDJCST is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST serves as a reliable platform for academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share their findings and contribute to the advancement of the field. As an emerging name among autonomous systems journals, it supports researchers seeking low-cost and rapid publication options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n  INDJCST adheres to UGC-CARE guidelines and follows a rigorous peer-review process ensuring that every submission meets the highest standards of scholarly excellence. Committed to ethical publishing, it provides transparent and efficient paper management — ideal for authors looking for fast publication in indexed autonomous systems journals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0077b6; margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"color:#ff6600;\">⚙️</span> Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics, Automation, and Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n  INDJCST welcomes interdisciplinary submissions, including those focused on autonomous systems, robotics, AI, and computation. The journal promotes practical research applications in emerging domains and emphasizes low-cost, fast publication to support the growing research ecosystem in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"color:#e63946;\">🚀</span> Why Choose INDJCST Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n  <li>Rapid peer review: decisions in 3 days for fast publication.</li>\r\n  <li>Open access policy with global visibility and Google Scholar indexing.</li>\r\n  <li>Efficient processing from submission to acceptance.</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism checks for integrity.</li>\r\n  <li>COPE-compliant ethical publication standards.</li>\r\n  <li>Impacting research beyond academia across autonomous systems and related fields.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff6700; margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"color:#0088cc;\">💡</span> INDJCST Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed refereed journal with a good impact factor.</li>\r\n  <li>Transparent, low-cost publication suitable for autonomous systems research.</li>\r\n  <li>Strict anti-plagiarism policy and quick editorial processing.</li>\r\n  <li>High visibility through indexing in Google Scholar and other directories.</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed editorial board ensuring high-quality screening.</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid/Fast Track Publication available on request.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3f51b5; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"color:#ffa500;\">📊</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00796b; margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"color:#ef476f;\">📄</span> Our Streamlined Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n  INDJCST ensures a transparent author-friendly publication journey for fast publication in computer science and autonomous systems journals:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n  <li>Submit Online: 24/7 access via the editorial management system.</li>\r\n  <li>Initial Response: Acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li>Expert Review: Peer review completed in 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li>Decision Notification: Acceptance/rejection within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li>Publication & Certificate: Instant digital access and certification.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e76f51; margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"color:#00b4d8;\">💰</span> Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n  As an open-access platform, INDJCST provides cost-effective publication opportunities ideal for low-cost autonomous systems and computer science journals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n  <li>For Indian Authors: Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST | With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li>For International Authors: With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"color:#ff9800;\">🧠</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard with submission tracking and updates.</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time progress monitoring at each stage.</li>\r\n  <li>Instant generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms.</li>\r\n  <li>Easy downloads for certificates and publication PDFs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#004d40; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"color:#ffcc00;\">📨</span> Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n  Join the community of researchers contributing to autonomous systems journals in India and globally. Experience low-cost, rapid publication with INDJCST.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  Submit today at\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n    https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(182,'2025-11-18 10:06:13','2025-11-18 10:06:13','tags/UYTlaG3Wyk1eUjGEhZamhoTy1BIcbXx2VBWOTBSN.jpg','Human Computer Interaction Journals| INDJCST','Tag','human-computer-interaction-journals-indjcst','Human Computer Interaction Journals| INDJCST','INDJCST is a peer-reviewed, UGC CARE indexed journal specializing in human computer interaction and computer science.','Human Computer Interaction Journals| INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#364fc7; text-align:center; margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n  The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:26px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:1.5em; color:#e63946;\">🖥️</span>\r\n  Human Computer Interaction Journals &amp; Computer Science Domains\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n  INDJCST (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers in Computer Science and Technology, including human computer interaction journals, with a low cost, fast publication workflow for today\'s researchers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n  Published thrice yearly, INDJCST provides a reliable, UGC CARE-indexed platform for academicians, educators, engineers, and industry professionals to contribute innovations spanning artificial intelligence, machine learning, and human-computer interaction journals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n  INDJCST adheres strictly to UGC-CARE guidelines and COPE standards, ensuring rapid publication and integrity in all accepted articles, including interdisciplinary research on autonomous systems, networking, HCI, and emerging computing fields.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#228be6; display:flex; align-items:cent