li>Peer-reviewed, refereed open-access journal.</li>\r\n  <li>Fast and transparent paper publication.</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism policy and ethics (COPE Best Practices).</li>\r\n  <li>Simple submission steps, easy author dashboard.</li>\r\n  <li>High visibility indexing: UGC CARE, Google Scholar, Semantic Scholar, Elsevier Mendeley, DRJI, WorldCAT, Dimensions, and more.</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons By NC ND license for published work.</li>\r\n  <li>Recognized editorial board and good impact factor.</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid / Fast Track Publication available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ee6c4d; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:13px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:1.3em; color:#4cc9f0;\">📁</span>\r\n  Indexing &amp; Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3b82f6; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:13px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:1.3em; color:#e09f3e;\">📝</span>\r\n  Streamlined Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  Experience a transparent, author-friendly journey from submission to publication for your human computer interaction journal article:\r\n</p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n  <li>Submit online: 24/7 editorial portal access.</li>\r\n  <li>Initial acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li>Peer review completion in 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li>Decision notification within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF access and digital certificate upon acceptance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#b5179e; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:13px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"fon