ity and publication quality. </p> <h2 style=\"color:#457b9d; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:18px;\"> <span style=\"font-size:1.3em; color:#f94144;\">⚡</span> Why Choose INDJCST Journal? </h2> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\"> <li>Rapid peer review delivering decisions within 3 days for fast publication.</li> <li>Open access policy ensuring immediate reach to policymakers, industry leaders, and researchers.</li> <li>Efficient submission-to-publication workflow to save researchers time.</li> <li>Strict plagiarism checks to maintain originality and integrity.</li> <li>Compliance with COPE\'s highest ethical standards in publishing.</li> <li>High impact research that shapes policy and technology globally.</li> </ul> <h2 style=\"color:#f3722c; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:18px;\"> <span style=\"font-size:1.3em; color:#277da1;\">📚</span> INDJCST Features </h2> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\"> <li>Peer-reviewed refereed journal with strong editorial standards.</li> <li>Simple, transparent, and rapid paper publication process.</li> <li>Strict anti-plagiarism policy.</li> <li>Easy steps for publishing research and review articles.</li> <li>High visibility and indexing including Google Scholar & UGC CARE.</li> <li>Adherence to COPE’s Best Practice Guidelines.</li> <li>Publisher license under Creative Commons By NC ND.</li> <li>Rapid/fast track publication option available.</li> </ul> <h2 style=\"color:#ffb703; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:18px;\"> <span style=\"font-size:1.3em; color:#023047;\">🗂️</span> Indexing & Abstracting </h2> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\"> <li>Google Scholar</li> <li>Scribd</li> <li>ISSUU</li> <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li> <li>EuroPub</li> <li>DRJI</li> <li>Academic Keys</li> <li>Edocr</li> <li>I2OR</li> <li>PDFSR</li> <li>ResearchBIB</li> <li>SSRN</li> <li>WorldCAT</li> <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li> <li>Thomson Reuters - Research ID</li> <li>Semantic Scholar</li> <li>Dimensions</li> <li>PLumX</li> </ul> <h2 style=\"color:#219ebc; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:18px;\"> <span style=\"font-size:1.3em; color:#8ecae6;\">📆</span> Our Streamlined Publication Process </h2> <p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"> Experience a transparent and author-friendly publication journey with INDJCST: </p> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\"> <li>Submit Online: Available 24/7 through our editorial system.</li> <li>Initial Response: Acknowledgement within 12 hours.</li> <li>Expert Review: Completed within 2 days.</li> <li>Decision Notification: Acceptance or rejection within 3 days.</li> <li>Publication & Certificate: Instant access to PDFs and digital certificates.</li> </ul> <h2 style=\"color:#fb8500; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:18px;\"> <span style=\"font-size:1.3em; color:#023047;\">💵</span> Article Processing Charges </h2> <p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"> As an open-access journal, INDJCST offers minimal fees to authors post-acceptance for continuous digital availability: </p> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\"> <li>Indian Authors: Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST | With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li> <li>Other than Indian Authors: With DOI: $80 USD</li> </ul> <h2 style=\"color:#023047; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:18px;\"> <span style=\"font-size:1.3em; color:#fb8500;\">📊</span> Advanced Editorial Management System </h2> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\"> <li>Author Dashboard: Personalized submission history and status updates.</li> <li>Real-time Tracking: Monitor paper progress every stage.</li> <li>Automated Documents: Instant generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms.</li> <li>Easy Downloads: Access certificates and papers conveniently.</li> </ul> <h2 style=\"color:#ef476f; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:24px;\"> <span style=\"font-size:1.3em; color:#ffd166;\">🚀</span> Ready to Publish Your Research? </h2> <p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"> Submit your manuscript today to be part of one of the best cyber security journals in India with low cost and rapid publication. </p> <p> <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1d3557; font-weight:600;\"> https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6 </a> </p>'),(184,'2025-11-18 10:11:47','2025-11-18 10:11:47','tags/zeoA7fbHxjvJi4SkTzYDNrxuBV5MaAywPMDor7ze.jpg','Information Security Journals | INDJCST','Tag','information-security-journals-indjcst','Information Security Journals | INDJCST','\"Publish in information security journals with INDJCST. Low-cost, fast and rapid publication, UGC CARE aligned, Google Scholar indexed.','Information Security Journals | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0A4D9C; font-weight:700;\">\r\n  Information Security Journals – INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST serves as a trusted platform for academicians, educators, engineers, industry professionals, and researchers worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nINDJCST abides by UGC-CARE guidelines and conducts a rigorous peer-review process to ensure every submission meets the highest standards of scholarly excellence. As a refereed journal, INDJCST promotes academic credibility and integrity, offering a reliable venue for researchers to publish their innovative work.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e63946; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n  <span>🔒</span> Core Research Areas\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nINDJCST encourages interdisciplinary research, especially studies that demonstrate real-world applications of modern computing technologies.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1b7f4b; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n  <span>⚡</span> Why Publish with INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decisions within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Global reach & visibility.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Workflow:</strong> Smooth publication experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Strict quality screening.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliant:</strong> Follows ethical publishing best practices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Real-World Impact:</strong> Supports research shaping policy & innovation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6A1B9A; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n  <span>✅</span> Key Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed & refereed</li>\r\n  <li>Low-cost & <strong>fast publication</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Transparent review workflow</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism policy</li>\r\n  <li>High visibility & indexing</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons By NC ND license</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed editorial board</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid/fast-track publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff8f00; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\r\n  <span>📚</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li