ant PDF & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ APC -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">\r\n  <span>💰</span> Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  Minimal fee applies after acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Without DOI — 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li>With DOI — 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>Other Countries:</strong>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>With DOI — $80 USD</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ SYSTEM -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6d4c41;\">\r\n  <span>🖥️</span> Advanced Editorial Management\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized author dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time submission tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated acceptance letters & copyright</li>\r\n  <li>Download certificates & published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ CTA -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949ab;\">\r\n  <span>📨</span> Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  Submit your manuscript today and publish in leading \r\n  <strong>edge computing journals</strong> with fast review and low processing cost.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\"\r\n     target=\"_blank\"\r\n     style=\"color:#1e88e5; font-weight:600; text-decoration:underline;\">\r\n    👉 Submit Your Paper\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(191,'2025-11-19 05:54:24','2025-11-19 05:54:24','tags/whevRKNDoJrB8c8UOCAo1YDZRa9EWG7z1NxnAU5O.jpg','Internet of Things Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Publication | INDJCST','Tag','internet-of-things-journals-fast-low-cost-publication-indjcst','Internet of Things Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Publication | INDJCST','Publish in top Internet of Things (IoT) journals with INDJCST. Fast publication, low cost, rapid peer review, UGC CARE alignment, Google Scholar indexing.','Internet of Things Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Publication | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  🌐 Internet of Things (IoT) Journals – Publish with INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing\r\n  high-quality research papers across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST serves as a reliable platform for\r\n  academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share their findings and contribute to the advancement of the field.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  As one of the preferred <strong>Internet of Things (IoT) journals</strong>, INDJCST adheres to <strong>UGC-CARE</strong> guidelines and follows a rigorous peer-review process.\r\n  Every submission is evaluated thoroughly to ensure the highest standards of scholarly excellence. As a refereed journal, we prioritize credibility, academic\r\n  integrity, and quality publishing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; font-weight:600; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  🤖 Research Areas We Publish\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Internet of Things (IoT)</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  INDJCST welcomes interdisciplinary contributions that demonstrate practical applications of computing technologies. All manuscripts undergo a thorough peer-review\r\n  process ensuring high academic integrity before publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; font-weight:600; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  ⚡ Why Choose INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> – Decision within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access</strong> – Global visibility and accessibility</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication</strong> – Streamlined workflow from submission to publication</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism-Free</strong> – Rigorous screening ensures academic honesty</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE-Compliant</strong> – Ethical publishing standards</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Global Impact</strong> – Influences policy & technological innovation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; font-weight:600; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  🏆 INDJCST Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-Reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Easy, transparent publication</li>\r\n  <li>Strict Plagiarism Policy</li>\r\n  <li>Simple submission and review process</li>\r\n  <li>High Visibility & Multiple Indexing</li>\r\n  <li>COPE Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons License – BY NC ND</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid / Fast-Track Publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; font-weight:600; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  📑 Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"columns:2; margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03a9f4; font-weight:600; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  🚀 Publication Workflow\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li>24/7 Online Submission</li>\r\n  <li>Acknowledgment in 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Peer-Review: 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Decision: 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Publication & Certificate: Instant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; font-weight:600; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  💰 Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  Open-access ensures free online availability. Minimal charges apply after manuscript acceptance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors</strong> — Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors</strong> — With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Other Countries</strong> — With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#795548; font-weight:600; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  🔎 Advanced Editorial Management\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard & Progress Tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Realtime Status Updates</li>\r\n  <li>Automated Acceptance Letters & Copyright Forms</li>\r\n  <li>Easy Access to Certificates & Published Papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00796b; font-weight:600; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n  ✅ Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  Submit your article now for rapid processing and fast publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  👉 <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;\">\r\n    Submit Online\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(192,'2025-11-19 05:55:30','2025-11-19 05:55:52','tags/sNCyZ4doYSUohbOMUx8hkEpgyFsHAQD3IVZexZKW.jpg','Smart City Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Computer Science Publishing – INDJCST','Tag','smart-city-journals-fast-low-cost-computer-science-publishing-indjcst','Smart City Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Computer Science Publishing – INDJCST','Publish in Smart City journals with INDJCST—UGC CARE-aligned, low-cost, rapid publication, peer-reviewed open-access computer science journal.','Smart City Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Computer Science Publishing – INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0B63F6; font-weight:700;\">\r\n  Smart City Journals – INDJCST\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST serves as a reliable platform for academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share their findings and contribute to the advancement of the field.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  INDJCST adheres to UGC-CARE guidelines and follows a rigorous peer-review process, ensuring that every submission meets the highest standards of scholarly excellence. As a refereed journal, we are committed to maintaining credibility and integrity in academic publishing, offering researchers a trusted space to showcase their work in cutting-edge areas like \r\n  <strong>smart city journals</strong>, sustainable city development, IoT systems, and AI-driven infrastructure.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#D91E36; font-weight:600;\">\r\n  📌 Research Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#41B06E; font-weight:600;\">\r\n  🚀 Why Choose INDJCST Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  We welcome innovative contributions focusing on smart city solutions, dynamic infrastructure systems, and real-world implementation of computing technologies. All papers undergo a structured peer-review process, ensuring academic excellence before publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">\r\n  <li>Rapid Peer Review – Decisions within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Low Cost & Fast Publication (Rapid Publication)</li>\r\n  <li>Open Access – Wide visibility & global reach</li>\r\n  <li>Plagiarism Protection – Ensuring originality</li>\r\n  <li>COPE-Compliant Ethical Publishing</li>\r\n  <li>Impact Beyond Academia – Policy & social relevance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF9F1C; font-weight:600;\">\r\n  🌟 INDJCST Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed, Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Simple submission workflow</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism policy</li>\r\n  <li>High visibility & indexing (Google Scholar, etc.)</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons License – CC BY NC ND</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed editorial board</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid/Fast track publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9B59B6; font-weight:600;\">\r\n  📚 Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E84545; font-weight:600;\">\r\n  ✅ Streamlined Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">\r\n  <li>Submit Online — 24/7 availability</li>\r\n  <li>Initial Response — Within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Expert Review — Complete within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Decision Notification — Within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Publication & Certificate — Instant access</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00A8E8; font-weight:600;\">\r\n  💰 Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  Open-access model ensures free online availability. Minimal author fee applies after manuscript acceptance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">\r\n  <li>Indian Authors:\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li>International Authors:\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2D8BBA; font-weight:600;\">\r\n  ⚙️ Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time Paper Tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated Document Generation</li>\r\n  <li>Easy access to published certificates & papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E67E22; font-weight:600;\">\r\n  ✅ Ready to Publish Your Smart City Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  Submit your manuscript today and take advantage of our fast publication and global research visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#0B63F6; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    Submit Now →\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(193,'2025-11-19 05:57:27','2025-11-19 05:57:27','tags/kZ9V76rGWD0KcfQvGmaBBeqPJwblJHPffa8OdJEL.jpg','Sensor Networks Journals | Fast, Low-Cost Publication – INDJCST','Tag','sensor-networks-journals-fast-low-cost-publication-indjcst','Sensor Networks Journals | Fast, Low-Cost Publication – INDJCST','Publish sensor networks research with INDJCST. Low-cost, fast publication, UGC CARE–aligned, peer-reviewed open-access.','Sensor Networks Journals | Fast, Low-Cost Publication – INDJCST','<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Sensor Networks Journals – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a leading open-access platform for publishing high-quality research across Computer Science and Technology. It is recognized for rapid publication, low-cost accessibility, and strong academic standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nAs a <strong>peer-reviewed, UGC-CARE–aligned</strong> journal, INDJCST provides a trusted forum for researchers, academicians, engineers, and industry professionals—especially in domains like <strong>sensor networks, IoT, cybersecurity, AI, and big data</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#005FAF; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n<span>📘</span> About the Journal\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nPublished three times a year, INDJCST maintains rigorous review standards to deliver valuable contributions to the global research community. Manuscripts undergo a strict peer-review process to ensure originality and quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style