archBIB</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (part of Clarivate)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n<span>📄</span> Our Streamlined Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Submit online (24/7)</li>\r\n  <li>Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Expert peer-review within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Acceptance / Rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF publication & certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3E2723; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n<span>💰</span> Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Indian Authors – Without DOI: <strong>₹1200 + 18% GST</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Indian Authors – With DOI: <strong>₹1400 + 18% GST</strong></li>\r\n  <li>International Authors – With DOI: <strong>USD $60</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n<span>⚙️</span> Advanced Editorial Management\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Dedicated author dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time tracking throughout the workflow</li>\r\n  <li>Automated acceptance letters & copyright</li>\r\n  <li>Instant download of certificates & published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#D84315; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n<span>🚀</span> Submit Your Research\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nReady to publish your research in leading <strong>embedded systems journals</strong>? Submit your manuscript today!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#0066CC; font-weight:bold;\">\r\n    https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(195