he field.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mb-4\">\r\n  INDJCST adheres to <strong>UGC-CARE</strong> guidelines and follows a rigorous peer-review process, \r\n  ensuring that every submission meets the highest standards of scholarly excellence. As a \r\n  refereed journal, we are committed to maintaining credibility and integrity in academic \r\n  publishing, offering researchers a trusted space to showcase their work.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-blue-600 flex gap-2 items-center\">\r\n  <span>📌</span> Journal Scope\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mb-4\">\r\n  The journal covers a broad range of topics related to computer science and emerging \r\n  technologies, including but not limited to:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"mb-6 list-disc ml-6 space-y-1\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-purple-600 flex gap-2 items-center\">\r\n  <span>🚀</span> Why Choose INDJCST Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"mb-6 list-disc ml-6 space-y-2\">\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decisions within 3 days without compromising quality.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Ensures global reach and visibility.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Workflow:</strong> Fast communication at every stage.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> High-level screening for academic integrity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Ethical publishing practices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impactful Reach:</strong> Research that influences policies and transforms lives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-green-600 flex gap-2 items-center\">\r\n  <span>✅</span> INDJCST Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"mb-6 list-disc ml-6 space-y-2\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Easy, fast, transparent publication process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism policy</li>\r\n  <li>Simple article submission process</li>\r\n  <li>High visibility & indexing</li>\r\n  <li>COPE Publication Ethics</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons License (CC-BY-NC-ND)</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid / Fast-track publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-red-600 flex gap-2 items-center\">\r\n  <span>📚</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"mb-6 list-disc ml-6 space-y-1\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-orange-600 flex gap-2 items-center\">\r\n  <span>⚙️</span> Publication Workflow\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mb-4\">\r\n  Experience a transparent, author-friendly journey from submission to publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"mb-6 list-decimal ml-6 space-y-1\">\r\n  <li>Submit Online</li>\r\n  <li>Receive ac