r review within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Acceptance/Rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF & certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Coloured Subtitle -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a4c93;\">\r\n<span style=\"margin-right:6px;\">💰</span>Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAs an open-access publisher, we charge minimal fees to sustain journal operations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Coloured Subtitle -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#457b9d;\">\r\n<span style=\"margin-right:6px;\">🗂️</span>Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated document generation</li>\r\n  <li>One-click certificate downloads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ CTA -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d62828;\">\r\n<span style=\"margin-right:6px;\">📝</span>Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSubmit Today:  \r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">\r\nhttps://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\r\n</a>\r\n</p>'),(202,'2025-11-19 07:22:02','2025-11-19 07:22:02','tags/kBJOMXfazJyw4gSqnkAnMoCKSMD2mP7Ae9HjG5sV.jpg','Database Management Journals| INDJCST','Tag','database-management-journals-indjcst','Database Management Journals| INDJCST','NDJCST is a peer-reviewed open-access database management journal offering low-cost, fast publication, rapid review.','Database Management Journals| INDJCST','<h1>Database Management Journals – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is an esteemed open-access journal committed to publishing high-quality research in Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, it serves as a trusted platform for academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share insights and drive advancements in the field.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nINDJCST strictly follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards and maintains a rigorous peer-review process ensuring scholarly excellence. As a refereed journal, we are dedicated to credibility, integrity, and offering a reliable venue for researchers to publish impactful work at low cost with <strong>fast publication</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Coloured Sub Title -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e63946;\">\r\n<span style=\"margin-right:6px;\">📘</span>Scope of the Journal\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe welcome submissions across core areas of Computer Science and emerging technologies including:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe encourage interdisciplinary work demonstrating real-world applications of modern computing across domains. All submissions go through a robust peer-review process to ensure ethical and academic quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Coloured Sub Title -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1d3557;\">\r\n<span style=\"margin-right:6px;\">🚀</span>Why Choose INDJCST Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong