\n<span style=\"margin-right:6px;\">🚀</span>Why Choose INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decisions within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open-Access:</strong> Global readership & visibility</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication:</strong> Streamlined editorial workflow</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low-Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable APC</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Strict screening</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE-Compliant:</strong> Ethical publishing standards</li>\r\n  <li><strong>High-Visibility Indexing</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe focus on research that influences global innovation, informs policy, and benefits society.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Coloured Sub Title -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2a9d8f;\">\r\n<span style=\"margin-right:6px;\">📘</span>INDJCST Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed, refereed journal</li>\r\n  <li>Easy and transparent publication process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict plagiarism policy</li>\r\n  <li>Simple steps for submitting research & review articles</li>\r\n  <li>COPE’s publication ethics</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons (CC-BY-NC-ND)</li>\r\n  <li>Good impact factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed editorial board</li>\r\n  <li>Fast-track publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Coloured Sub Title -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#457b9d;\">\r\n<span style=\"margin-right:6px;\">📈</span>Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ✅ Coloured Sub Title -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f4a261;\">\r\n<span style=\"margin-right:6px;\