tion Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Publication – INDJCST','<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Wireless Communication Journals – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access platform dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST serves as a reliable venue for academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share their findings and contribute to the advancement of the field.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nINDJCST follows UGC-CARE guidelines and a rigorous peer-review process, ensuring that every submitted paper meets excellent scholarly standards. As a refereed journal, INDJCST maintains integrity and credibility in academic publishing, providing a trusted platform for showcasing impactful research with low cost and fast publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>📌</span> Scope & Topics\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nWe welcome contributions from all emerging computer science fields, including but not limited to:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:16px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nINDJCST encourages interdisciplinary research and supports rapid publication while maintaining academic integrity through stringent peer review.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d93025; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>🚀</span> Why Choose INDJCST?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:16px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>🔎 Rapid Peer Review – Decision within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>🌐 Open Access – Global visibility for your work</li>\r\n  <li>⚡ Efficient & Fast Publication</li>\r\n  <li>🛡️ Plagiarism Protection – Strict quality control</li>\r\n  <li>📜 COPE-Compliant Ethical Standards</li>\r\n  <li>🌏 Promotes real-world, impactful research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e8e3e; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>✅</span> INDJCST Features\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:16px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Fast & Transparent Publication Process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict Plagiarism Policy</li>\r\n  <li>Simple Submission & Review Workflow</li>\r\n  <li>High Visibility & Indexing</li>\r\n  <li>COPE Publication Ethics</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons License BY NC ND</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid / Fast-Track Publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e67e22; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>📚</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:16px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Research ID (Thomson Reuters)</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PlumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6f42c1; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>📄</span> Streamlined Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Experience a transparent and author-friendly publication journey:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:16px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Submit Online – 24/7 submission</li>\r\n  <li>Acknowledgement within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Expert Review within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Acceptance/Rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Immediate Publication with Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>💰</span> Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nOnline open-access publication ensures global availability. A minimal fee applies after acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:16px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Indian Authors: 1200 INR + GST (without DOI) / 1400 INR + GST (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li>Foreign Authors: $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0097a7; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>⚙️</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:16px; padding-left:20px;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time Submission Tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Automated Acceptance Letters & Copyright Forms</li>\r\n  <li>Easy Download of Certificates & Published Papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#c2185b; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n<span>📨</span> Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript now and experience low-cost, fast-track publication aligned with UGC-CARE and Google Scholar visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-weight:600; text-decoration:underline;\">\r\nSubmit Online\r\n</a>'),(205,'2025-11-19 07:27:58','2025-11-19 07:27:58','tags/OzaP0LVXGbjaDSRfzEp7TX8D4qZjjUYs24tXmVqs.jpg','Mobile Computing Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Publication | INDJCST','Tag','mobile-computing-journals-fast-low-cost-publication-indjcst','Mobile Computing Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Publication | INDJCST','Publish in top mobile computing journals with INDJCST. Fast & low-cost publication, UGC CARE-aligned, Google Scholar indexing, rapid peer review.','Mobile Computing Journals | Fast & Low-Cost Publication | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Mobile Computing Journals – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST serves as a reliable platform for academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share their findings and contribute to the advancement of the field.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  INDJCST adheres to <strong>UGC-CARE</strong> guidelines and follows a rigorous peer-review process, ensuring that every submission meets the highest standards of scholarly excellence. As a refereed journal, we are committed to maintaining credibility and integrity in academic publishing, offering researchers a trusted space to showcase their work.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:24px; font-weight:700; color:#0066cc;\">\r\n  📌 Topics Covered\r\n</p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies and <strong>Mobile Computing</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  INDJCST welcomes interdisciplinary research and encourages submissions that demonstrate practical applications of computing technologies in various domains. All papers undergo a peer-review process, ensuring academic integrity and quality before publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:28px; color:#e91e63;\">⭐ Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> – Decisions within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access Policy</strong> – Global research visibility.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Process</strong> – Streamlined workflow for fast publication.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection</strong> – Strict quality assurance.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance</strong> – Ethical publication practices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impact Beyond Academia</strong> – Research with global value.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:28px; color:#4caf50;\">✅ INDJCST Features</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:18px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Easy, fast, transparent publication process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict Plagiarism policy</li>\r\n  <li>Simple publication steps</li>\r\n  <li>High Visibility & Indexing</li>\r\n  <li>COPE Publication Ethics</l