rs & forms</li>\r\n  <li>One-click certificate & publication download</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:28px; color:#f44336;\">✅ Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  Submit today and experience fast publication with transparency.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1976d2; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    Submit Your Paper →\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>'),(206,'2025-11-19 07:29:15','2025-11-19 07:29:15','tags/2Z59FaHu0vEpvIpsCE3paFqbVJXvGqOG0mjAQuOd.jpg','5G Technology Journals | Low-Cost & Fast Publication | INDJCST','Tag','5g-technology-journals-low-cost-fast-publication-indjcst','5G Technology Journals | Low-Cost & Fast Publication | INDJCST','Publish in 5G technology journals with INDJCST. Fast & low-cost publication, UGC CARE-aligned workflow.','5G Technology Journals | Low-Cost & Fast Publication | INDJCST','<h1>5G Technology Journals – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is an open-access journal dedicated to publishing quality research across Computer Science and emerging technology domains. Published three times a year, it offers a trusted platform for\r\nacademicians, researchers, engineers, and industry experts.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e63946;\">⚡ About INDJCST</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nINDJCST adheres to UGC CARE guidelines and follows a rigorous peer-review process, ensuring every submitted manuscript meets scholarly excellence. As a refereed journal, we maintain strong academic integrity and credibility in publishing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0096c7;\">📌 Popular Research Areas</h2>\r\n<p>Topics covered include (but are not limited to):</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Database & Information Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0;\">🚀 Why Choose INDJCST?</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nWe ensure <strong>rapid publication</strong> and <strong>low-cost accessibility</strong> to benefit global researchers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decision within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Global visibility for your research</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Process:</strong> Smooth workflow from submission to publication</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Strict quality screening</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Highest ethical standards</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impact Beyond Academia:</strong> Real-world research applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800;\">🌟 Journal Features</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Refereed and Peer-reviewed</li>\r\n  <li>Fast Publication Process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict Plagiarism Policy</li>\r\n  <li>Transparent Workflow</li>\r\n  <li>High Visibility & Indexing</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons License (CC BY-NC-ND)</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00b894;\">📚 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00796b;\">✅ Publication Process</h2>\r\n<p>Experience a seamless publishing workflow:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n  <li>Submit Online (24/7)</li>\r\n  <li>Acknowledgment Within 12 Hours</li>\r\n  <li>Peer Review in 2 Days</li>\r\n  <li>Acceptance/Rejection in 3 Days</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3f51b5;\">💰 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n<p>Open-access publication with minimal APC for sustainability:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong><br/>Without DOI – ₹1200 + 18% GST<br/>With DOI – ₹1400 + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Foreign Authors:</strong> $80 USD (With DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">🖥️ Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time Tracking</li>\r\n  <li>Instant Documentation</li>\r\n  <li>Easy Downloads – Certificates, Papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#c62828;\">✅ Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nSubmit your paper now for <strong>fast publication</strong> in <strong>5G technology journals</strong> with INDJCST.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n👉 Click Here to Submit\r\n</a>\r\n</p>'),(207,'2025-11-19 07:31:45','2025-11-19 07:31:45','tags/CGRCMezubghygEwjQ1oQzJ6bhEOSlAlaCO1EypfM.jpg','Big Data Analytics Journals | Low-Cost & Fast Publication | INDJCST','Tag','big-data-analytics-journals-low-cost-fast-publication-indjcst','Big Data Analytics Journals | Low-Cost & Fast Publication | INDJCST','Publish in big data analytics journals with INDJCST. Fast & low-cost publication, rapid peer review, UGC CARE–aligned, Google Scholar indexing.','Big Data Analytics Journals | Low-Cost & Fast Publication | INDJCST','<h1>Big Data Analytics Journals – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is an open-access, peer-reviewed journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research in Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST provides an excellent platform for academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share knowledge and contribute to global innovation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e63946;\">📌 About INDJCST</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nINDJCST strictly follows UGC-CARE guidelines and a rigorous peer-review process to maintain high scholarly standards. As a refereed journal, it ensures credibility and integrity in every publication, making it a trusted destination for research authors worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0096c7;\">📚 Areas of Research</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nWe publish original contributions in multiple domains, including:\r\n</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0;\">🚀 Why Publish With INDJCST?</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nWe support <strong>low-cost</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> to help researchers worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Clear decision within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open-Access Policy:</strong> Increased reach & academic visibility</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Workflow:</strong> Faster communication & processing</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Strict quality validation</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> High publishing ethics</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impactful Research:</strong> Supports policy & industry development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800;\">🌟 Journal Features</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Peer-Reviewed & Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Fast & Transparent Publication</li>\r\n  <li>Strict Plagiarism Policy</li>\r\n  <li>Supports Research & Review Articles</li>\r\n  <li>High Visibility & Indexing</li>\r\n  <li>COPE-Based Publication Ethics</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons BY-NC-ND License</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n  <li>Fast-Track Publication Accepted</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00b894;\">📑 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00796b;\">✅ Publication Workflow</h2>\r\n<p>Our streamlined process includes:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n  <li>Online Submission (24/7)</li>\r\n  <li>Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Expert Peer Review in 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Acceptance/Rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Instant PDF Access & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3f51b5;\">💰 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nAs an open-access journal, INDJCST offers affordable APC to support maintenance & online publication.\r\n</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong><br/>W