ers - Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PlumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#20B2AA;\">📝 Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Submit Online: 24/7 submission through our editorial management system</li>\r\n  <li>Initial Response: Receive acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li>Expert Review: Complete peer review within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li>Decision Notification: Acceptance/rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li>Publication & Certificate: Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF6347;\">💰 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n<p>Open-access publication, freely available online. Minimal fee from authors after manuscript acceptance:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong> Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST | With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>For Other than Indian Authors:</strong> With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4682B4;\">🛠 Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard: Personalized account with submission history and status updates</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time Tracking: Monitor your paper\'s progress through every stage</li>\r\n  <li>Automated Documents: Instant generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms</li>\r\n  <li>Easy Downloads: One-click access to certificates and published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#DAA520;\">📤 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n<p>Submit today: <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6</a></p>'),(221,'2025-11-19 08:30:39','2025-11-19 08:30:39','tags/VlFM4ExpiO7GFGahLuf4bmPmDYm5PTt5TljVVNhP.jpg','Autonomous Vehicle Journals | INDJCST','Tag','autonomous-vehicle-journals-indjcst','Autonomous Vehicle Journals | INDJCST','Publish your research in Autonomous Vehicle Journals with INDJCST. Fast, low-cost, peer-reviewed, UGC CARE c