r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF8C00;\">🚀 Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Our strict peer review process delivers decisions within 3 days without compromising quality standards.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Immediate open access ensures your work reaches policymakers, industry leaders, and global researchers.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Process:</strong> From submission to publication, our streamlined workflow saves you time with quick responses at every stage.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Rigorous screening maintains academic integrity while our automated systems handle administrative tasks.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> We adhere to the highest publication ethics following COPE\'s Best Practice Guidelines.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impact Beyond Academia:</strong> We prioritize research that influences thinking, shapes policies, and improves lives globally.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8A2BE2;\">📑 INDJCST Features</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Easy, fast, transparent paper publication process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict Plagiarism Policy</li>\r\n  <li>High Visibility & Indexing</li>\r\n  <li>Publication Ethics: COPE’s Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n  <li>Publisher License under Creative Commons By NC ND</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n  <li>Rapid/Fast Track Publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF1493;\">🔍 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (part of Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters - Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PlumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#20B2AA;\">📝 Our Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission through our editorial management system</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Initial Response:</strong> Receive acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Expert Review:</strong> Complete peer review within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Decision Notification:</strong> Acceptance/rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Publication & Certificate:</strong> Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#DC143C;\">💰 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n<p>Open-access publication, so it is freely available online. The cost of publishing online editions and ensuring the continuous appearance of the journal requires a minimal fee from authors after manuscript acceptance, as follows:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>For Other than Indian Authors:</strong> With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FF4500;\">🛠️ Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard: Personalized account with submission history and status updates</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time Tracking: Monitor your paper\'s progress through every stage</li>\r\n  <li>Automated Documents: Instant generation of acceptance letters and copyright forms</li>\r\n  <li>Easy Downloads: One-click access to certificates and published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E90FF;\">📤 Ready to Publish your Research?</h2>\r\n<p>Submit today: <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6</a></p>'),(222,'2025-11-19 08:32:01','2025-11-19 08:32:01','tags/wYEX53SRLC62m2kDabVWTZTGoFcxsbKN0qffblel.jpg','Smart Com