te)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters - Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ffa533;\">⚡ Our Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission via our editorial management system</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Initial Response:</strong> Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Expert Review:</strong> Complete peer review within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Decision Notification:</strong> Acceptance/rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Publication & Certificate:</strong> Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e33ff;\">💰 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n<p>Open-access publication, freely available online. Minimal fee applies after manuscript acceptance:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>Other than Indian Authors:</strong> With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#33ffcc;\">🛠 Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Author Dashboard with submission history and status updates</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time Tracking of paper progress</li>\r\n  <li>Automated Documents: Acceptance letters and copyright forms</li>\r\n  <li>Easy Downloads: One-click access to certificates and published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff3333;\">🚀 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n<p>Submit today: <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6</a></p>'),(224,'2026-02-24 07:53:35','2026-02-25 10:10:20','tags/lZJ28Sofq2wFXQAoRqfnMxA6Vl20UL9IMpLOm5TG.jpg','Artificial Intelligence Scholarly Articles – INDJCST','Tag','artificial-intelligence-scholarly-articles-indjcst','Artificial Intelligence Scholarly Articles – INDJCST','Artificial intelligence scholarly articles with fast publication, low cost APC, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing.','Artificial Intelligence Scholarly Articles – INDJCST','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Artificial Intelligence Scholarly Articles – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing <strong>artificial intelligence scholarly articles</strong> is essential for advancing intelligent systems, automation, and data-driven technologies. The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputed open-access journal dedicated to high-quality research across core and emerging domains of <strong>computer science</strong>, including Artificial Intelligence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST strictly follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and maintains a rigorous peer-review process to ensure academic excellence. Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, the journal enhances global discoverability and citation tracking. With a streamlined editorial workflow, we provide <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> at a <strong>low cost</strong>, making it a trusted platform for artificial intelligence scholarly articles.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">🤖 <span style=\"color:#e53935;\">Core AI Research Areas</span> <span style=\"color:#43a047;\">in Computer Science</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>🧠 Machine Learning & Deep Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Mining & Predictive Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition</li>\r\n<li>🗣️ Natural Language Processing (NLP)</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics & Intelligent Systems</li>\r\n<li>📈 Reinforcement Learning & Optimization</li>\r\n<li>🔐 AI in Cybersecurity</li>\r\n<li>☁️ AI Applications in Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🌐 AI for IoT & Smart Environments</li>\r\n<li>📊 Explainable AI & Ethical AI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nWe welcome innovative, interdisciplinary, and application-oriented AI research that contributes to scientific and technological progress in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚡ Why Publish Your AI Scholarly Articles with INDJCST?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Peer-reviewed refereed journal</li>\r\n<li>📜 UGC CARE aligned publishing standards</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and major indexing services</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Transparent <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> workflow</li>\r\n<li>💰 Affordable <strong>low cost</strong> Article Processing Charges (APC)</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Strict plagiarism screening policy</li>\r\n<li>🔗 DOI provided for every accepted article</li>\r\n<li>📈 Strong academic visibility and measurable citation impact</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nOur advanced editorial management system ensures high research standards while maintaining efficient turnaround times.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💳 Low Cost Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nOpen-access publication requires minimal APC only after manuscript acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6d4c41; margin-bottom:15px;\">📢 Ready to Publish Your AI Scholarly Article?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nSubmit your <strong>artificial intelligence scholarly articles</strong> to a trusted journal offering <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, affordable <strong>low cost</strong> APC, and guaranteed <strong>fast publication</strong> with <strong>rapid publication</strong> timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1e88e5; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(225,'2026-02-24 07:54:41','2026-02-24 07:54:41','tags/YPD4ljElcd5Xo4MioPcrRxKfMwWnvC5OAGBIXrbN.jpg','Peer Reviewed Science Journals with DOI – INDJCST','Tag','peer-reviewed-science-journals-with-doi-indjcst','Peer Reviewed Science Journals with DOI – INDJCST','Peer reviewed science journals with DOI. Low cost, fast publication, UGC CARE, Google Scholar indexed computer science journal.','Peer Reviewed Science Journals with DOI – INDJCST','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Peer Reviewed Science Journals with DOI – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is one of the trusted <strong>peer reviewed science journals with DOI</strong> dedicated to publishing high-quality research in Computer Science and emerging technologies. Published three times a year, INDJCST provides a <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>rapid publication</strong> platform for academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAs a <strong>UGC CARE</strong> aligned journal indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, INDJCST ensures academic excellence through a strict peer-review process. Every article receives a DOI, enhancing global discoverability and citation tracking. Researchers seeking reliable <strong>peer reviewed science journals with DOI</strong> in <strong>computer science</strong> will find INDJCST a credible and transparent publication venue.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span> <span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">Scope of Computer Science Research</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🗣️ Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🧑‍💻 Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔧 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span> <span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">Why Choose Our Peer Reviewed Science Journals with DOI?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Expert evaluation completed within 2–3 days ensuring <strong>fast publication</strong> without compromising quality.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable APC designed for Indian and international authors.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>UGC CARE & Google Scholar Visibility:</strong> High discoverability across academic platforms.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>DOI for Every Article:</strong> Permanent digital identification for citation and indexing.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Ethical publishing standards and plagiarism screening.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Open Access Model:</strong> Research freely accessible worldwide, increasing citation impact.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span> <span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">Indexing & Abstracting</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nIndexed in major platforms including <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, Mendeley, SSRN, WorldCAT, Semantic Scholar, Dimensions, PlumX, and other reputed academic databases.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span> <span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">Our Streamlined Publication Process</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📥 Submit Online – 24/7 submission system</li>\r\n<li>⏱️ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Expert Peer Review – Within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>✅ Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF with DOI</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#bf360c; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff7043;\">🟡</span> <span style=\"color:#bf360c;\">Article Processing Charges</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<strong>For Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWithout DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br>\r\nWith DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<strong>For International 