ish scientific journal articles in computer science journals with low cost, fast publication, UGC CARE and Google Scholar indexing.','Scientific Journal Articles in Computer Science Journals','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Scientific Journal Articles in Computer Science Journals</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing <strong>scientific journal articles in computer science journals</strong> is essential for advancing innovation, academic growth, and global research visibility. The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputed open-access platform dedicated to high-quality research across diverse domains of <strong>computer science</strong>. We offer <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>rapid publication</strong> services to help researchers share impactful findings efficiently.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST strictly follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and implements a rigorous peer-review process to ensure academic integrity and quality. Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, the journal increases citation potential and global discoverability. Researchers seeking reliable publication for scientific journal articles in computer science journals will find INDJCST transparent, ethical, and author-friendly.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span> <span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">Core Research Areas in Computer Science</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Langu