omputer Science Journal?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>UGC CARE Compliance:</strong> Adherence to recognized academic publishing standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Fast & Rapid Publication:</strong> Editorial decisions within 3 days.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable article processing charges for Indian and international authors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Google Scholar Indexing:</strong> Enhanced discoverability and citation growth.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Strict Peer Review:</strong> Ensuring originality and high-quality research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Immediate global access to published work.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span> \r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">INDJCST Key Features</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📘 Peer-reviewed refereed journal</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Easy, transparent, and fast publication process</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Strict plagiarism policy</li>\r\n<li>🌍 High visibility & indexing support</li>\r\n<li>📜 Publication ethics under COPE Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n<li>📈 Growing impact and citation metrics</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🏫 Reputed editorial board</li>\r\n<li>🚀 Rapid / Fast Track publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span> \r\n<span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">Streamlined Publication Process</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📥 Submit Online – 24/7 editorial management system</li>\r\n<li>⏱️ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>✅ Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#bf360c; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff7043;\">🟡</span> \r\n<span style=\"color:#bf360c;\">Article Processing Charges</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<strong>For Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWithout DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br>\r\nWith DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<strong>For International Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWith DOI: $80 USD\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1b5e20; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff1744;\">🚀</span> \r\n<span style=\"color:#1b5e20;\">Ready to Publish in a UGC Approved Computer Science Journal?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nChoose INDJCST as your trusted <strong>UGC approved computer science journal</strong> offering <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong>, strong <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, and full <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance to maximize your research impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1565c0; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(249,'2026-02-24 09:42:38','2026-02-24 09:42:38','tags/KaHQcgRFBg4uUbQzYQcJT1DJkfOvre7n49e9TaGv.jpg','Google Scholar Articles with Fast Publication','Tag','google-scholar-articles-with-fast-publication','Google Scholar Articles with Fast Publication','Publish Google Scholar articles with fast publication. Low cost, UGC CARE journal in computer science with rapid publication process.','Google Scholar Articles with Fast Publication','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<