obile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWe encourage interdisciplinary research demonstrating practical computing applications in academic and industrial domains.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟢 Why Choose Google Scholar Articles with Fast Publication?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>⚡ Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Receive editorial decisions within 3 days for genuine <strong>rapid publication</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🌍 High Visibility:</strong> Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and multiple indexing platforms for better citations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost Processing:</strong> Affordable article processing charges for Indian and international authors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🛡️ Strict Plagiarism Screening:</strong> Ensuring integrity in every published manuscript.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 COPE Compliance:</strong> Adhering to ethical publishing standards and UGC CARE recommendations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur system ensures <strong>fast publication</strong> while maintaining the academic credibility expected from journals indexed for <strong>Google Scholar articles with fast publication</strong> in <strong>computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟣 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>📘 Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>📖 SSRN</li>\r\n<li>🌐 WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>📊 Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>📈 PlumX</li>\r\n<li>📚 ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>📄 Scribd & ISSUU</