 and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🖱️ Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWe encourage interdisciplinary research that demonstrates practical applications of computing technologies across industries.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟢 Why Choose INDJCST?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>⚡ Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Editorial decisions within 3 days supporting genuine <strong>rapid publication</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🌍 Google Scholar Visibility:</strong> Indexed for wider citation reach and academic recognition.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable article processing charges for Indian and international authors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🛡️ Strict Plagiarism Screening:</strong> Ensuring integrity and originality in every submission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 COPE Compliance:</strong> Following ethical publishing standards aligned with UGC CARE policies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur workflow ensures <strong>fast publication</strong> while maintaining the credibility expected from leading <strong>google indexed computer science journals</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟣 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>📘 Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>📖 SSRN</li>\r\n<li>🌐 WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>📊 Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>📈 PlumX</li>\r\n<li>📚 ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>📄 Scribd & ISSUU</li>\r\n<li>📂 DRJI, I2OR, EuroPub</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟠 Streamlined Rapid Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 editorial system access</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nExperience transparent and efficient <strong>fast publication</strong> in one of the most accessible <strong>google indexed computer science journals</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔴 Article Processing Charges – Low Cost Model</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur <strong>low cost</strong> structure ensures affordable access to <strong>google indexed computer science journals</strong> with assured <strong>rapid publication</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949ab; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔵 Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📊 Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Real-Time Manuscript Tracking</li>\r\n<li>📄 Automated Acceptance Letters</li>\r\n<li>⬇️ Easy Download of Certificates & Papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟢 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to one of the trusted <strong>google indexed computer science journals</strong> offering <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>low cost</strong> processing charges.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1e88e5; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">\r\n👉 Submit Your Paper Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(252,'2026-02-24 09:45:29','2026-02-24 09:45:29','tags/E7i2n8P2n9bQpgAPVwTkdqVDQgWCfYtYzkJC93bo.jpg','Impact Factor Computer Science Journals in India','Tag','impact-factor-computer-science-journals-in-india','Impact Factor Computer Science Journals in India','Impact factor computer science journals in India with UGC CARE, low cost, fast publication & Google Scholar indexing.','Impact Factor Computer Science Journals in India','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Impact Factor Computer Science Journals in India</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nLooking for **impact factor computer science journals in India** that combine academic recognition with credible publishing? Journals with an official impact factor are typically indexed in recognized databases and reflect strong citation influence and research quality. Publishing in such journals enhances your scholarly reputation, career prospects, and global visibility in the field of <strong>computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nMany Indian journals now provide avenues for impactful research dissemination with features such as **UGC CARE** compliance, **low cost**, **fast publication**, and indexing in **Google Scholar** and other recognized databases. Researchers can choose journals that balance academic excellence with efficient publication processes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span> <span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">What Is an Impact Factor Journal?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAn *impact factor* is a metric that reflects the average number of citations received by articles published in a journal over a specific period. Journals with higher impact factors are generally more widely cited and regarded as influential within their field. Many **impact factor computer science journals in India** are also indexed in global databases like Scopus or Web of Science, in addition to national indexing like UGC CARE.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span> <span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">Benefits of Publishing in Impact Factor Journals</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📈 **Academic Recognition:** Impact factors signify research influence and quality.</li>\r\n<li>🌍 **Global Visibility:** Indexed journals often have wider researcher reach.</li>\r\n<li>🎓 **Career Advancement:** Impact factor journals are valued for promotions and funding applications.</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Indexed & Fast Publication:** Many journals support rapid peer review and publication.</li>\r\n<li>💰 **Affordable Options:** Some provide **low cost** or subsidized publication routes.</li>\r\n<li>📚 **Google Scholar Indexing:** Helps improve discoverability and citations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span> <span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">Leading Indian Computer Science Journals</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nIndia hosts several reputable computer science journals, some with recognized impact factors or strong citation performance. These journals often offer rigorous peer review, visibility in global databases, and support for academic authors. (Specific impact factors and indexing data can be verified on official indexing platforms like Clarivate Web of Science or Scopus.)  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📘 *Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)* – Peer-reviewed and indexed with strong visibility. Includes **UGC CARE** alignment and **Google Scholar** indexing.</li>\r\n<li>📗 *International Journal of Advanced Research in Computer Science* (check indexing status) – Popular venue for AI and computing research.</li>\r\n<li>📙 *Journal of Information Technology & Software Engineering* (verify impact metrics) – Focused on interdisciplinary computing topics.</li>\r\n<li>📕 *ACM Transactions on Computing Education* (India authors publish) – High citation and visibility internationally.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span> <span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">Tips to Verify Impact Factor Journals</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔍 Use the **Clarivate Web of Science Master Journal List** to check official impact factor rankings.</li>\r\n<li>📊 Search **Scopus sources** for SNIP and SJR metrics for journal influence.</li>\r\n<li>📚 Confirm **UGC CARE** listing for Indian academic relevance.</li>\r\n<li>📈 Review recent citation reports and publication statistics.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#bf360c; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff7043;\">🟡</span> <span style=\"color:#bf360c;\">Choosing the Right Journal</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhen selecting from impact factor computer science journals in India, consider editorial quality, publication timelines, **fast publication**, indexing depth (like **Google Scholar** and UGC CARE), and any **low cost** advantages. Always verify impact metrics through official sources before submitting your manuscript.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1b5e20; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff1744;\">🚀</span> <span style=\"color:#1b5e20;\">Get Started with Your Submission</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nReady to publish in a reputable impact factor computer science journal in India? Begin with journals that support strong indexing, verified impact factors, respected peer review, and efficient publication processes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1565c0; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px;\">\r\nExplore Publication Options\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n::contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}'),(253,'2026-02-24 09:46:55','2026-02-24 09:46:55','tags/yggNBniFVQZGR1SxofDvGVqGQKVycCFSmax3RHXh.jpg','Google Scholar Indexed Computer Science Journals','Tag','google-scholar-indexed-computer-science-journals','Google Scholar Indexed Computer Science Journals','Publish in Google Scholar indexed computer science journals with low cost, rapid publication and UGC CARE compliance. Fast review and global reach.','Google Scholar Indexed Computer Science Journals','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Google Scholar Indexed Computer Science Journals – INDJCST (e-ISSN: 2583-5300)</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> is one of the trusted <strong>Google Scholar indexed computer science journals</strong> co