ong>open access computer science journals</strong>, INDJCST strictly follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and implements a rigorous peer-review process to ensure academic integrity. Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and multiple international databases, the journal combines <strong>low cost</strong> publishing with assured <strong>fast publication</strong> and structured <strong>rapid publication</strong> timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔵 Scope of Open Access Computer Science Journals</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAs one of the recognized <strong>open access computer science journals</strong>, INDJCST publishes original research and review papers in:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🖱️ Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWe encourage interdisciplinary research demonstrating practical applications of computing technologies across diverse sectors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟢 Why Choose INDJCST?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>⚡ Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Editorial decisions within 3 days supporting genuine <strong>rapid publication</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🌍 Google Scholar Indexing:</strong> Enhanced citation visibility and academic recognition worldwide.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable article processing charges for Indian and international authors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🛡️ Strict Plagiarism Policy:</strong> Advanced screening ensures originality and integrity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 COPE & UGC CARE Compliance:</strong> Ethical publishing aligned with global best practices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur streamlined workflow guarantees <strong>fast publication</strong> while maintaining the credibility expected from high-quality <strong>open access computer science journals</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟣 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>📘 Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>📖 SSRN</li>\r\n<li>🌐 WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>📊 Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>📈 PlumX</li>\r\n<li>📚 ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>📄 Scribd & ISSUU</li>\r\n<li>📂 DRJI, I2OR, EuroPub</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟠 Streamlined Rapid Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 editorial management system</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Expert Peer Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nExperience transparent and efficient <strong>rapid publication</strong> in one of the most reliable <strong>open access computer science journals</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr sty