JCST welcomes original research and review articles in the following areas:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🖱️ Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWe encourage interdisciplinary research with practical applications across industries and academic fields.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟢 Why Choose INDJCST?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>⚡ Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Editorial decisions within 3 days ensuring <strong>rapid publication</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🌍 Global DOI Recognition:</strong> Every accepted article receives a DOI for international academic citation and indexing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable processing charges for Indian and international authors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🛡️ Strict Plagiarism Policy:</strong> Ensuring originality and research integrity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 UGC CARE & COPE Compliance:</strong> Ethical publishing aligned with global standards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur structured process provides <strong>fast publication</strong> while maintaining the credibility expected from leading <strong>international computer science journals with DOI</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟣 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>📘 Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>📖 SSRN</li>\r\n<li>🌐 WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>📊 Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>📈 PlumX</li>\r\n<li>📚 ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>📄 Scribd & ISSUU</li>\r\n<li>📂 DRJI, I2OR, EuroPub</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟠 Streamlined Rapid Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 editorial management system</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nExperience transparent and efficient <strong>fast publication</strong> in one of the most dependable <strong>international computer science journals with DOI</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔴 Article Processing Charges – Affordable & Transparent</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur <strong>low cost</strong> model supports accessible publishing with assured <strong>fast publication</strong> in <strong>computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949ab; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔵 Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📊 Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Real-Time Manuscript Tracking</li>\r\n<li>📄 Automated Acceptance Letters & Forms</li>\r\n<li>⬇️ Easy Download of Certificates & Published Papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟢 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your research to one of the most trusted <strong>international computer science journals with DOI</strong> offering <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, <strong>low cost</strong> processing charges, and assured <strong>rapid publication</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1e88e5; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">\r\n👉 Submit Your Paper Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(275,'2026-02-24 10:14:37','2026-02-24 10:14:37','tags/7esXabKZ9gzbY9HWneUCIyDxvJICzpjiTpMUNuOb.jpg','Free Computer Science Journal Publication: Myth or Reality?','Tag','free-computer-science-journal-publication-myth-or-reality','Free Computer Science Journal Publication: Myth or Reality?','Free Computer Science Journal Publication: Myth or Reality? Learn about low cost, fast publication, UGC CARE and Google Scholar indexed options.','Free Computer Science Journal Publication: Myth or Reality?','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Free Computer Science Journal Publication: Myth or Reality?</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nIs <strong>Free Computer Science Journal Publication: Myth or Reality?</strong> a genuine possibility for researchers in 2026? Many scholars in <strong>computer science</strong> search for fully free publication options, especially when funding is limited. However, understanding how academic publishing works helps clarify whether “free” truly exists or if <strong>low cost</strong> alternatives are more realistic.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nIn this guide, we explore whether free publication is achievable, how <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance affect costs, and how to choose journals that offer <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> without compromising quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">Why Most Journals Charge APC</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAcademic journals incur operational costs including peer review management, editorial processing, DOI registration, indexing support, digital archiving, and website maintenance. Open access journals especially depend on Article Processing Charges (APC) to keep research freely available worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nTherefore, completely free computer science journal publication is rare in open access models. Instead, many reputable journals offer <strong>low cost</strong> publication options to maintain sustainability while ensuring global accessibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">When Is Free Publication Possible?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🎓 University-funded journals that do not charge APC</li>\r\n<li>📚 Subscription-based journals (no APC but limited open access)</li>\r\n<li>🏛️ Society-sponsored publications</li>\r\n<li>💼 Special waiver programs for authors with financial constraints</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nHowever, such journals may have longer review timelines and limited <strong>rapid publication</strong> processes compared to professional open-access platforms.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">Low Cost vs Free: What Should You Choose?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nInstead of focusing solely on “free,” researchers should evaluate:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>✔ <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance for academic recognition</li>\r\n<li>✔ <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing for visibility</li>\r\n<li>✔ Transparent and affordable <strong>low cost</strong> APC</li>\r\n<li>✔ <strong>Fast publication</strong> and clear peer-review timelines</li>\r\n<li>✔ DOI assignment and citation tracking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nA low cost computer science journal with strong indexing often provides better long-term academic value than a completely free but poorly indexed alternative.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">Risks of “Too Good to Be True” Free Journals</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSome journals advertising free publication may lack proper peer review or credible indexing. Warning signs include:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>❌ No clear editorial board</li>\r\n<li>❌ False claims of <strong>Google Scholar</strong> or UGC listing</li>\r\n<li>❌ No DOI assignment</li>\r\n<li>❌ Unrealistic acceptance within 24 hours</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAlways verify indexing status and editorial transparency before submitting your computer science research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#bf360c; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff7043;\">🟡</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#bf360c;\">Final Verdict: Myth or Reality?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSo, is <strong>Free Computer Science Journal Publication: Myth or Reality?</strong> The answer is both. Completely free publication exists but is limited and often competitive. For most researchers, choosing a <strong>low cost</strong>, well-indexed journal with <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> visibility provides a more reliable and impactful option.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\nIn 2026, the smart approach is not just to search for “free,” but to prioritize credibility, indexing, and long-term research impact in <strong>computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(276,'2026-02-24 10:16:07','2026-02-24 10:16:07','tags/aj7bsZN3tx9UJObwSGVpdinDP9NqcPEWKx1Q6mhF.jpg','Low Cost Open Access Computer Science Journals with DOI','Tag','low-cost-open-access-computer-science-journals-with-doi','Low Cost Open Access Computer Science Journals with DOI','Low Cost Open Access Computer Science Journals with DOI offering fast publication, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing.','Low Cost Open Access Computer Science Journals with DOI','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Low Cost Open Access Computer Science Journals with DOI</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSearching for <strong>Low Cost Open Access Computer Science Journals with DOI</strong> in 2026? Researchers today prefer journals that combine <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong>, and strong indexing such as <strong>Google Scholar</strong> while maintaining <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance. Selecting the right <strong>computer science</strong> journal ensures academic credibility, global accessibility, and long-term citation impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable platform among Low Cost Open Access Computer Science Journals with DOI. It offers transparent policies, affordable article processing charges, and a streamlined editorial workflow for global researchers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">About INDJCST – Open Access with DOI</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST is a peer-reviewed, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research across all domains of <strong>computer science</strong>. Published three times a year, it serves academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nEvery accepted article receives a DOI, ensuring permanent digital identification and easy citation tracking. As a journal aligned with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, INDJCST enhances research discoverability and academic impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">Major Computer Science Research Areas</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🗣️ Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🧑‍💻 Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔧 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">Why Choose Low Cost Open Access with DOI?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable APC for Indian and international authors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Fast & Rapid Publication:</strong> Editorial decisions within 3 days.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Open Access Model:</strong> Free global access without subscription barriers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>UGC CARE Compliance:</strong> Recognized academic publishing standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Google Scholar Indexing:</strong> Increased visibility and citation tracking.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Strict Peer Review:</strong> Ensures originality, integrity, and research quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">Streamlined Publication Process</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📥 Submit Online – 24/7 editorial management system</li>\r\n<li>⏱️ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>✅ Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication with DOI – Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#bf360c; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom: