cience Journals with Low Publication Fee</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAre you searching for <strong>Fast Publishing Computer Science Journals with Low Publication Fee</strong> in 2026? Researchers in <strong>computer science</strong> increasingly look for journals that combine <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>rapid publication</strong> while ensuring credibility through <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable open-access journal designed for researchers who need timely publication without high processing fees. It offers an ideal balance between affordability and academic excellence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">About INDJCST – Fast & Affordable Publishing</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST publishes high-quality research papers across all domains of <strong>computer science</strong> and emerging technologies. Published three times a year, the journal provides a reliable platform for academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal strictly follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and ensures a rigorous peer-review process. As a <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexed journal, it enhances research discoverability and citation tracking while maintaining transparent and <strong>low cost</strong> publication policies.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">Major Computer Science Research Areas</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🗣️ Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🧑‍💻 Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔧 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">Why Choose Fast Publishing with Low Publication Fee?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Editorial decisions within 3 days.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Fast Publication:</strong> Streamlined workflow for quick dissemination.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Low Cost APC:</strong> Affordable publication fees for researchers and PhD scholars.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>UGC CARE Compliance:</strong> Recognized academic standards in India.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Google Scholar Indexing:</strong> Increased visibility and citation impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ <strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Immediate global accessibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">Streamlined Publication Process</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📥 Submit Online – 24/7 editorial system</li>\r\n<li>⏱️ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Expert Peer Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>✅ Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication – Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#bf360c; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff7043;\">🟡</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#bf360c;\">Affordable Article Processing Charges</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<strong>For Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWithout DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br>\r\nWith DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<strong>For International Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWith DOI: $80 USD\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1b5e20; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff1744;\">🚀</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1b5e20;\">Ready for Fast Publishing?</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nChoose from trusted <strong>Fast Publishing Computer Science Journals with Low Publication Fee</strong> that offer <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong>, strong <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, and full <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance. INDJCST provides a transparent and efficient publication pathway for your computer science research in 2026.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1565c0; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(278,'2026-02-24 10:18:10','2026-02-24 10:18:10','tags/Ex0Vufgrw7XvH7VEF08CZYQBONLif0ExohlE8yBU.jpg','UGC Approved Low Fee Computer Science Journals – Updated List','Tag','ugc-approved-low-fee-computer-science-journals-updated-list','UGC Approved Low Fee Computer Science Journals – Updated List','UGC approved low fee computer science journals list with low cost, fast publication, rapid publication and Google Scholar indexing.','UGC Approved Low Fee Computer Science Journals – Updated List','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">UGC Approved Low Fee Computer Science Journals – Updated List</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nLooking for an **UGC Approved Low Fee Computer Science Journals – Updated List** for 2026? Researchers and scholars in <strong>computer science</strong> often seek journals that combine **UGC CARE** approval, **low cost** publication, **fast publication**, **rapid publication**, and strong indexing like **Google Scholar** for maximum research visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nBelow is an updated list of reputable UGC approved low fee computer science journals that support credible research dissemination with affordable article processing charges and efficient publication timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">1. Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<strong>INDJCST</strong> is a peer-reviewed, open-access journal (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) dedicated to publishing high-quality research across domains of <strong>computer science</strong>. With **UGC CARE** compliance, **low cost** fees, and **Google Scholar** indexing, this journal offers **fast publication** and transparent workflows. Authors benefit from rapid peer review and wide research visibility without significant costs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">2. International Journal of Computer Science & Applications</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>International Journal of Computer Science & Applications</strong> is another UGC CARE-recognized venue ideal for authors seeking **low cost** and indexed publication. With broad coverage including AI, data science, and networking, this journal ensures global visibility and efficient publication practices.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">3. Journal of Information Technology & Software Engineering</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe **Journal of Information Technology & Software Engineering** supports UGC CARE compliance for Indian academia and offers **low fee** options. Indexed in Google Scholar and other academic databases, it provides a reliable platform for computer science research publications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">4. International Journal of Advanced Computer Science and Applications (IJACSA)</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n**IJACSA** is a reputable journal indexed in UGC CARE and Google Scholar. With **low cost** publication fees and consistent publication cycles, it’s an attractive choice for authors seeking **fast publication** and broad academic reach.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#bf360c; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff7043;\">🟡</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#bf360c;\">5. International Journal of Computer Science Engineering Techniques (IJCSE)</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe **International Journal of Computer Science Engineering Techniques (IJCSE)** offers UGC CARE recognition, **low fee** publication options, and indexing across academic platforms. Its inclusive scope covers traditional and emerging areas within computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1b5e20; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff1744;\">🟣</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1b5e20;\">Key Features to Look For</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>✔ **UGC CARE Approval:** Ensures recognized academic publishing standards</li>\r\n<li>✔ **Low Cost:** Affordable APC suited for researchers and PhD scholars</li>\r\n<li>✔ **Fast & Rapid Publication:** Efficient editorial and review workflows</li>\r\n<li>✔ **Google Scholar Indexing:** Enhanced research visibility and citations</li>\r\n<li>✔ **Ethical Peer Review:** Maintains high research quality and integrity</li>\r\n<li>✔ **Open Access Options:** Wider global access without subscription barriers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">Tips Before Submitting</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nBefore submitting to any of the UGC approved low fee computer science journals, always verify:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Current indexing status on Google Scholar and UGC CARE list</li>\r\n<li>📅 Publication frequency and timelines for <strong>fast publication</strong></li>\r\n<li>💡 Article guidelines and scope alignment with your research</li>\r\n<li>📄 Peer review policies and ethical standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1b5e20; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff1744;\">🚀</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1b5e20;\">Conclusion</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\nThis updated list of **UGC Approved Low Fee Computer Science Journals** combines affordability, efficient publication, and strong indexing to help you make informed choices. Whether you seek fast publication, broad visibility on Google Scholar, or recognized UGC CARE compliance, these journals offer credible pathways for your research in 2026 and beyond.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n::contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}');
INSERT INTO `tags` VALUES (279,'2026-02-24 10:19:38','2026-02-24 10:19:38','tags/lpnxSApCWqmOblD6tNFIc2VdXw5eq9WiM2Jh5UiF.jpg','How to Choose a Safe and Low Cost CS Journal for Publication','Tag','how-to-choose-a-safe-and-low-cost-cs-journal-for-publication','How to Choose a Safe and Low Cost CS Journal for Publication','How to Choose a Safe and Low Cost CS Journal for Publication with fast publication, UGC CARE and Google Scholar indexing.','How to Choose a Safe and Low Cost CS Journal for Publication','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">How to Choose a Safe and Low Cost CS Journal for Publication</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nUnderstanding <strong>How to Choose a Safe and Low Cost CS Journal for Publication</strong> is essential for every researcher in <strong>computer science</strong>. With many journals offering <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, and <strong>rapid publication</strong>, selecting a credible and secure platform ensures your research gains proper academic recognition and long-term impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nA safe journal should provide transparent policies, ethical peer review, clear indexing information such as <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, and compliance with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards where applicable.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">1. Verify UGC CARE and Indexing Status</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nBefore submission, confirm whether the journal is listed under <strong>UGC CARE</strong> (if required for academic evaluation). Additionally, verify its presence in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and other indexing platforms. Proper indexing improves visibility, citation tracking, and research credibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nNever rely only on claims made on the website — cross-check indexing information directly from official sources.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">2. Evaluate Publication Fees and Transparency</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nA reliable <strong>low cost</strong> computer science journal clearly displays its Article Processing Charges (APC). Avoid journals that hide fees or request unexpected payments after acceptance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>✔ Transparent APC structure</li>\r\n<li>✔ Clear mention of DOI charges (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li>✔ No hidden or post-acceptance fees</li>\r\n<li>✔ Affordable options for researchers and PhD scholars</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">3. Review the Peer-Review Process</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nA safe CS journal must follow a rigorous peer-review process. While <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> are attractive, quality should never be compromised.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔍 Clearly defined review timelines</li>\r\n<li>📄 Reviewer comments and revision opportunities</li>\r\n<li>📜 Ethical policies aligned with COPE guidelines</li>\r\n<li>🔎 Strong plagiarism screening</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">4. Check Journal Scope and Editorial Board</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nEnsure the journal’s scope aligns with your <strong>computer science</strong> research area, such as Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, Cybersecurity, IoT, Cloud Computing, or Software Engineering.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nA reputable editorial board with qualified academicians and researchers adds credibility and ensures academic integrity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#bf360c; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff7043;\">🟡</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#bf360c;\">5. Examine the Publication Workflow</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nA professional journal should offer:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📥 Online submission system</li>\r\n<li>⏱️ Initial acknowledgment within 24–48 hours</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Structured peer review</li>\r\n<li>✅ Clear decision notification timeline</li>\r\n<li>📄 DOI assignment and final publication certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nEfficient workflows ensure <strong>fast publication</strong> while maintaining academic quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1b5e20; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff1744;\">🚀</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1b5e20;\">Final Checklist for Safe & Low Cost CS Journals</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ Confirm <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance (if needed).<br>\r\n✔ Verify <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing.<br>\r\n✔ Choose journals with transparent and <strong>low cost</strong> APC.<br>\r\n✔ Ensure proper peer review despite <strong>rapid publication</strong> promises.<br>\r\n✔ Avoid unrealistic acceptance guarantees.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\nBy understanding <strong>How to Choose a Safe and Low Cost CS Journal for Publication</strong>, researchers can confidently select credible platforms that balance affordability, academic integrity, and long-term research impact in the field of <strong>computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(280,'2026-02-24 10:21:58','2026-02-24 10:21:58','tags/m0EThEUDFCqtxjfevRa18vDo9SskxTC6vUmuRKR8.jpg','International Computer Science Journals with Low Publication Charges','Tag','international-computer-science-journals-with-low-publication-charges','International Computer Science Journals with Low Publication Charges','Explore international computer science journals with low publication charges, fast publication, UGC CARE and Google Scholar indexing.','International Computer Science Journals with Low Publication Charges','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">International Computer Science Journals with Low Publication Charges</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nLooking for **International Computer Science Journals with Low Publication Charges** in 2026? Research in **computer science** often requires choosing publication venues that balance **low cost**, **fast publication**, and wide visibility — including indexing on **Google Scholar** and compliance with **UGC CARE** standards for academic recognition.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis guide highlights what to consider and how to identify reputable international journals that offer affordable publication options without compromising on quality or credibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span> \r\n<span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">Key Features of Low Publication Charge Journals</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhen evaluating **international computer science journals with low publication charges**, look for:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>💰 <strong>Low Cost APC:</strong> Affordable article processing charges suitable for global researchers.</li>\r\n<li>⚡ <strong>Fast Publication:</strong> Efficient peer-review and publication timelines for rapid dissemination.</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Global Indexing: Inclusion in **Google Scholar** and other academic databases.</li>\r\n<li>📜 Ethical Peer Review: Transparent and rigorous screening of submissions.</li>\r\n<li>📄 DOI Assignment: Permanent identifiers for published articles.</li>\r\n<li>🔖 Recognized Standards: Optional **UGC CARE** compliance for academic evaluation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span> \r\n<span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">Popular Publishers & Journals to Explore</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhile specific journals and charges vary, the following types of international journals are known for providing low publication charges and good indexing in the field of computer science:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📘 Journals from international professional societies with subsidized APC options.</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Cross-disciplinary open access journals with reasonable pricing.</li>\r\n<li>📙 Regional international journals that support global indexing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nBe sure to verify each journal’s current indexing and fee structure before submission to ensure it meets your needs for **low publication charges**, **fast publication**, and academic impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span> \r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">Tips to Find International CS Journals with Low Fees</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Search verified databases like DOAJ and Scopus for APC details.</li>\r\n<li>📚 Check journal websites directly for up-to-date fee structures.</li>\r\n<li>📈 Confirm indexing in **Google Scholar** and other academic platforms.</li>\r\n<li>📜 Avoid predatory outlets by reviewing editorial boards and review policies.</li>\r\n<li>⚖️ Compare turnaround times for **rapid publication** and quality metrics like citations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span> \r\n<span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">Advantages of Publishing in Low Fee International Journals</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n✔ Broader global visibility through international indexing.<br>\r\n✔ Lower financial barriers for authors worldwide.<br>\r\n✔ Faster dissemination of research findings.<br>\r\n✔ Permanent DOI assignment for published articles.<br>\r\n✔ Support for academic career advancement with recognized journals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1b5e20; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#ff1744;\">🚀</span> \r\n<span style=\"color:#1b5e20;\">Final Note</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\nChoosing **international computer science journals with low publication charges** requires balancing **low cost**, **fast publication**, strong indexing such as **Google Scholar**, and, where relevant, **UGC CARE** compliance. Always verify journal credentials and fee details before submitting your research to ensure credible and impactful publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n::contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}'),(281,'2026-02-24 10:23:01','2026-02-24 10:23:01','tags/mA62GUsibf5r0SSbQRkDdU2fxoDES1fbRTryTvse.jpg','Low Cost AI and Machine Learning Journals 2026','Tag','low-cost-ai-and-machine-learning-journals-2026','Low Cost AI and Machine Learning Journals 2026','Low Cost AI and Machine Learning Journals for Researchers with fast publication, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing.','Low Cost AI and Machine Learning Journals 2026','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Low Cost AI and Machine Learning Journals for Researchers</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFinding <strong>Low Cost AI and Machine Learning Journals for Researchers</strong> is essential in 2026 as Artificial Intelligence conti