tyle=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">Top Criteria for Selecting Quality Journals</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>✔ **Low Cost:** Affordable publication fees that reduce financial burden for PhD scholars</li>\r\n<li>✔ **Fast & Rapid Publication:** Efficient peer-review timeline for timely dissemination</li>\r\n<li>✔ **UGC CARE Compliance:** Academic recognition within Indian universities</li>\r\n<li>✔ **Google Scholar Indexing:** Ensures visibility and citation tracking</li>\r\n<li>✔ **Peer Review Quality:** Strong editorial standards and rigorous review</li>\r\n<li>✔ **Open Access Options:** Wider global accessibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">1. Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable open-access journal publishing high-quality research across all areas of **computer science**, including Machine Learning. With **low cost** article processing, **fast publication** timelines, and strong **Google Scholar** visibility, it supports researchers aiming for impactful PhD publications. INDJCST also aligns with **UGC CARE** guidelines, ensuring academic integrity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">2. International Journal of Advanced Machine Learning</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe International Journal of Advanced Machine Learning offers publications covering deep learning, neural networks, and advanced AI topics. Known for its **fast publication** cycles and **peer-reviewed** process, it provides a platform for PhD scholars seeking quality publi