 Journal</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research across IoT and other <strong>computer science</strong> domains. Published three times a year, it provides a reliable platform for academicians, engineers, researchers, and industry professionals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST adheres to <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and follows a rigorous peer-review process to maintain academic excellence. Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and multiple academic platforms, it offers <strong>low cost</strong> APC options combined with a streamlined <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> process.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">IoT & Related Research Areas</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📡 Internet of Things (IoT) Architecture</li>\r\n<li>☁️ IoT with Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 IoT Security & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>🤖 AI & Machine Learning for IoT</li>\r\n<li>📊 Big Data Analytics in IoT Systems</li>\r\n<li>🛠️ Embedded Systems & Smart Devices</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Wireless Sensor Networks</li>\r\n<li>🏙️ Smart Cities & Industrial IoT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\r\n<span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">Streamlined Publication Process</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📥 Online submission (24/7 system)</li>\r\n<li>⏱️ Initial acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Peer review completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>✅ Acceptance/Rejection decision within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Instant online publication with certificate and DOI option</li>\r\n</ol>