or:#0d47a1;\">Conclusion</span>\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nIf you are searching for an <strong>IoT journal with low publication fee</strong>, prioritize journals that offer a balanced combination of affordability, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and strong <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing. Publishing in a peer-reviewed IoT journal enhances your research impact and academic reach.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1565c0; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n::contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}'),(317,'2026-02-25 07:35:38','2026-02-25 07:35:38','tags/ZTXdf5R2fd40wKt0FyIYQnDpiCHFuCI0XUQLDxqE.jpg','Computer Networks Journal Impact Factor Guide','Tag','computer-networks-journal-impact-factor-guide','Computer Networks Journal Impact Factor Guide','Learn about computer networks journal impact factor, indexing, fast publication, UGC CARE compliance, Google Scholar and low cost publishing.','Computer Networks Journal Impact Factor Guide','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Computer Networks Journal Impact Factor – INDJCST Insights</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nUnderstanding the **computer networks journal impact factor** helps researchers choose high-visibility platforms for publishing their work in networking, communications, and security. Impact factor and related metrics reflect how frequently articles in a journal are cited, signaling academic influence — whether you are seeking to read or publish in journals with strong research impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> is a reputable, peer-reviewed journal covering computer networks and related research areas. Though traditional impact factor listings are based on sources like Clarivate/Web of Science, INDJCST enhances discoverability and citation potential through broad indexing (e.g., <strong>Google Scholar</strong>), support for **fast publication**, and adherence to recognized publishing standards including **UGC CARE** compliance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">📊 What Is Impact Factor?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe **impact factor** of a journal is a metric that estimates the average number of citations to articles published in that journal over a specific period. It helps authors assess:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📈 Academic influence in fields such as computer networks and communications</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Likelihood of reaching a broad research audience</li>\r\n<li>🏆 Recognition in institutional evaluations</li>\r\n<li>📚 Long-term citation growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhile some journals are officially listed in databases like Web of Science with an impact factor, others — including those indexed in platforms like <strong>Google Scholar</strong> — use citation metrics such as h-index or CiteScore to demonstrate influence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🟢 Choosing a Computer Networks Journal with Good Impact</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhen evaluating the **computer networks journal impact factor**, consider the following attributes:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📍 Indexing in major databases (e.g., Web of Science, Scopus, Google Scholar)</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Fast and structured publication process to disseminate findings quickly</li>\r\n<li>📜 Peer-review quality and editorial standards (e.g., UGC CARE compliance)</li>\r\n<li>💡 Relevance and citation trends in computer networks research</li>\r\n<li>💰 Affordable (low cost) processing with transparent publishing fees</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese factors help you balance timely publication with long-term academic impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">🌐 How INDJCST Supports Impactful Networking Research</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAs a credible journal covering networking and related topics, INDJCST supports research that contributes to measurable influence over time. Key features include:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤝 Peer-reviewed quality across computer networks and communications topics</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Structured process for **fast publication**</li>\r\n<li>🔎 Indexed in global discoverability platforms like <strong>Google Scholar</strong></li>\r\n<li>📜 Ethical standards with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance</li>\r\n<li>💰 Transparent, **low cost** publication options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhile individual impact factors may vary by index, these features support strong citation performance and scholarly influence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔍 Networking Research Areas Covered</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📡 Wireless & Mobile Networks</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Network Security & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>📊 Network Performance & Optimization</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & SDN Networking</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Intelligent Networking & AI-Driven Protocols</li>\r\n<li>📱 IoT & Edge Network Systems</li>\r\n<li>🔄 Network Protocols & Architecture</li>\r\n<li>⚙️ Quality of Service (QoS) & Reliability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nJournals with strong citation trends in these research areas are often highlighted in impact analyses.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">🚀 Ready to Publish Your Networks Paper?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your research to journals that balance impact with accessibility — whether tracking official impact factor metrics or leveraging broad indexing like <strong>Google Scholar</strong> for citation visibility, efficient **rapid publication**, and global reach.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1e88e5; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">\r\n👉 Submit Your Computer Networks Paper Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(318,'2026-02-25 07:35:55','2026-02-25 07:35:55','tags/0Wosj3GX21hxJ2JStmYuh86mVF7nYColxMdsWb6A.jpg','Embedded Systems Research Journal – Low Cost & Fast Publication','Tag','embedded-systems-research-journal-low-cost-fast-publication','Embedded Systems Research Journal – Low Cost & Fast Publication','Embedded systems research journal with low cost publication fees, fast publication, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing for computer science scholars.','Embedded Systems Research Journal – Low Cost & Fast Publication','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\"> <h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Embedded Systems Research Journal</h1> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> Publishing in an <strong>Embedded systems research journal</strong> is crucial for researchers working on hardware-software integration, real-time computing, IoT edge devices, and intelligent embedded solutions. Today’s scholars seek journals that offer <strong>low cost</strong> publication charges, <strong>fast publication</strong>, structured <strong>rapid publication</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and indexing in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> to ensure global discoverability and academic recognition in <strong>computer science</strong>. </p> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> Selecting a trusted peer-reviewed journal enhances your work’s impact and ensures long-term citation visibility in embedded systems research. </p> <h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\"> <span style=\"color:#e53935;\">🔴</span> <span style=\"color:#1e88e5;\">Key Benefits of an Embedded Systems Journal</span> </h2> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> <li>💰 Affordable and transparent <strong>low cost</strong> APC structure</li> <li>⚡ Efficient <strong>fast publication</strong> and review workflow</li> <li>🚀 Defined <strong>rapid publication</strong> timeline</li> <li>🎓 Compliance with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> academic standards</li> <li>📚 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and major databases</li> <li>🔍 Thorough peer-review and ethical screening</li> </ul> <h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\"> <span style=\"color:#fb8c00;\">🟠</span> <span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">About INDJCST – Embedded Systems & Computer Science Journal</span> </h2> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST) (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research across embedded systems, Internet of Things (IoT), real-time computing, and broader <strong>computer science</strong> fields. Published three times a year, it provides a trusted platform for academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals. </p> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> INDJCST adheres to <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and implements a rigorous peer-review process to uphold scholarly excellence. Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and multiple academic platforms, the journal offers <strong>low cost</strong> APC options combined with an efficient <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> process. </p> <h2 style=\"color:#6a1b9a; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\"> <span style=\"color:#d81b60;\">🟣</span> <span style=\"color:#6a1b9a;\">Embedded Systems Research Topics Covered</span> </h2> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> <li>🛠️ Embedded System Architecture & Design</li> <li>📡 Real-Time and Time-Critical Systems</li> <li>☁️ IoT Edge Devices & Integration</li> <li>🔐 Security & Privacy in Embedded Systems</li> <li>🤖 AI & ML for Embedded Applications</li> <li>📊 Data Acquisition & Sensor Networks</li> <li>⚙️ FPGA, Microcontrollers & Hardware Acceleration</li> <li>📈 Performance Optimization & Resource Management</li> </ul> <h2 style=\"color:#1565c0; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\"> <span style=\"color:#43a047;\">🟢</span> <span style=\"color:#1565c0;\">Publication Workflow</span> </h2> <ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> <li>📥 Online manuscript submission (24/7 access)</li> <li>⏱️ Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li> <li>🔍 Peer review completed within 2 days</li> <li>✅ Decision on acceptance/rejection within 3 days</li> <li>📄 Instant publication with certificate and DOI option</li> </ol> <h2 style=\"color:#bf360c; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\"> <span style=\"color:#ff7043;\">🟡</span> <span style=\"color:#bf360c;\">Affordable Article Processing Charges</span> </h2> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> <strong>For Indian Authors:</strong><br> Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br> With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST </p> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> <strong>For International Authors:</strong><br> With DOI: $80 USD </p> <h2 style=\"color:#0d47a1; margin-top:30px; margin-bottom:15px;\"> <span style=\"color:#ff1744;\">🚀</span> <span style=\"color:#0d47a1;\">Conclusion</span> </h2> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> Choosing the right <strong>Embedded systems research journal</strong> with <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and strong <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing ensures that your embedded systems research achieves recognition, credibility, and broad academic impact. </p> <p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\"> <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1565c0; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px;\"> Start Submission Today </a> </p> </div> ::contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}'),(319,'2026-02-25 07:36:57','2026-02-25 07:36:57','tags/cm5G0Q815SPeWshn9APFucoEAXNYbosXtbBNb6Et.jpg','Smart City IoT Journal with Fast Publication – INDJCST','Tag','smart-city-iot-journal-with-fast-publication-indjcst','Smart City IoT Journal with Fast Publication – INDJCST','Publish in a smart city IoT journal with fast publication. Low cost, UGC CARE, Google Scholar indexed, rapid peer review in computer science.','Smart City IoT Journal with Fast Publication – INDJCST','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Smart City IoT Journal with Fast Publication</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a leading <strong>smart city IoT journal with fast publication</strong>, dedicated to publishing high-quality, peer-reviewed research across all domains of <strong>computer science</strong>. Published three times a year, INDJCST offers a <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong> platform for academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAs a <strong>UGC CARE</strong>-aligned and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexed journal, INDJCST ensures visibility, credibility, and academic recognition. Every manuscript undergoes a strict peer-review process, making it a trusted destination for authors seeking a <strong>smart city IoT journal with fast publication</strong> and strong scholarly impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Scope of the Journal – Computer Science & Emerging Technologies</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nINDJCST welcomes interdisciplinary and application-oriented research in computer science, especially in smart city and IoT-driven innovations. Topics include:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🟣 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Internet of Things (IoT) & Smart City Applications</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>🟣 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Embedded Systems & Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🟣 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nIf you are searching for a <strong>smart city IoT journal with fast publication</strong> that supports practical computing solutions and real-world applications, INDJCST provides the ideal academic environment.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Why Choose INDJCST? – Rapid & Low Cost Publication</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>⚡ <strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> – Decision within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>💰 <strong>Low Cost Publication</strong> – Affordable APC structure</li>\r\n<li>🚀 <strong>Fast / Rapid Publication</strong> – Streamlined editorial workflow</li>\r\n<li>📚 <strong>UGC CARE Guidelines Followed</strong></li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> & international databases</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Strict Plagiarism Policy</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Open Access with Creative Commons (CC BY-NC-ND)</li>\r\n<li>📜 COPE Best Practice Publication Ethics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST combines <strong>rapid publication</strong> with academic rigor, making it one of the most reliable options for researchers in <strong>computer science</strong> and IoT domains.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nINDJCST ensures high visibility through indexing in:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>SSRN</li>\r\n<li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>DRJI</li>\r\n<li>EuroPub</li>\r\n<li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n<li>PlumX</li>\r\n<li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Streamlined Publication Process – Fast Track Model</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📩 Submit Online – 24/7 submission system</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📢 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Instant Publication & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur editorial workflow ensures that authors looking for a <strong>smart city IoT journal with fast publication</strong> receive timely communication and transparent tracking at every stage.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E53935; margin-top:25px;\">🔴 Article Processing Charges (Low Cost Model)</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nINDJCST follows a <strong>low cost</strong> open-access model to support global researchers:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWithout DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br>\r\nWith DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li><strong>International Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWith DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis affordable fee structure makes INDJCST a preferred <strong>smart city IoT journal with fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> support in the field of computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00897B; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📊 Author Dashboard with real-time tracking</li>\r\n<li>📄 Automated Acceptance Letters</li>\r\n<li>📥 Easy Certificate & Paper Downloads</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Secure and Transparent Workflow</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript today to a trusted <strong>smart city IoT journal with fast publication</strong> that ensures visibility through <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines, and provides <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong> in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(320,'2026-02-25 07:38:03','2026-02-25 07:38:03','tags/5KuMEJsJkVIH5OzWJXVOlUZ5iasabAIlgccdKmdV.jpg','IoT and AI Journal with Fast Publication – INDJCST','Tag','iot-and-ai-journal-with-fast-publication-indjcst','IoT and AI Journal with Fast Publication – INDJCST','Publish in an IoT and AI journal with fast publication. Low cost, UGC CARE, Google Scholar indexed, rapid peer review in computer science.','IoT and AI Journal with Fast Publication – INDJCST','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">IoT and AI Journal with Fast Publication</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a trusted <strong>IoT and AI journal with fast publication</strong>, committed to publishing high-quality research across all domains of <strong>computer science</strong>. Published three times a year, INDJCST provides a <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong> platform for academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAligned with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, INDJCST ensures strong academic credibility and global visibility. As a peer-reviewed refereed journal, we maintain rigorous standards while offering authors an efficient and transparent <strong>fast publication</strong> process.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Scope in Computer Science, IoT & AI</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nAs a leading <strong>IoT and AI journal with fast publication</strong>, INDJCST covers emerging research areas including:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🟣 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>🟣 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🟣 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWe encourage interdisciplinary research demonstrating practical AI and IoT applications for smart systems, industries, healthcare, and urban technologies. Every paper undergoes a strict peer-review process to ensure academic integrity and research excellence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Why Choose This IoT and AI Journal with Fast Publication?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>⚡ <strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> – Decision within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>🚀 <strong>Fast / Rapid Publication</strong> workflow</li>\r\n<li>💰 <strong>Low Cost</strong> article processing charges</li>\r\n<li>📚 Follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> & global databases</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Strict Plagiarism Screening</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Immediate Open Access Policy</li>\r\n<li>📜 COPE Best Practice Publication Ethics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST balances <strong>rapid publication</strong> with quality review, making it a preferred destination for researchers seeking a reliable <strong>IoT and AI journal with fast publication</strong> in the field of computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 High Visibility & Indexing</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nTo enhance citation and discoverability, the journal is indexed and abstracted in:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>SSRN</li>\r\n<li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>DRJI</li>\r\n<li>EuroPub</li>\r\n<li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n<li>PlumX</li>\r\n<li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Streamlined & Transparent Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📩 Submit Online – 24/7 editorial system</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📢 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Instant PDF Publication & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur structured system ensures that authors experience true <strong>fast publication</strong> and transparent tracking from submission to final publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E53935; margin-top:25px;\">🔴 Article Processing Charges – Low Cost Model</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nAs an open-access <strong>IoT and AI journal with fast publication</strong>, INDJCST maintains affordable fees:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWithout DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br>\r\nWith DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li><strong>International Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWith DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis <strong>low cost</strong> structure supports global researchers while ensuring <strong>rapid publication</strong> and high editorial standards in computer science research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00897B; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📊 Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n<li>📈 Real-time Paper Tracking</li>\r\n<li>📄 Automated Acceptance & Copyright Documents</li>\r\n<li>📥 Easy Download of Certificates & Published Papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nChoose INDJCST — a trusted <strong>IoT and AI journal with fast publication</strong>, indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, aligned with <strong>UGC CARE</strong>, and offering <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong> in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(321,'2026-02-25 07:38:16','2026-02-25 07:38:16','tag