h citation growth and academic credibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">🤖 Scope in Artificial Intelligence & Computer Science</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal covers a broad range of topics related to Computer Science and emerging technologies, including:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🖱️ Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔌 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧮 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST welcomes interdisciplinary research and encourages submissions demonstrating practical applications of computing technologies. All papers undergo a rigorous peer-review process, strengthening citation value and supporting positive <strong>Artificial Intelligence journal impact factor</strong> growth over time.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🚀 Why Choose INDJCST?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>⚡ Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Editorial decisions within 3 days ensure genuine <strong>fast publication</strong> without compromising quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🌍 Open Access Policy:</strong> Immediate accessibility enhances citation reach through <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and global databases.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost Publishing:</strong> Affordable processing fees make quality research dissemination accessible.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🛡️ Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Strict screening maintains academic integrity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 UGC CARE & COPE Compliance:</strong> Ethical publishing aligned with recognized academic standards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese features collectively contribute to sustained visibility and improved citation performance, influencing overall <strong>Artificial Intelligence journal impact factor</strong> positioning.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">📊 INDJCST Features</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📘 Peer-reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Easy, fast, transparent paper publication process</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Strict Plagiarism Policy</li>\r\n<li>📈 High Visibility & Indexing</li>\r\n<li>📜 Publication Ethics: COPE’s Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n<li>📄 Creative Commons BY-NC-ND License</li>\r\n<li>📊 Good Impact Factor Potential</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🏫 Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n<li>🚀 Rapid / Fast Track Publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔎 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔍 Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>📘 Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>📖 SSRN</li>\r\n<li>🌐 WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>📊 Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>📈 PlumX</li>\r\n<li>📚 ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>📄 Scribd & ISSUU</li>\r\n<li>📂 DRJI, I2OR, EuroPub, Academic Keys</li>\r\n<li>🏛️ Exlibris (Clarivate) & Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">