l Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Cybersecurity and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🟣 Embedded Systems and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Computer Networks and Communication Systems</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal encourages research that demonstrates real-world applications of wireless sensor networks in smart cities, healthcare, agriculture, environmental monitoring, and industrial automation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Why Choose This Wireless Sensor Networks Journal?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>⚡ <strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> – Editorial decision within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>🚀 <strong>Fast Publication</strong> & transparent workflow</li>\r\n<li>💰 <strong>Low Cost</strong> article processing charges</li>\r\n<li>📚 Strict adherence to <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and international databases</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Strong plagiarism screening policy</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Immediate open-access availability</li>\r\n<li>📜 Publication ethics following COPE Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST combines <strong>rapid publication</strong> efficiency with strong peer-review integrity, making it a preferred <strong>wireless sensor networks journal</strong> in the field of computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 Indexing & High Visibility</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>SSRN</li>\r\n<li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>DRJI</li>\r\n<li>EuroPub</li>\r\n<li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n<li>PlumX</li>\r\n<li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Streamlined & Author-Friendly Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📩 24/7 Online Submission System</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response within 12 Hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Expert Peer Review within 2 Days</li>\r\n<li>📢 Decision Notification within 3 Days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Instant PDF Publication & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur structured system ensures genuine <strong>fast publication</strong> and a smooth experience from submission to final publication.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E53935; margin-top:25px;\">🔴 Article Processing Charges – Low Cost Model</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nINDJCST maintains an affordable open-access fee structure:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWithout DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br>\r\nWith DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li><strong>International Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWith DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis <strong>low cost</strong> model ensures accessibility for global researchers while maintaining high academic quality and <strong>rapid publication</strong> standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00897B; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📊 Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n<li>📈 Real-time Manuscript Tracking</li>\r\n<li>📄 Automated Acceptance Letters</li>\r\n<li>📥 Easy Download of Certificates & Papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to a trusted <strong>wireless sensor networks journal</strong> that offers <strong>fast publication</strong