lated to <strong>machine learning journal publication</strong> in areas such as:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🟣 Supervised and Unsupervised Learning</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Deep Learning and Neural Networks</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Reinforcement Learning</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Data Mining and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🟣 AI-driven Cybersecurity</li>\r\n<li>🟢 IoT and Edge Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Cloud-based Machine Learning Systems</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Explainable AI (XAI)</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Intelligent Automation and Robotics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWe encourage interdisciplinary research demonstrating real-world machine learning applications in healthcare, finance, smart cities, industry, and advanced computing systems.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Why Choose INDJCST for Machine Learning Journal Publication?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>⚡ <strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> – Editorial decision within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>🚀 Structured <strong>Fast Publication</strong> workflow</li>\r\n<li>💰 Affordable <strong>Low Cost</strong> APC model</li>\r\n<li>📚 Compliance with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> & global databases</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Strict plagiarism detection system</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Immediate Open Access visibility</li>\r\n<li>📜 COPE Best Practice publication ethics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST combines <strong>rapid publication</strong> efficiency with strong peer-review quality, making it a preferred destination for <strong>machine learning journal publication</strong> in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 Indexing & Academic Visibility</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Google Scholar</li>\