JCST Relates to Impact and Fast Publication</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhile not every journal publishes an official impact factor, INDJCST enhances research visibility and citation potential through:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📍 Indexing in **Google Scholar** for broad discoverability</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Fast publication** with rapid peer review and structured workflows</li>\r\n<li>📜 Ethical standards under **UGC CARE** and COPE Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n<li>💰 **Low cost** article processing charges for global authors</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Rigorous peer review to maintain academic integrity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis blend of citation reach and streamlined publication makes INDJCST a strong choice for researchers seeking impactful dissemination of their work without undue delays.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">💻 Disciplines Covered in Computer Science</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain & Distributed Systems</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Database & Information Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nInterdisciplinary contributions and practical application research are encouraged, providing broader citation opportunities and academic engagement.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚡ Fast & Transparent Publication Proc