 <strong>computer science</strong>. Published three times a year, INDJCST offers a <strong>low cost</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong> model designed to support researchers seeking timely and globally visible academic dissemination.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal strictly follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and is indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, ensuring strong academic credibility, citation visibility, and international reach. Every manuscript undergoes a rigorous peer-review process to maintain research integrity and scholarly excellence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Research Areas in Big Data & Analytics</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nAs a trusted <strong>big data analytics journal with fast publication</strong>, INDJCST welcomes innovative research in:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🟣 Big Data Processing Frameworks</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Data Mining and Predictive Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Machine Learning for Big Data</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Real-Time Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Cloud-based Big Data Systems</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Distributed Computing and Hadoop/Spark</li>\r\n<li>🟣 Data Visualization and Business Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🟢 IoT Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🔵 AI-driven Data Modeling</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Data Security and Privacy in Big Data</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Statistical Analysis and Optimization</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Intelligent Decision Support Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal encourages interdisciplinary research demonstrating real-world applications of big data analytics in healthcare, finance, smart cities, e-governance, cybersecurity, and industrial automation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Why Choose This Big Data Analytics Journal?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>⚡ <strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> – Editorial decision within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>🚀 Structured <strong>Fast Publication</strong> workflow</li>\r\n<li>💰 Affordable <strong>Low Cost</strong> article processing charges</li>\r\n<li>📚 Strict compliance with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> & global databases</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Strong plagiarism detection system</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Immediate Open Access visibility</li>\r\n<li>📜 Publication ethics aligned with COPE Best Practices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST ensures a balance between <strong>rapid publication</strong> efficiency and rigorous peer-review quality, making it a preferred <strong>big data analytics journal with fast publication</strong> in computer science research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 Indexing & Academic Visibility</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>SSRN</li>\r\n<li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>DRJI</li>\r\n<li>EuroPub</li>\r\n<li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n<li>PlumX</li>\r\n<li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Streamlined & Transparent Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📩 24/7 Online Manuscript Submission</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response within 12 Hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Expert Peer Review within 2 Days</li>\r\n<li>📢 Acceptance/Rejection within 3 Days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Instant PDF Publication & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur efficient editorial workflow guarantees genuine <strong>fast publication</strong> and continuous author support throughout the review cycle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E53935; margin-top:25px;\">🔴 Article Processing Charges – Low Cost Model</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nINDJCST maintains a transparent and <strong>low cost</strong> open-access APC structure:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWithout DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br>\r\nWith DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li><strong>International Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWith DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis affordable APC model supports global researchers while maintaining strong editorial standards and <strong>rapid publication</strong> in big data analytics and computer science research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to a trusted <strong>big data analytics journal with fast publication</strong> offering <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, and a <strong>low cost</strong> open-access model in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(347,'2026-02-25 08:02:34','2026-02-25 08:02:34','tags/ELBMV7ePIeoyuAupYse5NdLQjH3KlvQ5ECH3lV9V.jpg','IEEE Computer Science Journals – Top Ranked Publications','Tag','ieee-computer-science-journals-top-ranked-publications','IEEE Computer Science Journals – Top Ranked Publications','Explore IEEE computer science journals with high impact factor, global indexing, peer review standards and leading research visibility.','IEEE Computer Science Journals – Top Ranked Publications','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\"> <h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">🧠 IEEE Computer Science Journals – Leading Research Publications</h1> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> The **Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE)** publishes a wide range of prestigious journals in computing and related areas through its IEEE Computer Society and collaborating technical societies. These peer-reviewed publications cover theory, systems, networks, AI, machine learning, data science, and more — many with significant citation impact and global recognition. :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0} </p> <hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\"> <h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">📚 Notable IEEE Computer Science Journals</h2> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> <li><strong>IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence</strong> – One of the top journals in AI and computer vision. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}</li> <li><strong>IEEE Transactions on Computers</strong> – Covers all aspects of computer design and architecture. :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}</li> <li><strong>IEEE Access</strong> – Broad open-access journal spanning all computing and engineering topics. :contentReference[oaicite:3]{index=3}</li> <li><strong>IEEE Internet of Things Journal</strong> – Focuses on IoT systems, communications, and applications. :contentReference[oaicite:4]{index=4}</li> <li><strong>IEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems</strong> – AI, neural computation and learning. :contentReference[oaicite:5]{index=5}</li> <li><strong>IEEE Transactions on Image Processing</strong> – Image/video signal processing and analysis. :contentReference[oaicite:6]{index=6}</li> <li><strong>IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering</strong> – Data mining, big data, and knowledge systems. :contentReference[oaicite:7]{index=7}</li> <li><strong>IEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation</strong> – Computational intelligence and evolutionary algorithms. :contentReference[oaicite:8]{index=8}</li> <li><strong>IEEE Communications Surveys & Tutorials</strong> – High-impact overview articles in communications and computing. :contentReference[oaicite:9]{index=9}</li> <li><strong>IEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing</strong> – Security, safety, and reliability in computing systems. :contentReference[oaicite:10]{index=10}</li> </ul> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> In addition to these, there are many other IEEE titles relevant to computing — covering human-computer interaction, networks, control systems, multimedia, cloud computing, and interdisciplinary areas. :contentReference[oaicite:11]{index=11} </p> <hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\"> <h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🌍 Why IEEE Journals Matter in Computer Science</h2> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> <li>📜 **Peer-reviewed quality:** Rigorous review standards ensure scientific rigor. :contentReference[oaicite:12]{index=12}</li> <li>🌏 **Global visibility:** Widely indexed and cited across research databases like Web of Science, Scopus, and Google Scholar. :contentReference[oaicite:13]{index=13}</li> <li>📈 **Impact and reputation:** Many IEEE journals rank high in citation metrics and academic influence. :contentReference[oaicite:14]{index=14}</li> <li>⚙️ **Broad subject coverage:** From core computing and hardware to AI, big data, security, and IoT. :contentReference[oaicite:15]{index=15}</li> <li>🔍 **Open access options:** Some journals like IEEE Access and IEEE Open Journal of the Computer Society provide open publication models. :contentReference[oaicite:16]{index=16}</li> </ul> <hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\"> <h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">🧠 Top IEEE Publications to Explore Further</h2> <ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> <li>📄 IEEE Transactions on Software Engineering</li> <li>📄 IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence</li> <li>📄 IEEE Internet of Things Journal</li> <li>📄 IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering</li> <li>📄 IEEE Transactions on Cloud Computing</li> <li>📄 IEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems</li> <li>📄 IEEE Communications Surveys & Tutorials</li> <li>📄 IEEE Transactions on Image Processing</li> <li>📄 IEEE Transactions on Networking</li> <li>📄 IEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing</li> </ul> <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\"> These journals represent some of the most respected venues in their respective areas of computer science — from AI and networks to systems and security — making them excellent choices for high-quality research publication. :contentReference[oaicite:17]{index=17} </p> </div> ::contentReference[oaicite:18]{index=18}'),(348,'2026-02-25 08:03:56','2026-02-25 08:03:56','tags/MoP6uOWmNKXZgmNIaSQzs8yzmt3K8q0H2DcJW3t8.jpg','ACM Journals List with Fast Publication in CS','Tag','acm-journals-list-with-fast-publication-in-cs','ACM Journals List with Fast Publication in CS','ACM journals list with fast publication, low cost options, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexed computer science research platform.','ACM Journals List with Fast Publication in CS','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">📚 ACM Journals List with Fast Publication – Computer Science Guide</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nResearchers exploring the <strong>ACM journals list with fast publication</strong> often seek journals that combine credibility, strong indexing, and efficient peer review. While ACM journals are globally respected in <strong>computer science</strong>, many authors also prioritize <strong>rapid publication</strong>, <strong>low cost</strong> processing fees, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and visibility in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research across all domains of computer science. Published three times a year, INDJCST provides a reliable platform for academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals seeking structured review and <strong>fast publication</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFor authors comparing options within the <strong>ACM journals list with fast publication</strong>, INDJCST offers a streamlined editorial workflow, ethical publishing standards, and strong indexing support including <strong>Google Scholar</strong>. The journal strictly follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and maintains a transparent peer-review process.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">💻 Scope of Computer Science Research</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🖱️ Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔌 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧮 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST encourages interdisciplinary research demonstrating practical computing applications. All submissions undergo a rigorous peer-review process to ensure academic integrity and high scholarly standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🚀 Why Choose INDJCST?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>⚡ Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decisions within 3 days support genuine <strong>fast publication</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🌍 Open Access:</strong> Immediate global visibility through <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable fees for Indian and international authors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🛡️ Strict Plagiarism Policy:</strong> Ensuring research originality and credibility.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 UGC CARE & COPE Compliance:</strong> Ethical standards aligned with international best practices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese features make INDJCST a strong alternative for researchers reviewing the <strong>ACM journals list with fast publication</strong> while seeking speed, affordability, and visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">📊 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>📘 Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>📖 SSRN</li>\r\n<li>🌐 WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>📊 Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>📈 PlumX</li>\r\n<li>📚 ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>📄 Scribd & ISSUU</li>\r\n<li>📂 DRJI, I2OR, EuroPub, Academic Keys</li>\r\n<li>🏛️ Exlibris (Clarivate) & Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚙️ Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 access</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis transparent workflow ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> without compromising peer-review quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;