ess:</strong> Immediate online availability enhances visibility in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable processing fees for Indian and international authors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🛡️ Strict Plagiarism Screening:</strong> Ensures originality and research integrity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 Ethical Standards:</strong> Compliance with COPE Best Practice Guidelines and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> norms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese features make it a strong choice for authors seeking <strong>rapid publication</strong> without compromising academic quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">💻 Areas of Computer Science Covered</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🖱️ Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔌 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧮 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nInterdisciplinary submissions demonstrating practical and applied computing research are strongly encouraged.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">📊 Indexing & Abstracting</