 Modeling and Forecasting</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Business Intelligence and Visualization</li>\r\n<li>🟣 Cloud-based Big Data Systems</li>\r\n<li>🟢 IoT Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🔵 AI-driven Data Modeling</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Data Privacy and Security</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Distributed Computing and Scalable Systems</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Intelligent Decision Support Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal encourages interdisciplinary research demonstrating practical big data analytics applications in healthcare, finance, smart cities, cybersecurity, governance, and industrial automation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Why Choose One of the Best Big Data and Analytics Journals?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📌 DOI assigned to every accepted paper</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> & international databases</li>\r\n<li>⚡ <strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong> – Decision within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>🚀 Structured <strong>Fast Publication</strong> workflow</li>\r\n<li>💰 Transparent <strong>Low Cost</strong> article processing charges</li>\r\n<li>📚 Strict compliance with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Strong plagiarism detection system</li>\r\n<li>📜 Publication ethics aligned with COPE Best Practices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST ensures a balance between <strong>rapid publication</strong> efficiency and rigorous peer-review integrity, making it a preferred choice among the <strong>best big data and analytics journals with DOI and indexing</strong> in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 Indexing & Abstracting Services</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n<li>Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>SSRN</li>\r\n<li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>DRJI</li>\r\n<li>EuroPub</li>\r\n<li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n<li>PlumX</li>\r\n<li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📩 24/7 Online Submission System</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response within 12 Hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Expert Peer Review within 2 Days</li>\r\n<li>📢 Acceptance/Rejection within 3 Days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Instant PDF Publication, DOI & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOur efficient editorial system guarantees genuine <strong>fast publication</strong> and continuous author support throughout the review cycle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E53935; margin-top:25px;\">🔴 Article Processing Charges – Affordable Model</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nINDJCST maintains a transparent and <strong>low cost</strong> APC structure:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWithout DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST<br>\r\nWith DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li><strong>International Authors:</strong><br>\r\nWith DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis affordable model supports global researchers while ensuring strong editorial standards and <strong>rapid publication</strong> in big data and analytics research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to one of the <strong>best big data and analytics journals with DOI and indexing</strong>, offering <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, DOI assignment, and a cost-effective open-access model in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(361,'2026-02-25 08:14:26','2026-02-25 08:14:26','tags/ykUPEWCm82gNlShL4DztGr6ZjZlRjOk12W0PqZ3g.jpg','How to Publish Data Science Research in Indexed Journals','Tag','how-to-publish-data-science-research-in-indexed-journals','How to Publish Data Science Research in Indexed Journals','Learn how to publish data science research in indexed journals with DOI, fast publication, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing.','How to Publish Data Science Research in Indexed Journals','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">How to Publish Data Science Research in Indexed Journals</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing <strong>data science research in indexed journals</strong> requires a strategic approach, strong methodology, and selecting the right journal. Choosing a journal that offers <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>low cost</strong> article processing charges, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, and <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing increases both credibility and visibility of your research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Step 1: Select the Right Indexed Journal</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nChoose a reputable journal in <strong>computer science</strong> or <strong>data science</strong> that:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔍 Is indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and international databases</li>\r\n<li>📚 Follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines</li>\r\n<li>📌 Assigns DOI to accepted papers</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Offers <strong>rapid publication</strong> timelines</li>\r\n<li>💰 Provides a transparent <strong>low cost</strong> APC structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nVerifying indexing claims and publication ethics is essential before submission.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Step 2: Prepare a High-Quality Manuscript</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\nYour data science research paper should include:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🟣 Clear problem statement and objectives</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Literature review of recent indexed journal articles</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Strong methodology and dataset explanation</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Experimental results with performance metrics</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Comparative analysis and validation</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Practical applications and future scope</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nEnsure originality by using plagiarism checking tools before submission.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 Step 3: Follow Author Guidelines Carefully</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nIndexed journals require strict formatting, citation styles, and structured abstracts. Carefully follow:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📄 Manuscript formatting guidelines</li>\r\n<li>📑 Reference and citation standards</li>\r\n<li>📊 Figure and table specifications</li>\r\n<li>📝 Ethical declarations and copyright forms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nProper formatting improves acceptance chances and speeds up the <strong>fast publication</strong> process.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Step 4: Submit Through the Online System</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nMost indexed journals provide 24/7 online submission systems. After submission:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>⏳ Receive acknowledgment within 12–24 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Manuscript enters peer-review process</li>\r\n<li>📢 Decision notification within a few days (in rapid publication models)</li>\r\n<li>📌 DOI assigned after acceptance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nChoosing journals that offer <strong>rapid publication</strong> helps researchers publish quickly without compromising review quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E53935; margin-top:25px;\">🔴 Step 5: Respond to Reviewer Comments Professionally</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nCarefully address reviewer suggestions with clear explanations. Timely revisions improve acceptance probability and maintain professional academic standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Benefits of Publishing in Indexed Data Science Journals</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🌍 Global visibility through <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing</li>\r\n<li>📚 Academic credibility with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance</li>\r\n<li>📌 Permanent DOI for citation tracking</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Faster dissemination through <strong>fast publication</strong> models</li>\r\n<li>💰 Affordable research dissemination via <strong>low cost</strong> APC</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing your data science research in properly indexed journals enhances academic recognition, research impact, and professional growth.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Data Science Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to a reputable indexed journal offering <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, and a <strong>low cost</strong> open-access model in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(362,'2026-02-25 08:15:11','2026-02-25 08:15:11','tags/DcJlt6x2PK4kubNLhSRC3mSsTZiAHtCgG3at0I0E.jpg','Fast Publication Computer Science Engineering Journals List','Tag','fast-publication-computer-science-engineering-journals-list','Fast Publication Computer Science Engineering Journals List','Explore fas