-access journal published from India that offers affordable publication options without compromising research quality. INDJCST serves as an ideal platform for academicians, students, researchers, and industry professionals to publish their work with strong global visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nKnown for supporting **low cost computer science publication in India**, this journal combines rigorous peer review with a streamlined process to help authors disseminate their findings efficiently and effectively.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">📚 Areas Covered in Computer Science</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼 Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓ Blockchain & Distributed Systems</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔌 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal also welcomes interdisciplinary research and applied computing studies that showcase practical impacts in engineering, industry, and society.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🚀 Why Choose This Low Cost Publication?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>💰 **Low Cost Article Processing:** Affordable fees support researchers with limited budgets.</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Fast Publication:** Efficient review processes speed up research dissemination.</li>\r\n<li>📜 **UGC CARE Compliance:** Ethical publishing aligned with recognized standards.</li>\r\n<li>🔎 **Google Scholar Indexing:** Visibility in widely used academic search platforms.</li>\r\n<li>🌍 **Open Access:** Wider access to research without paywalls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚡ Publication Process Overview</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 submission system</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Acknowledgment – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Peer Review – Completed in 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant access with DOI</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis fast workflow supports timely visibility and global recognition for your computer science research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">💲 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Other than Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese **low cost** publishing options make quality research publication accessible for authors in India and abroad.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">📬 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to a trusted platform for **low cost computer science publication in India** that emphasizes quality, visibility, and rapid dissemination.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journ