* APCs that support affordability</li>\r\n<li>🌍 **Open access** — research freely available to readers worldwide</li>\r\n<li>📚 Indexed in **Google Scholar** and other academic databases</li>\r\n<li>🔐 DOI assigned for all accepted papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese features help researchers achieve timely recognition, enhanced visibility, and broader engagement from the academic community.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Key Research Areas Covered</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🟣 Machine Learning & Predictive Modeling</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Big Data Analytics & Visualization</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Data Mining & Knowledge Discovery</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Statistical Modeling & Optimization</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Natural Language Processing & Text Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Deep Learning for Data Science</li>\r\n<li>🟣 Cloud-based Data Science Platforms</li>\r\n<li>🟢 IoT Data Analytics & Smart Systems</li>\r\n<li>🔵 AI-Driven Analytics Applications</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Business Intelligence & Decision Support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nOpen access data science journals often span multiple interdisciplinary domains, giving researchers a broader platform for publication and collaboration.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 How to Choose the Right Journal</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔍 Verify indexing in **Google Scholar** and recognized databases</li>\r\n<li>📌 Confirm the journal follows peer-review best practices</li>\r\n<li>📄 Look for clear **rapid review** and **fast publication** timelines</li>\r\n<li>💰 Assess APC transparency and **low cost** options</li>\r\n<li>📜 Ensure compliance with ethics guidelines like COPE and UGC CARE</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nCareful selection helps avoid predatory outlets and ensures your research is published in reputable venues that align with your academic goals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h