puting</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain & Distributed Systems</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔌 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal also encourages interdisciplinary research that bridges computing technologies with practical applications across industries and society.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🚀 Why Choose This Low Cost Computer Science Journal?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>💰 **Low Cost Article Processing:** Affordable fees help reduce financial barriers for authors in India and beyond.</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Fast Publication:** Efficient review ensures timely publication of high-quality research.</li>\r\n<li>📍 **Google Scholar Indexing:** Enhanced discoverability across global research platforms.</li>\r\n<li>📜 **UGC CARE Compliance:** Ethical publishing under recognized guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ **Plagiarism Screening:** Rigorous integrity checks ensure originality.</li>\r\n<li>🌍 **Open Access:** Free access for readers increases reach and citation potential.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚡ Publication Process Overview</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 submission portal</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Peer Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis streamlined process ensures your work is evaluated quickly and published efficiently — a key feature for a **fast publication** journal.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">💲 Article Pro