mbination of visibility, rapid publication, and academic credibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📚 Publishes research across AI, data mining, predictive analytics and related fields</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in **Google Scholar** and other global scholarly databases</li>\r\n<li>📌 Assigns DOI to all accepted articles</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Supports **fast publication** timelines</li>\r\n<li>💰 Transparent and **low cost** APC structure</li>\r\n<li>📜 Compliant with **UGC CARE** and COPE ethical practices</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Open access to maximize reach and citations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 How to Choose the Right Journal</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Verify indexing such as **Google Scholar**, Scopus, or Web of Science</li>\r\n<li>📄 Confirm DOI assignment and citation tracking</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Review journal’s average **fast publication** time</li>\r\n<li>💰 Check article processing charges and **low cost** options</li>\r\n<li>📘 Evaluate recent published articles for relevance and quality</li>\r\n<li>📜 Ensure ethical compliance like UGC CARE and COPE standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSelecting reputable journals with these features ensures your research receives high visibility, strong academic recognition, and impactful citations within the global research community.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to one of the **best journals for AI, data mining and predictive analytics research** that offer **fast publication**, **UGC CARE** compliance, **Google Scholar** indexing, and a transparent, **low cost** open-access model in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(369,'2026-02-25 08:20:12','2026-02-25 08:20:12','tags/IQPwejct3GK8ucNS5TpDcD6OwATyFc6mlZSv0bcy.jpg','Low APC Data Science Research Journals – Fast Publication','Tag','low-apc-data-science-research-journals-fast-publication','Low APC Data Science Research Journals – Fast Publication','Find low APC data science research journals offering fast publication, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing for high visibility.','Low APC Data Science Research Journals – Fast Publication','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Low APC Data Science Research Journals</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFor researchers in data science, publishing in **low APC data science research journals** can significantly reduce financial barriers while still offering **fast publication**, strong indexing, and academic credibility. Journals with low article processing charges (APCs) help disseminate high-quality research without compromising visibility or impact in the scholarly community.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a notable example of a **low APC data science research journal**. With a transparent fee structure, rapid publication processes, and indexing in major platforms, INDJCST supports data science research across engineering, analytics, machine learning, and intelligent systems.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Advantages of Low APC Journals</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>💰 Affordable publication fees with low APC</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Fast publication** timelines for timely research dissemination</li>\r\n<li>📚 Compliance with **UGC CARE** and ethical review standards</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in **Google Scholar** and global scholarly databases</li>\r\n<li>📌 DOI assigned for enhanced citation tracking</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Open access for maximum visibility</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Robust peer-review processes for quality assurance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nChoosing journals that balance cost, speed, and credibility ensures that your data science research reaches a wide audience without financial strain.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Popular Research Areas Covered</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🟣 Data Mining & Knowledge Discovery</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Machine Learning & Predictive Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Big Data Analytics & Visualization</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Statistical Learning & Optimization</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Deep Learning for Data Analysis</li>\r\n<li>🟣 IoT Analytics & Smart Data Systems</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Cloud-based Analytics Platforms</li>\r\n<li>🔵 AI-driven Data Science Methods</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Intelligent Decision Support Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese interdisciplinary domains represent key areas where data science research continues to evolve and make impactful contributions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 How to Choose Low APC Journals</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔍 Verify indexing in **Google Scholar** and established databases</li>\r\n<li>📜 Confirm DOI assignment for published articles</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Look for documented **fast publication** timelines</li>\r\n<li>📄 Evaluate peer review and ethical compliance (e.g., UGC CARE, COPE)</li>\r\n<li>💰 Compare APC structures to find truly low cost options</li>\r\n<li>📘 Check recent publications for quality and relevance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nCareful selection helps you avoid predatory journals and ensures your work gains academic recognition and credibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Example: INDJCST – Low APC & Indexed</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> is one of the noteworthy **low APC data science research journals**:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>💰 Affordable APC structure</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Fast publication** and **rapid review**</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in **Google Scholar** and international databases</li>\r\n<li>📌 DOI assigned for all accepted articles</li>\r\n<li>📚 Compliance with **UGC CARE** and ethical guidelines</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Open access for broad scholarly reach</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing in journals with these characteristics helps boost your academic profile while maintaining cost-effectiveness.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Data Science Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to a **low APC data science research journal** offering **fast publication**, **UGC CARE** compliance, **Google Scholar** indexing, and a credible open-access publication model in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(370,'2026-02-25 08:20:35','2026-02-25 08:20:35','tags/FdiCsDDwpMOg2LMLk7zCJfOw2YYBoK0mr1MJsUWB.jpg','Free Publication Computer Science Journal Options','Tag','free-publication-computer-science-journal-options','Free Publication Computer Science Journal Options','Find free publication computer science journal options with fast publication, UGC CARE compliance, Google Scholar indexing and ethical peer review.','Free Publication Computer Science Journal Options','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">📘 Free Publication Computer Science Journal</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFor researchers and students looking to publish without paying article processing charges, a **free publication computer science journal** offers a cost-effective way to share findings with the global community. Ideal journals in this category combine ethical peer review with broad visibility through indexing like **Google Scholar** and may also emphasize features such as **fast publication** and **rapid publication** timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhile fully free publication options are limited, many reputable journals—including those that support **low cost publication**—ensure accessibility for authors. The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> is one example of a computer science journal that offers very affordable fees and strong academic standards, though not completely free for all types of articles. For truly free publishing, some open-access venues waive fees for authors under specific programs or grant support.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nBefore selecting a **free publication computer science journal**, consider the peer review process, indexing platforms like **Google Scholar**, ethical standards such as **UGC CARE** compliance, and whether a rapid turnaround time aligns with your publication needs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">📍 What to Look for in Free CS Journals</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>💬 **No Article Processing Fees:** Zero cost for submission and publication.</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Efficient Peer Review:** Timely decisions support fast or rapid publication.</li>\r\n<li>🔍 **Strong Indexing:** Inclusion in Google Scholar and other discovery platforms.</li>\r\n<li>📜 **Ethical Standards:** Adherence to publication ethics like UGC CARE or COPE guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>📚 **Academic Quality:** Robust peer review ensures scholarly value.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nBalancing cost-free publishing with academic rigor is key to maximizing impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔥 Alternatives to Completely Free Options</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSome journals that charge minimal fees or waive charges under special circumstances can act as effective alternatives to purely free publication. Journals such as the <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> offer low cost publishing with broad indexing and ethical review, making them a strong platform for authors seeking accessible publication options in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🌍 Broad indexing via Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Fast / Rapid Publication Process</li>\r\n<li>📜 UGC CARE & COPE compliant review standards</li>\r\n<li>💰 Low or waived processing fees under grants or waivers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">📊 Topics Covered in CS Journals</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science & Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering & Programming</li>\r\n<li>📡 Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image & Vision Processing</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain & Distributed Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese topics represent key areas where both free and low-cost computer science journals publish high-quality research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">📬 Ready to Publish?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhile completely free publication options may be limited, consider journals that provide ethical review, strong indexing, and minimal or waived fees for authors seeking accessible publication paths in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1e88e5; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">\r\n👉 Submit Your Research Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(371,'2026-02-25 08:21:19','2026-02-25 08:21:19','tags/VQO3FiKPeAYLhwOmGpWADcyPk6aOVO6cnKgowN0r.jpg','Complete Guide to Publishing Data Science Papers in 2026','Tag','complete-guide-to-publishing-data-science-papers-in-2026','Complete Guide to Publishing Data Science Papers in 2026','Step-by-step guide to publishing data science papers in 2026 with fast review, indexing, DOI, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar visibility.','Complete Guide to Publishing Data Science Papers in 2026','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Complete Guide to Publishing Data Science Papers in 2026</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing **data science papers in 2026** involves understanding modern journal expectations, strong research practices, and strategic submission choices. This guide walks you through proven steps to publish with **fast publication** timelines, **indexed journals**, **UGC CARE** compliance, **Google Scholar indexing**, and DOI assignment.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Step 1: Choose the Right Research Topic</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPick a current and impactful topic in areas such as **machine learning**, **big data analytics**, **predictive modeling**, **AI-driven systems**, **data mining**, **deep learning**, or **IoT analytics**. Your topic should:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Address real-world problems with measurable results</li>\r\n<li>Have clear objectives and defined hypotheses</li>\r\n<li>Build on a recent literature review of indexed journal articles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nStrong topic selection increases your chances of acceptance in quality journals and enhances your research contribution.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Step 2: Plan and Conduct High-Quality Research</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nDesign your methodology carefully and follow rigorous experimental practices. Include:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Clear problem formulation and data description</li>\r\n<li>Justification of methods and algorithms used</li>\r\n<li>Comparative analysis against benchmark datasets</li>\r\n<li>Visualizations and performance metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWell-structured research with solid results is more likely to pass peer review quickly and be accepted for **fast publication**.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 Step 3: Select a Suitable Indexed Journal</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nChoose a journal that offers:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📍 **Google Scholar** and reputable database indexing</li>\r\n<li>📌 DOI assignment for published articles</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Short peer-review turnaround for **rapid publication**</li>\r\n<li>💰 Transparent and **low cost** APC structure</li>\r\n<li>📚 Compliance with **UGC CARE** and publication ethics</li>\r\n<li>🌍 International visibility and open access where possible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nExamples include trusted academic journals in data science and computer science that meet these criteria.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Step 4: Prepare Your Manuscript Carefully</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFollow the journal’s author guidelines precisely. Ensure your manuscript includes:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Structured abstract with clear contributions</li>\r\n<li>Well-organized sections (Introduction, Related Work, Methods, Results, Discussion)</li>\r\n<li>Accurate references and citation style</li>\r\n<li>Figures and tables that support your findings</li>\r\n<li>Ethical declarations and compliance statements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nProper formatting reduces revision cycles and boosts your chances of fast acceptance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Step 5: Submit Through the Journal System</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nMost journals use online submission systems. After uploading:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>⏳ Expect an initial acknowledgment within 12–24 hours</li>\r\n<li>🧑‍⚖️ Peer review typically completes within days for rapid tracks</li>\r\n<li>📢 Receive reviewer feedback and decision quickly</li>\r\n<li>📌 DOI is assigned post-acceptance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nChoosing journals with documented **fast publication** and rapid review helps minimize waiting time.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E53935; margin-top:25px;\">🔴 Step 6: Respond to Reviewer Feedback</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nRespond professionally to reviewer comments with clear revisions. Address all points diligently and resubmit promptly to keep the review cycle moving.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Step 7: Final Acceptance and Publication</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAfter acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Your article receives DOI for permanent referencing</li>\r\n<li>It appears in indexed databases such as **Google Scholar**</li>\r\n<li>It becomes part of the journal issue or online early access</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis enhances global discoverability and citation potential for your work.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Tips for Success in 2026</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>Use plagiarism checks before submission</li>\r\n<li>Align research with trending data science themes</li>\r\n<li>Choose journals that balance speed, quality, and cost</li>\r\n<li>Ensure ethical compliance and data transparency</li>\r\n<li>Engage with related research communities for feedback</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFollowing these best practices helps you publish your **data science papers in 2026** with high visibility, strong indexing, efficient timelines, and meaningful academic impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Data Science Paper?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(372,'2026-02-25 08:22:07','2026-02-25 08:22:07','tags/2shGAFiQD5VRXXpL5ngED7xnACfI9QU0a9zG5Y03.jpg','Open Access CS Journal with Low APC & Fast Publication','Tag','open-access-cs-journal-with-low-apc-fast-publication','Open Access CS Journal with Low APC & Fast Publication','Open access CS journal low APC with fast publication, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing for computer science research.','Open Access CS Journal with Low APC & Fast Publication','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">🌍 Open Access CS Journal Low APC – Fast & Affordable Publishing</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nResearchers searching for an <strong>Open access CS journal low APC</strong> prioritize affordability, visibility, and ethical publishing standards. An ideal <strong>computer science</strong> journal should combine <strong>low cost</strong> article processing charges, <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong> timelines, compliance with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines, and indexing in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> for maximum research reach.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST provides a reliable platform for academicians, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAs an <strong>Open access CS journal low APC</strong> option, INDJCST ensures that accepted papers are freely accessible worldwide while maintaining rigorous peer-review standards and ethical publication practices.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">💻 📚 Scope of Computer Science Research</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>🖱️ Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔌 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧮 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal encourages interdisciplinary research that demonstrates practical computing applications across industries and academic domains.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🚀 ⭐ Why Choose This Open Access CS Journal Low APC?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>⚡ Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decisions delivered within 3 days ensure genuine <strong>fast publication</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🌍 Full Open Access:</strong> Articles are freely accessible, increasing visibility through <strong>Google Scholar</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost APC:</strong> Affordable publication fees support researchers globally.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 UGC CARE Compliance:</strong> Adherence to recognized academic publishing standards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🛡️ Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Strict screening to ensure originality and quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis balance of <strong>low APC</strong>, ethical review, and <strong>rapid publication</strong> makes it an excellent choice for authors in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">📊 🔎 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Google Scholar</li>\r\n<li>📘 Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n<li>📖 SSRN</li>\r\n<li>🌐 WorldCAT</li>\r\n<li>📊 Dimensions</li>\r\n<li>📈 PlumX</li>\r\n<li>📚 ResearchBIB</li>\r\n<li>📄 Scribd & ISSUU</li>\r\n<li>📂 DRJI, I2OR, EuroPub, Academic Keys</li>\r\n<li>🏛️ Exlibris (Clarivate) & Thomson Reuters – Research ID</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚙️ ⏱️ Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 submission portal</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Peer Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis transparent workflow supports efficient and ethical <strong>fast publication</strong> in an open access computer science journal.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💲 💡 Article Processing Charges (Low APC)</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Other than Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese <strong>low cost</strong> APC options make high-quality open access publishing accessible to researchers worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">📬 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to a trusted <strong>Open access CS journal low APC</strong> that ensures visibility, ethical standards, and <strong>rapid publication</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1e88e5; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">\r\n👉 Submit Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(373,'2026-02-25 08:22:38','2026-02-25 08:22:38','tags/Jx8L3IQAGPsU21zMyj8HilABlmOHB2T8TeU9HL3A.jpg','Top Google Indexed AI & ML Journals for Indian PhD Scholars 2026','Tag','top-google-indexed-ai-ml-journals-for-indian-phd-scholars-2026','Top Google Indexed AI & ML Journals for Indian PhD Scholar