ards, and efficient review.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1e88e5; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">\r\n👉 Submit Your Paper Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(376,'2026-02-25 08:24:52','2026-02-25 08:24:52','tags/56H2UETSGnfJnZWZX8IucyhtgX82pzOvuZqCDMk7.jpg','Best Machine Learning Journals with DOI and Indexing','Tag','best-machine-learning-journals-with-doi-and-indexing','Best Machine Learning Journals with DOI and Indexing','Explore the best machine learning journals with DOI and indexing, fast publication, UGC CARE compliance, low APC, and Google Scholar visibility.','Best Machine Learning Journals with DOI and Indexing','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Best Machine Learning Journals with DOI and Indexing</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFor researchers in **machine learning**, publishing in journals that offer both DOI and strong indexing ensures global visibility, citation tracking, and academic recognition. The **best machine learning journals with DOI and indexing** combine rigorous peer review with fast publication workflows, transparent fees, and broad discoverability across scholarly platforms such as **Google Scholar**.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nKey features to look for include permanent DOI assignment, indexing in major databases, **UGC CARE** compliance, open-access availability, and efficient publication timelines. These features help you maximize the impact of your machine learning research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 What Makes a Machine Learning Journal “Best”?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📌 DOI assigned for every accepted article</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in **Google Scholar** and reputable databases</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Fast publication** options to reduce delays</li>\