 learning and related areas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing in journals with permanent DOI and strong indexing ensures that your machine learning research is easily discoverable, citated, and recognized globally.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 How to Choose the Right Journal</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Verify indexing in **Google Scholar** and other top databases</li>\r\n<li>📜 Confirm DOI assignment and citation tracking</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Check for documented **fast publication** timelines</li>\r\n<li>💰 Evaluate APC structures to find **low cost** options</li>\r\n<li>📘 Review recent published papers for quality and relevance</li>\r\n<li>📚 Ensure ethical compliance, such as UGC CARE or COPE</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nEvaluating journals with these parameters helps you select the most suitable venue for your machine learning research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Machine Learning Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(377,'2026-02-25 08:25:56','2026-02-25 08:25:56','tags/rMlPqk09maBThFQGukvUgx4T2p6bS8tSJqphxwje.jpg','Google Scholar Indexed CS Journal with Low Cost Publication','Tag','google-scholar-indexed-cs-journal-with-low-cost-publication','Google Scholar Indexed CS Journal with Low Cost Publication','Discover a Google Scholar indexed CS journal with low cost fees, fast publication, UGC CARE compliance and ethical peer review for research visibility.','Google Scholar Indexed CS Journal with Low Cost Publication','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">🔎 Google Scholar Indexed CS Journal with Low Cost Publication</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nResearchers seeking a **Google Scholar indexed CS journal with low cost** publication often look for platforms that balance affordability, visibility, and rigorous scholarly standards. An ideal journal combines **low cost** article processing, **fast publication** timelines, **UGC CARE** compliance, and indexing in globally recognized discovery systems like **Google Scholar** to maximize reach and impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, peer-reviewed open-access **computer science** journal that meets these needs. Published three times a year, INDJCST provides an affordable avenue for authors to share original research and review articles with global visibility and ethical publishing standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAs a trusted **Google Scholar indexed CS journal with low cost**, INDJCST supports authors in achieving timely research dissemination and increased citation potential through broad indexing and structured editorial workflows.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">📊 Covered Research Areas</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain & Distributed Systems</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n<li>🔌 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal welcomes interdisciplinary work that applies computing technologies to real-world problems and advanced scientific inquiries.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🚀 Why Choose This Journal?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🔎 Google Scholar Indexing:</strong> Enhanced visibility and discoverability across global research platforms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable fees for authors in India and around the world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>⚡ Fast Publication:</strong> Efficient peer-review process ensures timely dissemination of research.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 UGC CARE Compliance:</strong> Ethical publishing aligned with recognized academic standards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🛡️ Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Rigorously screened to ensure originality and quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese combined features make it a reliable **Google Scholar indexed CS journal with low cost** fees and strong academic integrity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚡ Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 24/7 Online Submission</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Acknowledgment – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Peer Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis transparent workflow supports **rapid publication** while maintaining rigorous peer review and quality assurance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💲 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Authors Outside India:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe **low cost** fee structure makes publishing affordable while maintaining global visibility and academic impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">📬 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to a **Google Scholar indexed CS journal with low cost** fees that ensures ethical peer review, global dissemination, and fast publication timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1e88e5; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">\r\n👉 Submit Your Paper Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(378,'2026-02-25 08:25:59','2026-02-25 08:25:59','tags/rbLZO7VA27QjwZopMYbmUi1Ck2IQZweO3NvV1q8N.jpg','How to Publish AIML Research Papers – Step by Step Guide','Tag','how-to-publish-aiml-research-papers-step-by-step-guide','How to Publish AIML Research Papers – Step by Step Guide','Learn how to publish AIML research papers with fast publication, DOI, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing in 2026.','How to Publish AIML Research Papers – Step by Step Guide','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">How to Publish AIML Research Papers</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing <strong>AIML (Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning) research papers</strong> requires strategic planning, strong methodology, and selecting the right indexed journal. In 2026, researchers should focus on journals that provide <strong>fast publication</strong>, DOI assignment, <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, and transparent <strong>low cost</strong> article processing charges.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Step 1: Choose a Strong AIML Research Topic</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSelect a relevant and trending topic in AIML such as:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🟣 Deep Learning & Neural Networks</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Natural Language Processing (NLP)</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Computer Vision & Image Processing</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Reinforcement Learning</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Explainable AI (XAI)</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Predictive Analytics & Data Mining</li>\r\n<li>🟣 AI for Healthcare, Finance, or Smart Cities</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Cloud-based & Edge AI Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nEnsure your topic addresses a real-world problem and provides measurable improvements over existing methods.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Step 2: Conduct Quality Research & Experiments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nYour AIML research paper should include:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📌 Clear problem statement and objectives</li>\r\n<li>📚 Literature review from indexed journals</li>\r\n<li>🧪 Detailed methodology and dataset explanation</li>\r\n<li>📊 Experimental results with performance metrics</li>\r\n<li>📈 Comparative analysis with baseline models</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Discussion of limitations and future work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nStrong experimentation improves peer-review acceptance chances and supports <strong>rapid publication</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 Step 3: Select an Indexed Journal</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nChoose journals that offer:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔍 Indexing in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and global databases</li>\r\n<li>📌 DOI for accepted papers</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Short review cycle for <strong>fast publication</strong></li>\r\n<li>💰 Transparent and <strong>low cost</strong> APC</li>\r\n<li>📚 Compliance with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> and ethical standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFor example, the <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) publishes AIML, data science, and computing research with DOI assignment, indexing, and efficient peer review.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Step 4: Prepare & Format the Manuscript</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFollow the journal’s author guidelines carefully:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📄 Structured abstract (objective, method, results, contribution)</li>\r\n<li>📝 Proper citations and referencing style</li>\r\n<li>📊 High-quality figures, graphs, and tables</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Plagiarism check before submission</li>\r\n<li>📜 Ethical declarations and copyright forms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nProper formatting reduces revision time and speeds up acceptance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Step 5: Submit & Respond to Reviewers</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAfter submission:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>⏳ Receive acknowledgment within 12–24 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Peer review conducted by subject experts</li>\r\n<li>📢 Acceptance/revision decision communicated</li>\r\n<li>📌 DOI assigned upon acceptance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nRespond professionally to reviewer comments and submit revisions promptly to maintain the <strong>fast publication</strong> timeline.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#E53935; margin-top:25px;\">🔴 Common Mistakes to Avoid</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>❌ Submitting without plagiarism check</li>\r\n<li>❌ Ignoring journal formatting rules</li>\r\n<li>❌ Weak experimental validation</li>\r\n<li>❌ Choosing non-indexed or predatory journals</li>\r\n<li>❌ Poor response to reviewer feedback</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Final Tips for AIML Researchers</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📚 Stay updated with current AI & ML trends</li>\r\n<li>🔬 Use benchmark datasets for validation</li>\r\n<li>📈 Focus on innovation and practical impact</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Choose indexed journals with DOI and visibility</li>\r\n<li>💰 Consider journals with <strong>low cost</strong> APC and strong credibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing AIML research papers becomes easier when you combine quality research, proper journal selection, and strategic submission planning. Following this step-by-step guide increases your chances of acceptance and global research visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your AIML Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(379,'2026-02-25 08:26:56','2026-02-25 08:26:56','tags/LMdndk8YzbIoF7YgQsHK0Ze6ZyYqfnWuFUnFWXWK.jpg','Affordable Deep Learning Journals for Engineering Researchers','Tag','affordable-deep-learning-journals-for-engineering-researchers','Affordable Deep Learning Journals for Engineering Researchers','Explore affordable deep learning journals for engineering researchers with fast publication, low APC, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing.','Affordable Deep Learning Journals for Engineering Researchers','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Affordable Deep Learning Journals for Engineering Researchers</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nEngineering researchers working on **deep learning** often seek journals that offer a balance of affordability, speed, and academic credibility. **Affordable deep learning journals for engineering researchers** combine **low cost** article processing charges (APCs), **fast publication** workflows, and reputable indexing (such as **Google Scholar**) to maximize the visibility and impact of your research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAn example of such a platform is the <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300), an open-access journal that supports high-quality research in deep learning, AI, data science, and broader computer science disciplines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1E88E5; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Key Features of Affordable Deep Learning Journals</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>💰 Transparent and **low cost** APC models</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Fast publication** and efficient peer review</li>\r\n<li>📚 Compliance with **UGC CARE** and ethical standards</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in **Google Scholar** and global databases</li>\r\n<li>📌 DOI assigned for permanent citation tracking</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Open access for broad international visibility</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ Rigorous peer review to ensure quality research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing in such journals allows you to share impactful work in deep learning without large financial barriers, while ensuring your research is recognized and cited.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43A047; margin-top:25px;\">🟢 Core Research Areas in Deep Learning</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🟣 Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN)</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Recurrent Neural Networks (RNN) and LSTM</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Transformer Models and Attention Mechanisms</li>\r\n<li>🟠 Deep Reinforcement Learning</li>\r\n<li>🔴 Generative Adversarial Networks (GAN)</li>\r\n<li>🟡 Explainable Deep Learning</li>\r\n<li>🟣 Deep Learning for Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🟢 Natural Language Processing (NLP)</li>\r\n<li>🔵 Edge and Cloud Deep Learning Systems</li>\r\n<li>🟠 AI for Healthcare and Smart Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese interdisciplinary domains represent impactful areas where engineering researchers frequently produce cutting-edge contributions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#FB8C00; margin-top:25px;\">🟠 How to Identify the Right Journal</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🔎 Confirm indexing in **Google Scholar** and other respected databases</li>\r\n<li>📜 Verify DOI assignment for all accepted papers</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Look for documented **fast publication** process</li>\r\n<li>💰 Compare APC fees to ensure affordability</li>\r\n<li>📚 Ensure ethical practices like **UGC CARE** and COPE compliance</li>\r\n<li>📘 Evaluate recent publications for relevance and quality</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nCareful selection helps you publish in reputable venues that elevate the visibility and credibility of your deep learning research.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8E24AA; margin-top:25px;\">🟣 Example: INDJCST – Affordable & Indexed</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> is an example of an **affordable deep learning journal for engineering researchers** that offers:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>💰 Affordable APC structure</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Fast publication** with efficient peer review</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Indexed in **Google Scholar** and international databases</li>\r\n<li>📌 DOI assigned for each published article</li>\r\n<li>📚 Compliance with **UGC CARE** and ethical guidelines</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Open access for broad dissemination and citation visibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing in journals with these features enhances both the reach and impact of your deep learning work without significant cost.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949AB; margin-top:25px;\">🔵 Ready to Publish Your Deep Learning Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript to an **affordable deep learning journal for engineering researchers** that offers **fast publication**, **UGC CARE** compliance, **Google Scholar** indexing, and DOI assignment to maximize your academic impact.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1E88E5; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(380,'2026-02-25 08:27:06','2026-02-25 08:27:06','tags/w2pUXVVVEDyhQdIpRv5hu6CGkUgt2jQHGGrcR9eD.jpg','Fast Publication Low Cost Computer Science Journal','Tag','fast-publication-low-cost-computer-science-journal','Fast Publication Low Cost Computer Science Journal','Explore a fast publication low cost computer science journal with UGC CARE compliance, Google Scholar indexing and ethical peer review for global visibility.','Fast Publication Low Cost Computer Science Journal','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">🚀 Fast Publication Low Cost Computer Science Journal</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nFor researchers and academicians seeking a **fast publication low cost computer science journal**, the ideal platform should offer strong academic standards, efficient editorial workflows, and global visibility without high article processing charges. This combination supports timely dissemination of research while ensuring integrity and reach.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 