ng> APC, and efficient publication timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1e88e5; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(406,'2026-02-25 09:59:08','2026-02-25 09:59:08','tags/eYYcV3eNCo0BQr7G7LKeXoOE11qCVOttPDlhJPMu.jpg','Computer Science Journal Submission Guidelines | INDJCST','Tag','computer-science-journal-submission-guidelines-indjcst','Computer Science Journal Submission Guidelines | INDJCST','Computer science journal submission guidelines with fast publication, low cost APC, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing.','Computer Science Journal Submission Guidelines | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Computer Science Journal Submission Guidelines – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) provides clear and transparent <strong>computer science journal submission guidelines</strong> to ensure high-quality, ethical, and efficient publication. As a peer-reviewed, open-access journal in <strong>computer science</strong>, INDJCST supports researchers, academicians, and industry professionals with a structured and author-friendly process.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAligned with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards and indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, the journal ensures academic credibility while offering <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>rapid publication</strong>, and a <strong>low cost</strong> open-access model. Authors are encouraged to carefully follow the guidelines below for smooth and timely review.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">📄 <span style=\"color:#e53935;\">Manuscript Preparation Guidelines in</span> <span style=\"color:#43a047;\">Computer Science</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit original, unpublished research in computer science or related interdisciplinary fields.</li>\r\n<li>📚 Include a clear title, abstract (150–250 words), keywords, introduction, methodology, results, discussion, and conclusion.</li>\r\n<li>📑 Follow a standard referencing format (APA/IEEE recommended).</li>\r\n<li>📊 Ensure all tables, figures, and graphs are properly labeled and cited.</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Maintain originality; similarity index must meet plagiarism policy standards.</li>\r\n<li>🔗 DOI will be assigned to accepted articles (if selected).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nCareful adherence to these computer science journal submission guidelines ensures faster peer review and smooth processing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚡ Submission & Review Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Online submission through the editorial portal (24/7 access).</li>\r\n<li>📩 Initial acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n<li>👨⚖️ Double-blind peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n<li>✅ Acceptance/Rejection decision within 3 days.</li>\r\n<li>📄 Instant PDF publication with certificate upon acceptance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nOur structured workflow supports <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> while maintaining strict academic standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00897b; margin-bottom:15px;\">🌍 Scope of Submission</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nINDJCST welcomes submissions in major areas of computer science, including:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Computer Vision & Image Processing</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>📡 Embedded Systems</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💳 Article Processing Charges – Low Cost Model</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nTo maintain open-access availability and indexing benefits, minimal charges apply after acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">📚 Indexing & Compliance</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>🌍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and major academic databases</li>\r\n<li>📜 Publication Ethics following COPE Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n<li>🏛️ Alignment with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Strict plagiarism screening policy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ef6c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">📢 Ready to Submit Your Manuscript?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nFollow the above <strong>computer science journal submission guidelines</strong> and submit your manuscript to a trusted journal offering <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, <strong>low cost</strong> APC, and guaranteed <strong>fast publication</strong>.\r\