>🗄️ Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe journal welcomes interdisciplinary research and practical computing advancements that contribute to global scientific progress.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">⭐ Why Choose This International Journal?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🌍 **DOI Assignment:** Permanent digital identifiers for all published articles enhance citation tracking and discoverability.</li>\r\n<li>💰 **Low Fee Publishing:** Affordable article processing charges for authors worldwide.</li>\r\n<li>⚡ **Fast Publication:** Rapid peer review ensures timely research dissemination.</li>\r\n<li>🔎 **Google Scholar Indexing:** Improved visibility and citation potential.</li>\r\n<li>📜 **UGC CARE & COPE Compliance:** Ethical publishing aligned with acknowledged standards.</li>\r\n<li>🛡️ **Plagiarism Protection:** Ensures originality and academic integrity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚙️ ⏱️ Publication Workflow</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Online Submission – 24/7 access</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Acknowledgment – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Peer Review – Completed in 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 DOI Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis structured process supports both **rapid publication** and academic quality without compromising peer-review standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💲 Article Processing Charges – Low Fee</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>