C, and guaranteed <strong>rapid publication</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1e88e5; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(416,'2026-02-25 10:14:30','2026-02-25 10:14:30','tags/MQzkponXDVierxK2ZIKZqES1hWkpCnFZJWL7SnBy.jpg','Fast Publication Computer Science Journals List','Tag','fast-publication-computer-science-journals-list','Fast Publication Computer Science Journals List','Explore fast publication computer science journals with rapid peer review, low cost fees, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing for global visibility.','Fast Publication Computer Science Journals List','<div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">⚡ Fast Publication Computer Science Journals</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nWhen you’re searching for **fast publication computer science journals**, you need options that balance speedy peer review, academic credibility, and research visibility. Leading journals in this category focus on rapid editorial decisions, transparent workflows, **low cost** article processing, **UGC CARE** compliance, and indexing in top platforms like **Google Scholar**.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> is an example of a reputable, peer-reviewed journal that supports **fast publication** while maintaining high standards of academic integrity and global accessibility. It is recognized for its efficient review process, structured editorial management, and broad coverage of computer science disciplines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAs part of a reliable **fast publication computer science journals** list, INDJCST offers a balanced publishing experienc