px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔥 Featured Fast Publication Journal – INDJCST</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> stands out among **fast publication computer science journals** due to its efficient editorial workflow and commitment to quality. Its structured peer review process delivers decisions rapidly without compromising scholarly integrity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>⚡ Rapid peer review with decisions in 3 days</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Indexed in Google Scholar and major databases</li>\r\n<li>💰 Low or affordable fees</li>\r\n<li>📜 Ethical publishing under UGC CARE and COPE guidelines</li>\r\n<li>📄 Open access visibility for global impact</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#fb8c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">⏱️ Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 access</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Acknowledgment – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Peer Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThis transparent workflow supports efficient and reliable **fast publication** for authors in the computer science domain.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💲 Affordable Article Processing Fees</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Authors Outside India:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese **low 