view – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF availability</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe streamlined workflow ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> while maintaining high-quality peer review.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💲 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe transparent <strong>low cost</strong> fee structure supports accessible publication for researchers worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">📬 Ready to Publish Online?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nSubmit your manuscript today to a trusted <strong>online computer science journal</strong> offering <strong>fast publication</strong>, strong <strong>Google Scholar</strong> visibility, and alignment with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1e88e5; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">\r\n👉 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(441,'2026-02-25 10:37:37','2026-02-25 10:37:37','tags/JeangQcFiYP8mGfAeiKuyDTGTIUhurc6QhiEFv1W.jpg','Submit Computer Science Research Paper Online | Fast Publication | INDJCST','Tag','submit-computer-science-research-paper-online-fast-publication-indjcst','Submit Computer Science Research Paper Online | Fast Publication | INDJCST','Submit computer science re