ience</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<strong>Computer science online science</strong> platforms enable researchers to publish innovative findings quickly and reach a global audience. Today’s authors prefer journals that provide <strong>fast publication</strong>, <strong>low cost</strong> article processing charges, compliance with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines, and strong indexing in databases such as <strong>Google Scholar</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a trusted open-access journal supporting <strong>computer science online science</strong> research across diverse domains. It ensures rigorous peer review combined with a <strong>rapid publication</strong> process while maintaining academic excellence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublished three times annually, the journal serves academicians, engineers, researchers, and industry professionals who seek efficient and credible online publication in <strong>computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔬 💻 Key Research Areas</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>💻 Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⛓️ Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n<li>🧮 Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>🧬 Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>🗄️ Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese topics reflect the evolving scope of <strong>computer science online science</strong> and interdisciplinary technological advancements.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#43a047; margin-bottom:15px;\">🚀 Benefits of Publishing Online</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>⚡ Fast Publication:</strong> Peer review decisions within 3 days ensure timely dissemination.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>💰 Low Cost APC:</strong> Affordable fees for Indian and international authors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🌍 Open Access:</strong> Immediate global reach and citation potential.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>🔎 Google Scholar Indexing:</strong> Improved research visibility and academic impact.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\"><strong>📜 UGC CARE & COPE Compliance:</strong> Ethical and transparent publishing standards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThese advantages make it a reliable destination for <strong>computer science online science</strong> publication with credibility and efficiency.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">⏱️ Simple & Rapid Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Online Submission – 24/7 editorial portal</li>\r\n<li>⏳ Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍🔬 Peer Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>📩 Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nThe streamlined workflow ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> while upholding strict peer-review quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💲 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin