le=\"color:#3949ab; margin-bottom:15px;\">📌 Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 submission portal</li>\r\n<li>📩 Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>✅ Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF & digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💳 Article Processing Charges – Low Cost Publication</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nAs an open-access journal, articles are freely available online. A minimal fee applies after acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">🖥️ Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>📊 Author Dashboard with real-time tracking</li>\r\n<li>📑 Automated acceptance letters & copyright forms</li>\r\n<li>⬇️ Easy download of certificates & published papers</li>\r\n<li>🔄 Transparent workflow from submission to rapid publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ef6c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">📢 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nIf you are searching for <strong>research journals in computer science</strong> with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, <strong>low cost</strong> APC, and <strong>fast publication</strong> support, INDJCST is your ideal destinat