parency, efficiency, and ethical publishing standards to ensure <strong>rapid publication</strong> without compromising research quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00897b; margin-bottom:15px;\">📚 Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nINDJCST is indexed in major databases including:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nGoogle Scholar, Scribd, ISSUU, Elsevier Mendeley, EuroPub, DRJI, Academic Keys, Edocr, I2OR, PDFSR, ResearchBIB, SSRN, WorldCAT, Exlibris (Clarivate), Thomson Reuters Research ID, Semantic Scholar, Dimensions, PlumX.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#3949ab; margin-bottom:15px;\">📌 Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>📝 Submit Online – 24/7 submission portal</li>\r\n<li>📩 Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨‍⚖️ Expert Review – Completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>✅ Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Publication & Certificate – Instant PDF access</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💳 Article Processing Charges – Low Cost Model</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nAs an open-access journal, articles are freely accessible online. Minimal charges apply after acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#2e7d32; margin-bottom:15px;\">🖥️ Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>📊 Author Dashboard with real-ti