st & Rapid Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>📩 Submission acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>👨⚖️ Peer review completed within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>✅ Editorial decision within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Instant online publication upon acceptance</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Indexed visibility through <strong>Google Scholar</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nOur streamlined workflow guarantees <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> while maintaining high scholarly standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💳 Low APC – Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nMinimal APC applies only after manuscript acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ef6c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">📢 Submit Your Extended Networking Paper Today</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nPublish your extended conference paper in a reliable <strong>computer networks journal for conference extension</strong> offering <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, affordable <strong>low cost</strong> APC, and guaranteed <strong>fast publication</strong> with <strong>rapid publication</strong> timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1e88e5; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r