\nThe <strong>computer science impact factor</strong> reflects how frequently journal articles are cited within a specific period, indicating research influence and scholarly reach. A strong impact factor in computer science demonstrates consistent publication quality, global readership, and academic recognition.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nBy ensuring high editorial standards, DOI assignment, and indexing in platforms like <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, INDJCST strengthens citation performance and academic credibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">💻 <span style=\"color:#e53935;\">Journal Scope</span> <span style=\"color:#43a047;\">in Computer Science</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>⚙️ Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>🔗 Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n<li>📊 Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nThe journal welcomes interdisciplinary research that demonstrates real-world applications and measurable contributions to computer science innovation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#00897b; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚡ Why Choose INDJCST for Impact & Visibility?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>👨⚖️ Peer-reviewed refereed journal</li>\r\n<li>📜 UGC CARE aligned standards</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and multiple databases</li>\r\n<li>💰 Affordable <strong>low cost</strong> Article Processing Charges</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Transparent <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong></li>\r\n<li>🔍 Strict plagiarism policy</li>\r\n<li>📑 Publication ethics under COPE Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n<li>📈 Strong academic visibility supporting computer science impact factor growth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">🚀 Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>📩 Submit online 24/7</li>\r\n<li>⏱️ Initial response within 12 hours</li>\r\n<li>🔎 Expert peer review within 2 days</li>\r\n<li>✅ Decision notification within 3 days</li>\r\n<li>📄 Instant publication & digital certificate</li>\r\n<li>🔗 DOI provided for citation tracking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nThis structured system supports both research excellence and improved computer science impact factor visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ef6c00; margin-bottom:15px;\">💳 Low APC – Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nMinimal publication charges apply only after manuscript acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6d4c41; margin-bottom:15px;\">📢 Ready to Publish Your Research?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nEnhance your research visibility and contribute to a growing <strong>computer science impact factor</strong> journal with <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Schol