ience publications in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">🔬 <span style=\"color:#e53935;\">Core Scientific Domains</span> <span style=\"color:#43a047;\">in Computer Science</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks & Distributed Systems</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔗 Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>⚙️ Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n<li>📊 Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nWe welcome innovative, interdisciplinary, and application-driven research that contributes to scientific and technological progress in computer science.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#8e24aa; margin-bottom:15px;\">⚡ Why Choose INDJCST for Science Publications?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>👨⚖️ Peer-reviewed refereed journal</li>\r\n<li>📜 UGC CARE aligned publishing standards</li>\r\n<li>🌍 Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and major indexing platforms</li>\r\n<li>⚡ Transparent <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> workflow</li>\r\n<li>💰 Affordable <strong>low cost</strong> Article Processing Charges (APC)</li>\r\n<li>🔍 Strict plagiarism screening policy</li>\r\n<li>🔗 DOI provided for every accepted article</li>\r\n<li>📈 Strong academic visibility and measurable citation impact</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nOur advanced editorial management system ensures research quality while maintaining efficient turnaround times.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💳 Low Cost Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nOpen-access publication requires minimal APC only after manuscript acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6d4c41; margin-bottom:15px;\">📢 Ready to Publish Your Scientific Work?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nSubmit your <strong>science publications in computer science</strong> to a trusted journal offering <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, affordable <strong>low cost</strong> APC, and guaranteed <strong>fast publication</strong> with <strong>rapid publication</strong> timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1e88e5; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(539,'2026-02-26 06:47:41','2026-02-26 06:47:41','tags/QrtOlXLDlyGPQphiBLL5zynjSthwgkuIH3NCBHgk.jpg','Electronic Journal in Computer Science | Fast Publication','Tag','electronic-journal-in-computer-science-fast-publication','Electronic Journal in Computer Science | Fast Publication','Electronic journal in computer science with fast publication, low cost APC, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing','Electronic Journal in Computer Science | Fast Publication','<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Electronic Journal in Computer Science – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nAn <strong>electronic journal in computer science</strong> provides instant global access, digital archiving, and seamless research dissemination. The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputed open-access electronic journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research across emerging and core areas of <strong>computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST strictly follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and implements a rigorous peer-review process to maintain academic integrity. Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, the journal enhances discoverability and citation tracking worldwide. With a streamlined digital editorial workflow, we ensure <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> at a <strong>low cost</strong>, making it a preferred electronic journal in computer science for researchers and PhD scholars.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e88e5; margin-bottom:15px;\">💻 <span style=\"color:#e53935;\">Digital Research Domains</span> <span style=\"color:#43a047;\">in Computer Science</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n<li>📊 Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n<li>🌐 Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n<li>☁️ Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔐 Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n<li>📡 Computer Networks & Distributed Systems</li>\r\n<li>🖼️ Image Processing & Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>🧠 Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>📱 Web Technologies & Mobile Computing</li>\r\n<li>🔗 Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n<li>⚙️ Software Engineering & Programming Languages</li>\r\n<li>🤖 Robotics & Automation</li>\r\n<li>📊 Information Systems & Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nWe welcome inno