nce, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, affordable <strong>low cost</strong> APC, and guaranteed <strong>fast publication</strong> with <strong>rapid publication</strong> timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1e88e5; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(540,'2026-02-26 06:49:23','2026-02-26 06:49:23','tags/TgLSjrWMDltqSjqIIaXGBCdzSTUznbwd3lwOeMOy.jpg','Science Magazine Article in Computer Science | INDJCST','Tag','science-magazine-article-in-computer-science-indjcst','Science Magazine Article in Computer Science | INDJCST','Science magazine article in computer science with fast publication, low cost APC, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing.','Science Magazine Article in Computer Science | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Science Magazine Article in Computer Science – INDJCST</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nPublishing a <strong>science magazine article in computer science</strong> helps communicate innovative research, technological advancements, and applied solutions to a broad academic and professional audience. The <strong>Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) serves as a reputed open-access platform for high-quality research and scholarly articles in <strong>computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;\">\r\nINDJCST strictly follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> guidelines and ensures a rigorous peer-review process to maintain academic excellence. Indexed in <strong>Google Scholar</strong>, the journal enhances global visibility and citation tracking. With an efficient editorial workflow, we offer <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong> at a <strong>low cost</strong>, making it a trusted destination for publishin