ient turnaround times.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d81b60; margin-bottom:15px;\">💳 Low Cost Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\nOpen-access publication requires minimal APC only after manuscript acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For Indian Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n<li>Without DOI: 1200 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n<li>With DOI: 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>For International Authors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\n<li>With DOI: $80 USD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0;\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#6d4c41; margin-bottom:15px;\">📢 Ready to Publish Your Science Magazine Article?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\">\r\nSubmit your <strong>science magazine article in computer science</strong> to a trusted journal offering <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliance, <strong>Google Scholar</strong> indexing, affordable <strong>low cost</strong> APC, and guaranteed <strong>fast publication</strong> with <strong>rapid publication</strong> timelines.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#1e88e5; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px;\">\r\nStart Submission Today\r\n</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>'),(541,'2026-02-26 06:51:07','2026-02-26 06:51:07','tags/hig8BHrHAzSlo9cKBkmXNPwdus9p2RJTKCVfV4Oj.jpg','International Computer Science Journal Publication with DOI','Tag','international-computer-science-journal-publication-with-doi','International Computer Science Journal Publication with DOI','International computer science journal publication with DOI, fast publication, low cost APC, UGC CARE compliance and Google Scholar indexing','International Computer Science Journal Publication with DOI','<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:20px