<h2><span class=\"icon\">🚀</span>Why Choose INDJCST?</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>⚡ <strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Editorial decisions finalized within 3 days.</li>\r\n    <li>🌍 <strong>Open Access:</strong> Big Data studies available worldwide without restriction.</li>\r\n    <li>🔄 <strong>Streamlined Workflow:</strong> Quick 24/7 submission support and automated communication.</li>\r\n    <li>🛡️ <strong>Integrity Assured:</strong> Comprehensive plagiarism checks applied to every manuscript.</li>\r\n    <li>✅ <strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Upholding established ethical publishing guidelines.</li>\r\n    <li>📈 <strong>Impactful Outcomes:</strong> Research influences academic fields, industry standards, and policy-making globally.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">🔍</span>Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n  <p>Articles published in INDJCST are indexed by reputed databases including Google Scholar, Elsevier Mendeley, Semantic Scholar, SSRN, Dimensions, WorldCAT, EuroPub, ExLibris, and PLumX. This ensures that research on <em>Big Data frameworks (Hadoop, Spark)</em> gains high international discoverability, positioning INDJCST as one of the <em>best Computer Science journals</em>.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">📝</span>Publication Process</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>⏰ <strong>Submission:</strong> Instant paper submission via online system</li>\r\n    <li>💬 <strong>Acknowledgment:</strong> Confirmation within 12 hours</li>\r\n    <li>🔬 <strong>Expert Review:</strong> Completed in 2 working days</li>\r\n    <li>📩 <strong>Decision:</strong> Acceptance/rejection issued within 3 days</li>\r\n    <li>📄 <strong>Publication:</strong> Instant PDF access with digital certificate</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2><span class=\"icon\">💰</span>Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>🇮🇳 <strong>Indian Authors:</strong> Without DOI – 1200 INR + GST | With DOI – 1400 INR + GST</li>\r\n    <li>🌎 <strong>International Authors:</strong> With DOI – 80 USD</l