Triannual</div>\r\n        <div>Compliance: UGC-CARE &amp; COPE</div>\r\n        <div>Open Access</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Overview -->\r\n    <section class=\"card\">\r\n      <h3>Overview — Network Intrusion Detection Systems (NIDS)</h3>\r\n      <p>INDJCST is a reputable, open-access venue for high-quality research across Computer Science and Technology. We welcome submissions on <strong>network intrusion detection systems (NIDS)</strong>, covering signature-based and anomaly-based detection, AI-augmented detection pipelines, flow-based monitoring, encrypted-traffic analysis, explainability in NIDS, adversarial resilience, and large-scale deployment studies. Authors focused on NIDS research will find INDJCST provides discoverability among the <em>Best Computer Science journals</em> and editorial standards aligned with UGC-CARE.</p>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Why choose (different icon per point) -->\r\n    <section class=\"card\">\r\n      <h3>Why Choose INDJCST?</h3>\r\n      <ul class=\"features\">\r\n\r\n        <li class=\"feature\">\r\n          <!-- icon: check-circle -->\r\n          <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden>\r\n            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></circle>\r\n            <path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n          </svg>\r\n          <div>\r\n            <strong>Rapid Peer Review</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"small\">We aim for timely decisions (within 3 days) while maintaining rigorous review — vital for NIDS researchers releasing time-sensitive threat-detection results.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </li>\r\n\r\n        <li class=\"feature\">\r\n          <!-- icon: globe -->\r\n          <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden>\r\n            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></circle>\r\n            <path d=\"M2 12h20M12 2v20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path>\r\n          </svg>\r\n          <div>\r\n            <strong>Open Access Policy</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"small\">Immediate open access ensures NIDS research reaches security operators, industry practitioners, and policymakers worldwide — amplifying impact among the <em>Best Computer Science journals</em>.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </li>\r\n\r\n        <li class=\"feature\">\r\n          <!-- icon: clock -->\r\n          <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden>\r\n            <path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\r\n            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></circle>\r\n          </svg>\r\n          <div>\r\n            <strong>Efficient Process</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"small\">From submission to publication, our editorial system and automated workflows make it simple to track multi-stage NIDS experiments and reproducible benchmarks.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </li>\r\n\r\n        <li class=\"feature\">\r\n          <!-- icon: shield-check -->\r\n          <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden>\r\n            <path d=\"M12 2l7 4v6c0 5-3.8 9.6-7 10-3.2-.4-7-5-7-10V6l7-4z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\"></path>\r\n            <path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n          </svg>\r\n          <div>\r\n            <strong>Plagiarism Protection &amp; COPE Compliance</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"small\">All submissions are screened for plagiarism and the journal follows COPE guidelines. We expect transparent reporting of datasets, evaluation metrics, and ethical considerations for datasets used in NIDS studies.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </li>\r\n\r\n        <li class=\"feature\">\r\n          <!-- icon: rocket -->\r\n          <svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden>\r\n            <path d=\"M5 19c1-2 4-4 7-4s6 2 7 4c0 1-1 2-3 2s-4-1-4-1-2 1-4 1-4-1-4-2z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\"></path>\r\n          </svg>\r\n          <div>\r\n            <strong>Impact Beyond Academia</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"small\">We publish work that informs security operations and product development — especially applied NIDS studies that report detection rates, false positives, deployment costs, and scalability metrics.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </li>\r\n\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Indexing & Abstracting -->\r\n    <section class=\"card\">\r\n      <h3>Indexing &amp; Abstracting</h3>\r\n      <p class=\"small\">INDJCST is discoverable across platforms that increase visibility and citation potential. Inclusion across these services helps reach researchers looking for reputable outlets among the <em>Best Computer Science journals</em>.</p>\r\n      <p class=\"small\"><strong>Platforms:</strong> Google Scholar, Scribd, ISSUU, Elsevier Mendeley, EuroPub, DRJI, Academic Keys, Edocr, I2OR, PDFSR, ResearchBIB, SSRN, WorldCAT, Exlibris, Thomson Reuters Research ID, Semantic Scholar, Dimensions, PlumX.</p>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Publication process timeline -->\r\n    <section class=\"card\">\r\n      <h3>Our Streamlined Publication Process</h3>\r\n      <p class=\"small\">We balance speed and editorial rigour. Typical timelines (author-facing):</p>\r\n      <ul class=\"small\">\r\n        <li>Submit Online: 24/7 submission through our editorial management system</li>\r\n        <li>Initial Response: Acknowledgement within 12 hours</li>\r\n        <li>Expert Review: Peer review completed in ~2 days</li>\r\n        <li>Decision Notification: Acceptance/rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n        <li>Publication &amp; Certificate: Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Article Processing Charges -->\r\n    <section class=\"card\">\r\n      <h3>Article Processing Charges (APC)</h3>\r\n      <p class=\"small\">Open-access publishing requires a nominal APC to cover hosting, DOIs (optional), and continuous publication. Fees are collected after manuscript acceptance.</p>\r\n      <table class=\"apc-table\" aria-describedby=\"apc-description\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n          <tr><th>Article Type</th><th>For Indian Authors</th><th>For Other than Indian Authors</th></tr>\r\n        </thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n          <tr><td>Case Report / Original / Review</td><td>Without DOI: ₹1,200 + 18% GST<br>With DOI: ₹1,400 + 18% GST</td><td>With DOI: $80 USD</td></tr>\r\n        </tbody>\r\n      </table>\r\n      <p id=\"apc-description\" class=\"small\">Secure payment and official invoices are provided. Authors receive electronic certificates and DOI details (if chosen).</p>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Editorial tools -->\r\n    <section class=\"card\">\r\n      <h3>Advanced Editorial Management System</h3>\r\n      <p class=\"small\">Authors receive a personalized dashboard, real-time tracking, automated acceptance letters, copyright forms, and one-click downloads — useful for tracking experiments, code repos, and evaluation datasets used in NIDS research.</p>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Closing SEO paragraph -->\r\n    <section class=\"card\">\r\n      <h3>Network Intrusion Detection Systems (NIDS) — Research Priorities</h3>\r\n      <p>INDJCST actively solicits reproducible and rigorous research on <strong>network intrusion detection systems (NIDS)</strong>. Topics of interest include anomaly detection for encrypted traffic, AI-driven NIDS, real-world evaluations, benchmark datasets, explainability for security analysts, adversarial robustness, and deployment studies. Authors seeking reputable venues among the <em>Best Computer Science journals</em> will find INDJCST combines discoverability, UGC-CARE alignment, and rapid editorial decisions to accelerate the impact of your NIDS research.</p>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n  </main>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>','Cybersecurity','INDJCST — Network intrusion detection systems (NIDS)','INDJCST (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) — Open access computer science journal. Explore research on network intrusion detection systems (NIDS), anomaly detection, signature-based & AI-enhanced NIDS. Submit to one of the Best Computer Science journals','2025-09-17 15:53:33','2025-09-17 15:53:33',NULL),(16,'Cryptography and secure communication','<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n  <meta name=\"title\" content=\"INDJCST - Cryptography and Secure Communication\">\r\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"INDJCST is one of the Best Computer Science journals focusing on Cryptography and Secure Communication. Explore peer-reviewed, open-access research articles.\">\r\n  <title>INDJCST - Cryptography and Secure Communication</title>\r\n  <style>\r\n    body {font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.6;}\r\n    header {text-align: center; padding: 30px;}\r\n    h1 {color: #5a2d0c;}\r\n    h2 {margin-top: 30px; color: #333;}\r\n    section {padding: 20px 40px;}\r\n    ul {margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;}\r\n    .icon {margin-right: 8px; color: #5a2d0c;}\r\n    .highlight {font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50;}\r\n    footer {text-align: center; padding: 20px; background: #f7f7f7; margin-top: 30px;}\r\n  </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n  <header>\r\n    <h1>INDJCST – Cryptography and Secure Communication</h1>\r\n    <p><span class=\"highlight\">The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</span> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a leading open-access research platform ranked 