l Response:</b> Acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n      <li><b>Expert Review:</b> Completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n      <li><b>Decision:</b> Acceptance/rejection within 3 days.</li>\r\n      <li><b>Publication & Certificate:</b> Instant access to PDFs and certificates.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2>💰 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n    <p>To sustain open-access availability, a minimal publication fee is charged after acceptance:</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Indian Authors: Without DOI – 1200 INR + 18% GST | With DOI – 1400 INR + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li>International Authors: With DOI – $80 USD</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section>\r\n    <h2>🖥️ Advanced Editorial Management</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><b>Author Dashboard:</b> Track your submissions and progress.</li>\r\n      <li><b>Real-time Tracking:</b> Monitor paper review and decisions live.</li>\r\n      <li><b>Automated Documents:</b> Instant acceptance letters & copyright forms.</li>\r\n      <li><b>Easy Downloads:</b> Certificates & published articles accessible in one click.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <footer>\r\n    <p>© 2025 Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST). All Rights Reserved.</p>\r\n  </footer>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>','Cybersecurity','INDJCST - Cryptography and Secure Communication','INDJCST is one of the Best Computer Science journals focusing on Cryptography and Secure Communication. Explore peer-reviewed, open-access research articles','2025-09-17 15:54:24','2025-09-17 15:54:24',NULL),(17,'Serverless architecture and functions','<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n  <title>INDJCST - Serverless Architecture and Functions</title>\r\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"INDJCST publishes high-quality research in Serverless Architecture and Functions. Explore one of the Best