indings\r\n    that advance the field.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <p>\r\n    INDJCST follows UGC-CARE guidelines and a rigorous peer-review process to ensure every submission meets the highest standards.\r\n    As a refereed journal among the <strong>Best Computer Science journals</strong>, we are committed to credibility and integrity in academic publishing.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>📌 Why Choose INDJCST?</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>⚡ <strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Decisions within 3 days without compromising quality — useful for time-sensitive cloud migration research.</li>\r\n    <li>🌍 <strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Immediate access ensures cloud-native and hybrid cloud research reaches researchers, practitioners, and policymakers worldwide.</li>\r\n    <li>⏱️ <strong>Efficient Process:</strong> Streamlined submission-to-publication workflow for reproducible migration studies and case reports.</li>\r\n    <li>🔎 <strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Rigorous screening to maintain academic integrity.</li>\r\n    <li>✔️ <strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> We follow COPE best practices for ethical publishing.</li>\r\n    <li>🌐 <strong>Impact Beyond Academia:</strong> Research that informs cloud strategy, industry practice, and public policy — contributing to lists of the <em>Best Computer Science journals</em>.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>📑 Indexing &amp; Abstracting</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    INDJCST is discoverable via Google Scholar, Mendeley, SSRN, Dimensions, WorldCat, Exlibris and other services — helping authors reach audiences who evaluate the\r\n    <strong>Best Computer Science journals</strong>.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>🔄 Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    Submit Online → Acknowledgement within 12 hours → Expert review in ~2 days → Decision within 3 days → Instant PDF and certificate on publication.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>💰 Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    For Indian Authors: Without DOI — ₹1,200 + 18% GST; With DOI — ₹1,400 + 18% G