 that consult the <strong>Best Computer Science journals</strong>.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>🔬 Key Challenges in Building Quantum Systems</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    Building practical quantum systems requires tackling multiple interconnected problems — from fragile qubits and error correction to control electronics and system integration. INDJCST welcomes rigorous studies that diagnose, measure, and propose solutions for these obstacles.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>🔎 Common Technical Topics</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>🧪 <strong>Qubit Coherence & Decoherence:</strong> Materials, noise sources, and techniques to extend coherence times.</li>\r\n    <li>🔧 <strong>Scalability & Modular Integration:</strong> Interconnects, packaging, cryogenics, and architectures for scaling qubit counts.</li>\r\n    <li>🛡️ <strong>Error Correction & Fault Tolerance:</strong> Practical codes, overhead estimation, and resource trade-offs for real-world systems.</li>\r\n    <li>⚙️ <strong>Control Electronics & Classical Interface:</strong> Low-noise control, timing, calibration, and classical-quantum co-design.</li>\r\n    <li>📏 <strong>Calibration, Benchmarking & Verification:</strong> Standardized metrics, reproducible benchmarks, and verification protocols for quantum devices.</li>\r\n    <li>🔐 <strong>Security & Side-Channel Risks:</strong> Implementation vulnerabilities, side-channels, and safe deployment practices.</li>\r\n    <li>💡 <strong>Algorithm–Hardware Co-Design:</strong> Tailoring algorithms to hardware constraints and vice versa for practical advantage.</li>\r\n    <li>🌱 <strong>Resource & Supply-Chain Constraints:</strong> Materials, fabrication variability, and testing at scale.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2>🔄 Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    Submit Online (24/7) → Acknowledgement within 12 hours → Expert review in ~2 days → Decision within 3 days → Instant PDF & digital certificate on publication.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>💰 Article Processing Charges (Low Cost Journal Pub