ick responses at every stage.</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-red\">🛡️</span>Plagiarism Protection – Ensuring academic integrity.</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">✅</span>COPE Compliance – Following international ethical standards.</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">💡</span>Impact Beyond Academia – Research that drives change.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🔍</span>Google Scholar, Scribd, ISSUU, Mendeley, EuroPub, DRJI</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">📚</span>ResearchBIB, SSRN, WorldCAT, Exlibris, Dimensions, PLumX</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Our Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-orange\">📝</span>Submit Online – Anytime, 24/7 submission system</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">📬</span>Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">🔍</span>Peer Review – Completed in 2 days</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-red\">📢</span>Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🏆</span>Instant Publication & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n    <p>As an open-access <strong>Indian computer science journal</strong>, INDJCST ensures free global access. Minimal publication fees apply after manuscript acceptance:</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">🇮🇳</span>Indian Authors: ₹1200 + GST (without DOI) / ₹1400 + GST (with DOI)</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🌏</span>International Authors: $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">👤</span>Author Dashboard for tracking submissions</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">📊</span>Real-time Paper Status Updates</li>\r\n      <li><span class