"highlight\">UGC care list computer science journals</span> for its commitment to transparency, open access, and research integrity.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Focus Areas of INDJCST Journal</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">💡</span>Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">📊</span>Data Science & Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-orange\">🌐</span>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-red\">☁️</span>Cloud & Edge Computing</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🔐</span>Cybersecurity & Cryptography</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">💻</span>Software Engineering & Programming</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-orange\">📡</span>Computer Networks & Network Security</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-red\">🤖</span>Robotics & Embedded Systems</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🧬</span>Bioinformatics & Health Informatics</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Why Choose INDJCST Journal?</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">⚡</span>Rapid Peer Review – Decisions within 3 days.</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">🌍</span>Open Access Policy – Global visibility for your research.</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-orange\">🕒</span>Efficient Workflow – Quick responses and smooth publication.</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-red\">🛡️</span>Plagiarism Protection – Ensuring academic integrity.</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">✅</span>COPE Compliance – Adhering to ethical publishing standards.</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">💡</span>Impact Beyond Academia – Research that shapes technology and society.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Indexing & Abstracting</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🔍</span>Google Scholar, Scribd, ISSUU, Elsevier Mendeley, EuroPub, DRJI</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">📚</span>ResearchBIB, SSRN, WorldCAT, Exlibris (Clarivate), Dimensions, PLumX</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Our Streamlined Publication Process</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-orange\">📝</span>Submit Online – 24/7 editorial management system</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">📬</span>Initial Response – Within 12 hours</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">🔍</span>Peer Review – Completed in 2 days</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-red\">📢</span>Decision Notification – Within 3 days</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🏆</span>Instant Publication & Digital Certificate</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Article Processing Charges</h2>\r\n    <p>Being a <strong>UGC care list computer science journal</strong>, <strong>INDJCST</strong> provides open-access publishing at affordable rates:</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">🇮🇳</span>Indian Authors: ₹1200 + GST (without DOI) / ₹1400 + GST (with DOI)</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🌏</span>International Authors: $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Advanced Editorial Management System</h2>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-blue\">👤</span>Personalized Author Dashboard</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-green\">📊</span>Real-time Paper Status Tracking</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-orange\">📄</span>Automated Letters & Forms</li>\r\n      <li><span class=\"icon icon-red\">⬇️</span>Easy Download of Certificates & Published Papers</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"cta\">\r\n      <h3>Ready to Publish in INDJCST Journal?</h3>\r\n      <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\">Submit Your Paper Now</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>','computer science journal','INDJCST Journal – UGC Care List Computer Science Journal for Quality Research','INDJCST Journal is one of the top UGC care list computer science journal