dius:6px;\">\r\n  Submit Now\r\n</a>','computer science journal','Autonomous Systems Journals | Low-Cost Fast Publication | INDJCST','Publish in autonomous systems journals with INDJCST. Low-cost, fast and rapid publication, UGC CARE aligned, Google Scholar indexed, peer-reviewed computer science journal. Submit your paper today','2025-11-08 05:26:03','2025-11-08 05:26:03',NULL),(66,'ISSN approved Engineering Journal for paper publishing','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  ISSN Approved Engineering Journal for Paper Publishing\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is a reputable, open-access journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research papers across all domains of Computer Science and Technology. Published three times a year, INDJCST serves as a reliable platform for academicians, educators, researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to share their findings and contribute to the advancement of the field.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\r\n  INDJCST adheres to <strong>UGC-CARE guidelines</strong> and follows a rigorous peer-review process, ensuring that every submission meets the highest standards of scholarly excellence. As a refereed journal, we are committed to maintaining credibility and integrity in academic publishing, offering researchers a trusted space to showcase their work.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💠 Topics Section -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💻</span> Research Areas Covered\r\n</h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Software Engineering and Programming Languages</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n  <li>Human-Computer Interaction</li>\r\n  <li>Web Technologies and Mobile Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain Technology</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics and Automation</li>\r\n  <li>Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Computational Intelligence</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n  <li>Information Systems and Database Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\r\n  INDJCST welcomes <strong>interdisciplinary research</strong> and encourages submissions that demonstrate practical applications of computing technologies. All papers undergo a peer-review process ensuring <strong>academic integrity</strong> and <strong>rapid publication</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚡ Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚡</span> Why Choose INDJCST Journal?\r\n</h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid Peer Review:</strong> Get decisions within 3 days without compromising quality.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access Policy:</strong> Ensures global visibility for your research.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Efficient Process:</strong> From submission to publication in record time.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Plagiarism Protection:</strong> Rigorous screening ensures originality.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE Compliance:</strong> Adheres to publication ethics and integrity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impact Beyond Academia:</strong> Research that shapes global innovation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌟 Journal Features -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌟</span> INDJCST Features\r\n</h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n  <li>Peer-reviewed Refereed Journal</li>\r\n  <li>Easy, fast, transparent publication process</li>\r\n  <li>Strict Plagiarism Policy</li>\r\n  <li>Simple steps for publication of research and review articles</li>\r\n  <li>High Visibility & Indexing</li>\r\n  <li>COPE’s Best Practice Guidelines</li>\r\n  <li>Creative Commons License (By-NC-ND)</li>\r\n  <li>Good Impact Factor</li>\r\n  <li>Reputed Editorial Board</li>\r\n  <li>Fast Track Publication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing Section -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexing & Abstracting\r\n</h2>\r\n<p>INDJCST is indexed in globally recognized databases, ensuring wide visibility and scholarly reach.</p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Scribd</li>\r\n  <li>ISSUU</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Keys</li>\r\n  <li>Edocr</li>\r\n  <li>I2OR</li>\r\n  <li>PDFSR</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>SSRN</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>Exlibris (Clarivate)</li>\r\n  <li>Thomson Reuters - Research ID</li>\r\n  <li>Semantic Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Publication Process -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️</span> Our Streamlined Publication Process\r\n</h2>\r\n<p>Experience a transparent, author-friendly process from submission to publication:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Submit Online:</strong> 24/7 submission via our editorial system</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Initial Response:</strong> Acknowledgment within 12 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Expert Review:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Decision Notification:</strong> Acceptance or rejection within 3 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Publication & Certificate:</strong> Instant PDF access and digital certificate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Article Processing Charges -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n  As an <strong>open-access publication</strong>, INDJCST charges a minimal processing fee after manuscript acceptance:\r\n</p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>Without DOI: ₹1200 + 18% GST</li>\r\n      <li>With DOI: ₹1400 + 18% GST</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $60 (with DOI)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧠 Editorial Management -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03a9f4; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧠</span> Advanced Editorial Management System\r\n</h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Author Dashboard:</strong> Track submission status and updates</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Real-time Tracking:</strong> Monitor progress through every stage</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Automated Documents:</strong> Instant generation of acceptance letters</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Easy Downloads:</strong> Quick access to certificates and published papers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Submit Now -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Ready to Publish Your Research?\r\n</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n  Submit your manuscript today and experience <strong>low-cost</strong>, <strong>fast publication</strong> in an <strong>ISSN approved engineering journal</strong> trusted by <strong>Google Scholar</strong> and <strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliant researchers.\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    🔗 Submit Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>','computer science journal','ISSN Approved Engineering Journal for Paper Publishing | INDJCST','Publish your research in the Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST), an ISSN approved, low-cost, UGC CARE compliant engineering journal offering fast and rapid publication with Google Scholar indexing','2025-11-09 17:05:53','2025-11-09 17:05:53',NULL),(67,'Best International Journal in Computer Science |  Fast Publication | INDJCST','<h1 style=\"color:#0a4a8a; text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:20px;\">\r\n  Best International Journal in Computer Science – The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#444;\">\r\n  <strong>The Indian Journal of Computer Science and Technology (INDJCST)</strong> (e-ISSN: 2583-5300) is globally recognized as one of the <strong>best international journals in computer science</strong>, known for its <strong>low cost publication</strong>, <strong>fast peer review</strong>, <strong>UGC CARE compliance</strong>, and <strong>Google Scholar indexing</strong>. It offers a trusted and transparent platform for researchers to publish innovative studies in computer science and technology.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Published thrice a year, INDJCST is a peer-reviewed, open-access journal that ensures <strong>rapid publication</strong> without compromising academic excellence. The journal connects global researchers, engineers, and academicians in advancing the frontiers of <strong>computer science</strong> through quality publications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🌐 About INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#1a73e8; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🌐</span> About INDJCST – Best International Journal in Computer Science\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As the <strong>best international journal in computer science</strong>, INDJCST publishes original research papers, review articles, and technical reports across various domains. The journal follows <strong>UGC CARE</strong> standards and adheres to <strong>COPE ethical guidelines</strong>, offering <strong>fast publication</strong> and <strong>low cost</strong> accessibility for authors worldwide.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE</strong> compliant and <strong>Google Scholar indexed</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low cost</strong> and globally accessible publication.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rapid publication</strong> with peer review results within 3–5 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>COPE compliance</strong> ensures academic integrity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💡 Research Areas -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#e91e63; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💡</span> Research Areas Covered by INDJCST\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST covers all emerging and foundational domains of <strong>computer science</strong> and engineering, making it the <strong>best international journal in computer science</strong> for both theoretical and applied research. Authors from academia and industry can publish their studies under open-access visibility.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\r\n  <li>Data Science and Big Data Analytics</li>\r\n  <li>Internet of Things (IoT)</li>\r\n  <li>Cybersecurity and Cryptography</li>\r\n  <li>Cloud and Edge Computing</li>\r\n  <li>Blockchain and Software Engineering</li>\r\n  <li>Computer Networks and Network Security</li>\r\n  <li>Robotics, Automation, and Embedded Systems</li>\r\n  <li>Image Processing and Computer Vision</li>\r\n  <li>Bioinformatics and Health Informatics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- ⚙️ Why Choose INDJCST -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#9c27b0; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">⚙️</span> Why INDJCST is the Best International Journal in Computer Science\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST stands out as the <strong>best international journal in computer science</strong> due to its blend of affordability, speed, and academic rigor. It provides a seamless author experience through its <strong>rapid publication</strong> and strong global indexing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Publication:</strong> Affordable for students, researchers, and academicians.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Publication:</strong> Peer-reviewed decisions within 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UGC CARE Indexed:</strong> Academic recognition across Indian universities.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Google Scholar Indexed:</strong> Global research reach and visibility.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>High Quality Standards:</strong> Ensures originality, accuracy, and innovation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🕒 Publication Process -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#03a9f4; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🕒</span> Transparent and Fast Publication Workflow\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST follows a clear and efficient publication process designed for <strong>rapid publication</strong> and author satisfaction. Each manuscript is processed swiftly with quality peer review and editorial transparency.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Submit manuscript online (24/7 availability).</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Receive acknowledgment within 12 hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Peer review completed within 2 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Acceptance/rejection decision in 3 days.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Publication and DOI assignment within 5 days.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 💰 Article Processing Charges -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#f44336; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">💰</span> Affordable Article Processing Charges\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  As the <strong>best international journal in computer science</strong>, INDJCST maintains a <strong>low cost</strong> open-access model, allowing global researchers to publish quality work affordably.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li><strong>Indian Authors:</strong> ₹1200 (without DOI) / ₹1400 (with DOI) + 18% GST</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Authors:</strong> $80 USD (with DOI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Open Access:</strong> Free global access to all published papers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🔍 Indexing -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9800; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🔍</span> Indexed and Abstracted in Leading Databases\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  INDJCST is indexed in multiple international research repositories, ensuring academic visibility and recognition as one of the <strong>best international journals in computer science</strong>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Google Scholar</li>\r\n  <li>Elsevier Mendeley</li>\r\n  <li>EuroPub</li>\r\n  <li>DRJI</li>\r\n  <li>ResearchBIB</li>\r\n  <li>Dimensions</li>\r\n  <li>WorldCAT</li>\r\n  <li>PLumX Metrics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🧠 Editorial System -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#009688; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🧠</span> Advanced Editorial and Author Dashboard\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <li>Personalized dashboard for submission and tracking.</li>\r\n  <li>Instant generation of acceptance letters and certificates.</li>\r\n  <li>Real-time monitoring of review and publication status.</li>\r\n  <li>Quick access to published papers and digital archives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<!-- 🚀 Call to Action -->\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#4caf50; margin-top:30px; display:flex; align-items:center; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:22px; margin-right:8px;\">🚀</span> Publish in INDJCST – The Best International Journal in Computer Science\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  Publish your work in <strong>INDJCST</strong>, the <strong>best international journal in computer science</strong> with <strong>low cost publication</strong>, <strong>rapid review</strong>, and <strong>Google Scholar indexing</strong>. Join thousands of global researchers contributing to the advancement of technology and innovation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n  <a href=\"https://editorial.fdrpjournals.org/login?journal=6\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#1a73e8; color:#fff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">\r\n    📘 Submit Your Paper Now\r\n  </a>\r\n</p>','computer science journal','Best International Journal in Computer Science |  Fast Publication | INDJCST','INDJCST is the best international journal in computer science offering low cost, fast publication, rapid peer review, UGC CARE compliance, and Google Scholar indexing.','2025-11-09 19:59:23','2025-11-09 20:01:04',NULL);
